<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="EXO" style="id">LUGHURU BIBLE KULAWA 1ST DRAFT KULAWA</book>
  <para style="toc3">Kul</para>
  <para style="toc2">Kulawa</para>
  <para style="toc1">Ichitabu cha Kulawa</para>
  <para style="mt">ICHILONGOLE</para>
  <para style="ip">Ichitabu cha kulawa cholonga tsimbuli tsa Waisraeli pfawalawile mna isi ya Wamisiri, ako kwawakalile watumwa. Ichitabu achino china pfinu pfikulu pfine. (1) Ukulekelelighwa kwa Waeburaniya kulawa mna utumwa. (2) Pfawanzile ukughendela chidunda Sinai. (3) Imulungu kelaghana na iwanu wake ako Sinai, ako Imulungu tsakelangusa kuna wawo. Kuya kaweng'a malaghitso pfawobamighwa kukala ili kumnoghelesa yeye. (4) Ukutsengighwa kwa hanu ha ukutamanila ha Waisiraeli na malaghitso kwa walapfa inambiko na pfaibamighwa kumtamanila Imulungu. Chinu chikulu kubita pfose chitabu chino cholangusa chayatendile Imulungu, pfayawakombole iwanu wake iwakalile watumwa na kuwatenda taifa line lolelo kwa ghamatsuwa gha hambele. Imunu mkulu iyolongighwa ng'ani mchitabu chino taghwa lyake Musa, tsakasaghulighwa ne Imulungu kuwalongotsa iwanu wa Isiraeli kulawa Misiri. Chinu chingi ichimanyika ng'ani mchitabu chino, Ghamalaghitso longo limwe ghe Imulungu.</para>
  <para style="iot">Ighali mumo</para>
  <para style="io">Ichilongole</para>
  <para style="io">Waisraeli wolekelighwa kulawa Misiri 1.1-15, 21</para>
  <para style="io">Utumwa ako Misiri 1.1-22</para>
  <para style="io">Ukwelekighwa kwa Musa na ughima wake wa mwanduso 2.1-4,31</para>
  <para style="io">Musa na Aruni wehisanya na mfalume wa Misiri 5.1-11,10</para>
  <para style="io">Ipasaka na ukulawa Misiri 12.1-15, 21</para>
  <para style="io">Kulawa Bahari Ndughu kughenda Chidunda Sinai 15.22-18,27</para>
  <para style="io">Ghamalaghitso na Chilaghano 19.1-24,18</para>
  <para style="io">Chibumbulika ichihenzeluke na ghamalaghitso gha ukumtamanila Imulungu 25.1-40, 38.</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="EXO 1" />
  <para style="s">Waisraeli wodununzighwa ako Misiri</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 1:1" />Aghano ghagho ghamataghwa ghe iwana wa Isiraeli iwaghendile Misiri na aba wawo. Tsawaghenda na pinga tsawo na iwana wawo. <verse eid="EXO 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 1:2" />Iwanaghe awo tsa Rubeni, Simoni, Lawi, Yuda, <verse eid="EXO 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 1:3" />Isakari, Zabuloni, Benjamini, <verse eid="EXO 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 1:4" />Dani, Nafutali, Gadi na Asheri. <verse eid="EXO 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 1:5" />Iwana wose wa Yakobu na iwatsukulu wake tsawa iwanu sabini. Ghamatsuwa agho Yosefu ma tsa kakuko Misiri. <verse eid="EXO 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 1:6" />Matsuwa mengi aghabitile Yosefu kafa, kuya na ndughu tsake wose wafa na iwatsukulu wake wala wose wahupa. <verse eid="EXO 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 1:7" />Lekeni watsukulu wawo iwawalekile tsawongetseka ng'ani, tsa wawa wengi na wana ngupfu sideke, nawo tsawenela chila hanu mna isi ya Misiri.<verse eid="EXO 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 1:8" />Kuya matsuwa mengi aghabitile tsakalawila mfalume yungi kutawala ako Misiri, ayo tsang'amanyile baye ghatendile Yosefu. <verse eid="EXO 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 1:9" />Naye kawalongela iwanu wake, “Mlole Waisiraeli pfawali wengi na pfawali na ngupfu kubita twetwe. <verse eid="EXO 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 1:10" />Lelo twobamighwa tubame inzila ya kuwahungutsa na kuwatenda waleke kwongetseka, hela ing'ondo ing'alawila watselunga na iwanu iwotuhila na kwitowa na twetwe, kuya walawe mna isi aino.” <verse eid="EXO 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 1:11" />Apfo Wamisiri wasaghula wemilitsi wawemile Waisiraeli na kuwadununza kwa sang'ano ng'omu. Waisiraeli watenda sang'ano ya kumtsengela mfalume Farao imiji ya Pitomu na Ramesesi ya ukwikila tsimali tsake. <verse eid="EXO 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 1:12" />Lekeni pfawang'ali wowadununza, pfipfo Waisiraeli pfawang'ali wakwongetseka na ukwenela. Apfo Wamisiri wandusa kuwapfuka ng'ani Waisiraeli. <verse eid="EXO 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 1:13" />Wamisiri wawananahitsa Waisiraeli wasang'ane ng'onde ng'omu. <verse eid="EXO 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 1:14" />Wamisiri wawatenda wakale kwa usungu kwa kusang'ana ng'onde ng'omu ya kuhonda likando na kufatula ghamatofali, na sang'ano tsose tsa kumghunda. Mna sang'ano tsawo tsose tsawasang'ane, Wamisiri wang'ali wowadununza.<verse eid="EXO 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 1:15" />Kuya mfalume wa Misiri kawalongela iwakunga iwang'ali wowapfila iwapinga wa Waeburaniya, Shifira na Pua. <verse eid="EXO 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 1:16" />Kalonga, “Hamuwapfila iwapinga Waeburaniya ukweleka, yang'oneka mwana mmale mkomeni, ila yang'oneka imwana pinga mleke kumkoma.” <verse eid="EXO 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 1:17" />Lekeni kwaapfila iwakunga awo tsawampfuka Imulungu, ng'awatendile baye ka pfayalongile imfalume, wawaleka wawe waghima iwana iwamale. <verse eid="EXO 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 1:18" />Kuya mfalume kawakema iwakunga awo, kawaghutsa, “Ule mtendile pfino? Mbona mwowaleka waghima iwana wamale?”<verse eid="EXO 1:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 1:19" />Wamwidika, “Iwapinga Waeburaniya si ka iwapinga Wamisiri baye. Wawo wa ngangali, mkunga ng'ana yapfike baye wawo ma wakweleka.” <verse eid="EXO 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 1:20" />Apfo Imulungu kawatendela ghanoghile iwakunga awo, na Waisiraeli wongetseka na kuwa na ngupfu ng'ani. <verse eid="EXO 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 1:21" />Kwaapfila iwakunga awo tsawampfuka Imulungu, Imulungu kaweng'a iwana wawo iwenyegho. <verse eid="EXO 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 1:22" />Kuya Farao kawalaghitsa iwanu wake wose, kalonga, “Chila imwana mmale yakoneka kwa Waebraniya mwaseni mna mto Naili. Ila iwana iwapinga walekeni wawe waghima.”<verse eid="EXO 1:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="EXO 2" />
  <para style="s">Ukwelekighwa kwa Musa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 2:1" />Mna ghamatsuwa agho tsahana imunu yumwe wa lukolo lwa Lawi, ayo kamkwela pinga yumwe wa lukolo lulo lwa Lawi. <verse eid="EXO 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 2:2" />Ipinga ayo kakinda inda kuya keleka imwana mmale. Hayamwonile imwanaghe pfayanoghile, kampfisa kwa miyetsi midatu. <verse eid="EXO 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 2:3" />Lekeni hayang'ali ng'odaha baye kumpfisa keli, katawa chiseghe cha milala, kachikandika ilami chileke kwingitsa ghamatsi, kamwika imwana ayo mghati. Kuya kachika ichiseghe acho hana imitsani mmbalimbali mwa ghumto Naili. <verse eid="EXO 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 2:4" />Lumbu wake imwana ayo tsakepfisa habehi na ihanu aho, yone choni chitsomlawila imwana.<verse eid="EXO 2:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 2:5" />Kuya neghe Farao kahulumka mna ghumto Naili yakoghe, iwatumwa wake wapinga wang'ali wakwanga mmbalimbali mwe ghumto. Bahala kachona chiseghe chila mna imitsani, kamtuma imtumwa wake yachisole ichiseghe acho yamghalile. <verse eid="EXO 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 2:6" />Hayachipfughule, kamwona imwana mdodo kolila, kamwonela libatsi, kalonga, “Imwana yuno naye Mweburaniya.”<verse eid="EXO 2:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 2:7" />Kuya lumbu we imwana ayo kalawila, kamghutsa neghe Farao, “Pfii ng'ende kumkema ipinga yumwe wa Waeburaniya yakulele imwana ayu?”<verse eid="EXO 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 2:8" />Kamwidika, “Ona kamkeme.” Apfo chindele ayo koka, kaghenda kumkema wenye we imwana ayo. <verse eid="EXO 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 2:9" />Neghe Farao kamlongela ipinga ayo, “Msole imwana yuno undelele, kuya nitsokuliha.” Apfo ipinga ayo kamsola imwana ayo kamlela. <verse eid="EXO 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 2:10" />Imwana hayalekile kong'a, ipinga ayo kamghala kwa neghe Farao. Neghe Farao kamsola, kawa mwanaghe. Kalonga, “Kwaapfila nimpfabula mmatsi, nomkema Musa.”<verse eid="EXO 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Musa kotsumila Midiani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 2:11" />Musa hayakulile kaghenda kuwangila ndughu tsake Waeburaniya, kawona pfawang'ali woghaya kwa kusang'ana ng'onde ng'omu. Kamwona Mmisiri yumwe komtowa Mweburaniya miyaghe. <verse eid="EXO 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 2:12" />Musa kalola kuno na kuno, hayonile kuduhu munu wowose iyomlola, kamkoma Mmisiri ayo, kampfisa mna ghumsanga. <verse eid="EXO 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 2:13" />Ilupfi yake kaghenda keli, kawona Waeburaniya weli wetowa. Kuya kamghutsa ayula iyang'ali yomtowa miyaghe, “Ebali umtowa miyagho?”<verse eid="EXO 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 2:14" />Imunu ayo kamwidika, “Pfii kobama ung'ome ka pfaumkomile Mmisiri yula?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="EXO 2:14">Kuya Musa kapfuka, kelongela, “Iwanu ma wamanya chanitendile.” <verse eid="EXO 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 2:15" />Farao hayahulike apfo, tsakabama yamkome Musa. Lekeni Musa katsuma kaghenda kukala mna isi ya Midiani.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="EXO 2:15">Litsuwa limwe Musa tsakakala habehi na chisima cha ghamatsi. <verse eid="EXO 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 2:16" />Iwana saba wapinga wa mtambika wa Midiani wapfika, wadegha ghamatsi wamemesa pfinu pfa ukunwela ghamatsi iwanyama ili wawanwese iwang'olo na iwamene wa aba wawo. <verse eid="EXO 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 2:17" />Lekeni iwadimi wangi tsawatsa wawawinga iwapinga awo, baho Musa kenuka kawamila, kawadeghela ghamatsi iwanyama wawo. <verse eid="EXO 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 2:18" />Hawoyile kuna aba wawo Yetilo, pfipfila iyakemighwe Reueli, kawaghutsa, “Ebali leloli muya himahima?”<verse eid="EXO 2:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 2:19" />Wamwidika, “Mmisiri yumwe tsakatwamila, kawaghoma iwadimi waleke kutuwinga. Kuya pfipfila tsakatudeghela ghamatsi kawanwesa iwanyama wetu.”<verse eid="EXO 2:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 2:20" />Kawaghutsa iwanaghe, “Lelo yalikwani, ule mumlekile ako? Mkemeni yatse yaje ichijo na twetwe.”<verse eid="EXO 2:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 2:21" />Apfo Musa katoghola kukala kwa imunu ayo. Kuya imunu ayo kamwing'a Musa imwanaghe iyakemighwe Sipora yamkwele. <verse eid="EXO 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 2:22" />Sipora kamwelekela imwana mmale. Musa kelongela, “Nene namgheni mna isi ino, apfo nomkema Gereshomu.”<verse eid="EXO 2:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="EXO 2:23" />Miyaka mingi haibitile imfalume wa Misiri kafa. Waisiraeli tsawaghutilila kwa utumwa iwali nawo. Walila wabama Imulungu yawapfile, chililo chawo chimpfikila Imulungu. <verse eid="EXO 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EXO 2:24" />Imulungu kahulika chililo chawo, naye tsakakumbuka pfayalaghane na Abrahamu, Isaka, na Yakobu. <verse eid="EXO 2:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EXO 2:25" />Apfo Imulungu kawalola Waisiraeli, kawonela libatsi.<verse eid="EXO 2:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="EXO 3" />
  <para style="s">Imulungu komkema Musa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 3:1" />Litsuwa limwe Musa yang'ali yodima iwang'olo ne iwamene wa Yetiro, aba wake mkwe, imtambika wa Midiani, tsakalilongotsa kingilli lye iwanyama awo mbaka ubali ungi we inyika, kapfika Horebu chidunda cha Imulungu. <verse eid="EXO 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 3:2" />Baho malaika we IMNDEWA kamlawila ka lambi lya ghumoto ilikwaka mghati mwe chibagho. Musa kachona chibagho chakwaka ghumoto, lekeni ng'achilakala baye. <verse eid="EXO 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 3:3" />Kalonga, “Achi chihulo! Hebali chibagho chino ng'achilakala baye? Leka tanu ng'ende habehi mbone.”<verse eid="EXO 3:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 3:4" />IMNDEWA Imulungu hayonile Musa kakutsa habehi, kamkema kulawa mna ichibagho achila, kalonga, “Musa! Musa!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="EXO 3:4">Musa kedika, “Ooh.”<verse eid="EXO 3:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 3:5" />Imulungu kalonga, “Uleke kutsa habehi, tsula imikwabatsa yako, kwaapfila kwakwima hanu haenzeluke. <verse eid="EXO 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 3:6" />Nene na Imulungu wa iwabala wako, Abrahamu, Isaka na Yakobu.” Apfo Musa kapfisa uhanga wake, kwaapfila tsakapfuka kumlola Imulungu.<verse eid="EXO 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 3:7" />Kuya IMNDEWA kalonga, “Niwona iwanu wangu pfawodununzika ghendo ako Misiri na nihulika chililo chawo ichitendighwa na iwemilitsi wawo. Nomanya pfawodununzika, <verse eid="EXO 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 3:8" />apfo nihulumka kuwakombola mna ghamoko gha Wamisiri na kuwaghala mna isi inoghile, isi ine lidongo linoghile na inoghile kufughila iwanyama, isi yawokala Wakanani, Wahiti, Waamori, Waperisi, Wahipfi na Wayebusi. <verse eid="EXO 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 3:9" />Nihulika ghendo chililo che iwanu wangu, kuya mbona Wamisiri pfawowadununza. <verse eid="EXO 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 3:10" />Lelo nokutuma kwa Farao mfalume wa Misiri ukawalapfe iwanu wangu mna isi yake.”<verse eid="EXO 3:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 3:11" />Musa kamlongela Imulungu, “Angu nene nili nani mbaka nimghendele mfalume Farao na kuwalapfa Waisiraeli mna isi ya Misiri?”<verse eid="EXO 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 3:12" />Imulungu kamwidika, “Nene nitsakuwa hamwe naghwe, achino chitsakuwa chitango ka nene nikutuma. Hautsowalapfa Misiri iwanu, mtsonitambikila mna chidunda chino.”<verse eid="EXO 3:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 3:13" />Lekeni Musa kedika, “Hanitsowaghendela Waisiraeli na kuwalongela, ‘Imulungu wa iwabala wetu kanituma kuna mwemwe,’ Hawatsonighutsa ‘Taghwa lyake nani?’ Kuya nitsowalongelatse?”<verse eid="EXO 3:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 3:14" />Imulungu kamwidika, “Walongele apfino, ayula iyokemighwa ‘Nene yeye Yuyo, kanituma kuna mwemwe.’ ” <verse eid="EXO 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 3:15" />Walongele Waisiraeli, Nene na IMNDEWA, Imulungu we iwahenga wenu, Imulungu wa Abrahamu, Isaka na Yakobu nikutuma kuna wawo. Alino taghwa lyangu ghamatsuwa ghose, apfino pfipfo iwanu pfawatsonikema. <verse eid="EXO 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 3:16" />Ghenda uketingane na iwabala wa Isiraeli uwalongele, Imfalume, Imulungu wa aba tsenu, Imulungu wa Abrahamu, Isaka na Yakobu kandawila kalonga, Niwalola kuya mbona aghala ghamtendelighwa ako Misiri. <verse eid="EXO 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 3:17" />Nilamla niwalapfe mna maghayo ghenu ako Misiri na nitsowaghala mna isi ine lidongo linoghile na inoghile ukufughila iwanyama, yawokala Wakanani, Wahiti, Waamori, Waperisi, Wahiti na Wayebusi.<verse eid="EXO 3:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 3:18" />“Iwanu wangu watsokutegheletsa, ghweghwe na iwabala wa Waisiraeli mtsomghendela mfalume wa Misiri kumlongela, ‘IMNDEWA wa Waeburaniya, katulawila. Lelo utuleke tuke ghumwanza ghwa ghamatsuwa madatu kunyika, tukamtambikile Imfalume, Imulungu wetu.’ <verse eid="EXO 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 3:19" />Nomanya mfalume ayo wa Misiri ng'atsowalekelela baye mke mbaka ghumoko ghune ingupfu ghumnanaitse. <verse eid="EXO 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 3:20" />Apfo nitsogholosa ghumoko ghwangu ghune ngupfu kuitowa isi ya Misiri kwa pfihulo pfanitsotenda amwo. Hambele katsowalekelela mghende.”<verse eid="EXO 3:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 3:21" />“Kuya nitsowatenda Wamisiri wawakunde Waisiraeli, na hamkuka ng'amtsolawa ghamoko ghaliheka baye. <verse eid="EXO 3:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 3:22" />Chila ipinga Mweburaniya katsomlomba ipinga Mmisiri iyokala habehi yake, au mgheni yali mkaye mwake, yamwing'e pfinu pfa fetsa au pfa nzahabu hamwe na maghwanda. Mtsowapfatsa iwanenu iwamale ne iwapinga. Apfo pfipfo pfamtsowaboka Wamisiri pfinu pfawo.”<verse eid="EXO 3:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="EXO 4" />
  <para style="s">Imulungu komwing'a Musa ingupfu ya ukutenda pfihulo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 4:1" />Kuya Musa kamwidika IMNDEWA, “Lekeni tulonge ka Waisiraeli ng'awotoghola baye na ng'awohulikitsa baye chanilonga. Wang'alonga ghweghwe ng'undawile baye, nendetse?”<verse eid="EXO 4:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 4:2" />IMNDEWA kamwidika, “Acho choni chukindile mna ghumoko?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="EXO 4:2">Musa kedika, “Ng'weku.”<verse eid="EXO 4:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 4:3" />IMNDEWA kamlongela, “Yase hasi.” Musa hayasile hasi ing'weku ila ighaluka iwa inzoka, naye kapfuka katsuma. <verse eid="EXO 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 4:4" />Kuya Imulungu kamlongela Musa, “Winame umkinde ghumkila!” Musa kenama kamkinda ghumkila, baho inzoka ayo kaghaluka kawa ng'weku keli. <verse eid="EXO 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 4:5" />IMNDEWA kalonga, “Utende apfo ili watoghole ka IMNDEWA wa Abrahamu, Imulungu wa Isaka, Imulungu wa Yakobu kakulawila.”<verse eid="EXO 4:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 4:6" />IMNDEWA kamlongela keli Musa, “Wike ghumoko ghwako mna lighwanda lyako.” Musa katenda apfo, hayaghulapfile, ghuwa na ukoma, mtselu chwee! <verse eid="EXO 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 4:7" />Kuya Imulungu kalonga, “Wike keli ghumoko ghwako mna lighwanda lyako.” Naye katenda apfo, hayaghulapfile, ghuwa ka pfaghukalile mwanduso, ka lukuli lwake lwose pfaluli. <verse eid="EXO 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 4:8" />Imulungu kamlongela Musa, “Ka ng'awotoghola au ng'awokweghighwa na chihulo cha mwanduso, watsotoghola kwa chihulo cha kabili. <verse eid="EXO 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 4:9" />Lekeni ka ng'awatsotoghola pfihulo pfino pfili, udeghe ghamatsi mto Naili ughaghume muisi isakale. Ghamatsi agho ghatsakuwa idamu mna isi.”<verse eid="EXO 4:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 4:10" />Lekeni Musa kalonga, “Baye IMNDEWA uleke kunituma nene. Nene sidaha baye kulonga pfinoghile kulawa ghumwande, hata ghweghwe haulongile na nene mtumwa wako, nene nolonga lughalugha na lulimi lwangu lutito.”<verse eid="EXO 4:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 4:11" />Imulungu kamghutsa, “Angu yuhi yalumbile mlomo we imunu? Nani iyomtenda imunu yawe chibubu au chitsiwi? Pfii si nene baye Imulungu? <verse eid="EXO 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 4:12" />Lelo ughende! Nitsokwapfila ukulonga, nitsokulangulitsa cha ukulonga.”<verse eid="EXO 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 4:13" />Lekeni Musa kedika, “Mbe, Ghwe IMNDEWA wangu, nolomba umtume imunu yungi.”<verse eid="EXO 4:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 4:14" />Baho IMNDEWA kamwonela maya Musa, kamlongela, “Ooh! Pfii Haruni, kaka yako, wa lukolo lwa lawi? Nomanya yeye kodaha kulonga pfinoghile. Kuya kakutsa kwitingana naghwe, baho hayatsokona katsodeng'elela mmoyo mwake. <verse eid="EXO 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 4:15" />Ghweghwe ulonge naye na umlongele cha ukulonga. Nene nitsomwapfilani ukulonga, mwemwe mwose weli, nitsowalongela cha ukutenda. <verse eid="EXO 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 4:16" />Chaubamighwe ghweghwe kulonga ne iwanu, katsolonga Aruni. Naye katsakuwa ka mlomo wako, naghwe kutsakuwa ka Imulungu kuna yeye. <verse eid="EXO 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 4:17" />Uisole ng'weku ino mmoko, kwa ng'weku ino kutsotenda pfihulo pfila.”<verse eid="EXO 4:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Musa kakuya Misiri</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 4:18" />Kuya Musa koya kwa Yetiro mkwe yake, kamlongela, “Ndeke mbuye Misiri kuna ndughu tsangu niwone ka wang'ali waghima.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="EXO 4:18">Yetiro kalonga, “Ughende tseghamba.”<verse eid="EXO 4:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 4:19" />Musa hayang'ali Midiyani, IMNDEWA kamlongela, “Uye Misiri, kwaapfila wose iwabamile kukukoma ma wafa.” <verse eid="EXO 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 4:20" />Apfo Musa kamsola mwehe wake ne iwanaghe, kawadinitsa mna chihongwe, kandusa ghumwanza kaghenda Misiri, aku kasola ing'weku ila iyalongelighwe na Imulungu yaisole.<verse eid="EXO 4:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 4:21" />IMNDEWA kamlongela Musa, “Hautsopfika Misiri, kobamighwa utende hambele ha Farao pfihulo pfose pfanikwingi'le uwetso wa kupfitenda. Lekeni nene nitsomtenda Farao yawe msughu, naye ng'atsowalekelela Waisiraeli woke. <verse eid="EXO 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 4:22" />Naghwe kutsomlongela pfino Farao, Imulungu kolonga pfino, ‘Isiraeli mwanangu mmale, chaudele wangu! <verse eid="EXO 4:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EXO 4:23" />Nokulongela mleke mwanangu yoke, ili yakanitambikile. Lekeni ghweghwe kulema, lelo nitsomkoma mwanagho mmale, iyali chaudele wako.’ ”<verse eid="EXO 4:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="EXO 4:24" />Hayang'ali mnzila kuya Misiri, Musa tsakakala mna ing'anda ya kuwasila wagheni, Imulungu tsaketingana naye, na kabama yamkome. <verse eid="EXO 4:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EXO 4:25" />Baho Sipora kasola libwe ilitema, kaghana ligopfi lya imwanaghe na kamdolitsa nalo mmaghulu, kuya Sipora kalonga, “Kwa idamu ino iilawile ghweghwe kwa immale wangu ghendo.” <verse eid="EXO 4:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EXO 4:26" />Kuya Imulungu kamlekela Musa. Sipora tsakalonga, “Kwa idamu ino iilawile ghweghwe kwa immale wangu ghendo,” Kwaapfila tsakamwingitsa ngoma imwana.<verse eid="EXO 4:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="EXO 4:27" />Kuya IMNDEWA kamlongela Aruni, “Ghenda kulwanda uketingane na Musa.” Apfo Aruni kaghenda kwitingana na Musa mna chidunda chihenzeluke, hawetingane kamnonela. <verse eid="EXO 4:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EXO 4:28" />Kuya Musa kamlongela Aruni ghose ghayalongelighwe ne Imulungu, na pfihulo pfose pfayalaghitsighwe yapfitende. <verse eid="EXO 4:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="EXO 4:29" />Kuya Musa na Aruni tsawaghenda wawakema hamwe iwabala wose wa Waisiraeli. <verse eid="EXO 4:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="EXO 4:30" />Baho Aruni kawalongela ghose IMNDEWA ghayalongile na Musa, kuya Musa katenda pfihulo pfila hambele he iwanu wose. <verse eid="EXO 4:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="EXO 4:31" />Iwanu watoghola, na hawahulike ka IMNDEWA kawatsila Waisiraeli, na kawona pfawoghaya, wose wenama wamtamanila Imulungu.<verse eid="EXO 4:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="EXO 5" />
  <para style="s">Musa na Aruni hambele ha mfalume wa Misiri</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 5:1" />Kuya Musa na Aruni wamghendela mfalume wa Misiri, walonga, “Imfalume, Imulungu wa Isiraeli, kolonga apfi, ‘Walekelele iwanu wangu woke, wakanendele chihungo kulwanda.’ ”<verse eid="EXO 5:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 5:2" />Imfalume kawaghutsa, “Angu IMNDEWA Imulungu yali nani? Ebali nimtegheletse yeye na niwaleke Waisiraeli woke? Nene simmanyile baye IMNDEWA ayo, wala siwalekelela baye Waisiraeli woke.”<verse eid="EXO 5:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 5:3" />Musa na Aruni wamwidika, “Imulungu wa Waeburaniya tsaketingana na twetwe. Lelo tulekelele tughende kunyika kwa ghamatsuwa madatu tukamtambikile Imfalume, Imulungu wetu. Tung'aleka kutenda apfo, katsotukoma kwa utamu au kwa ing'ondo.”<verse eid="EXO 5:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 5:4" />Lekeni mfalume wa Misiri kawalongela, “Musa na Aruni, ebali mwobama kuwalapfa iwanu mna tsisang'ano tsawo? Walongeleni iwanu woye mna tsisang'ano tsawo!” <verse eid="EXO 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 5:5" />Kuya Farao kalonga, “Mlole, iwanu wenu wa wengi kubita Wamisiri, lelo mwobama weme kusang'ana!”<verse eid="EXO 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 5:6" />Litsuwa lilila Farao kawalaghitsa Wamisiri iwowemila iwanu, kalonga, <verse eid="EXO 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 5:7" />“Kulawa leloli mleke kuwaghalila iwanu wano mitsani ya ukufatulila matofali. Walekeni wenyegho waghende kuibama. <verse eid="EXO 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 5:8" />Lekeni wobamighwa watende matofali mengi ka aghala ighang'ali ghotendighwa mwanduso, lileke kuhunguka hata tofali limwe. Wahela ng'onde ya ukusang'ana, ndo mana wombama niwalekelele waghende kumlapfila nambiko Imulungu wawo! <verse eid="EXO 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 5:9" />Muwongetsele iwanu wano sang'ano ng'omu ng'ani waghaye, waleke kuhulikitsa ughutsu.”<verse eid="EXO 5:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 5:10" />Kuya iwemilitsi na iwakulu we iwanu wawaghendela Waisiraeli, walonga, “Farao kolonga apfino, ‘Sitsowaghalila keli imitsani. <verse eid="EXO 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 5:11" />Mwemwe muwenyegho mghende kuibama kwokwose kwamuyona, lekeni isang'ano yenu ng'aitsohunguka baye.’ ” <verse eid="EXO 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 5:12" />Apfo iwanu wapwililika Misiri yose kubama imitsani. <verse eid="EXO 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 5:13" />Nawo iwemilitsi wawo wawananaitsa, wawalongela, “Mmalitse sang'ano yenu ya chila litsuwa, ka pfawang'ali womghalilani imitsani.” <verse eid="EXO 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 5:14" />Wemilitsi Wamisiri tsawawatowa iwakulu we isang'ano wa Waisiraeli iwasaghulighwe wemile isang'ano, wawalongela, “Ebali ng'ammalitsa baye ing'onde yenu na ng'amtenda ka pfamng'ali mtendagha aho mwanduso?” <verse eid="EXO 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 5:15" />Baho iwakulu we isang'ano wa Waisiraeli wamghendela Farao, wamlilila, walonga, “Ule kwotutendela apfi twetwe iwatumwa wako? <verse eid="EXO 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 5:16" />Ng'atukwing'ighwa keli baye imitsani, aku twobamighwa kutenda matofali, kuya twetwe watumwa wako twotowighwa, lekeni iwatotsile iwanu wako.”<verse eid="EXO 5:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 5:17" />Lekeni Farao kalonga, “Mwa wadebwe mwemwe, mwolonga, ‘Tulekelele tughende tukamlapfile nambiko IMNDEWA,’ Kwaapfila ng'ambama baye ukusang'ana. <verse eid="EXO 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 5:18" />Lelo ghendeni mkasang'ane, ng'amtsakwing'ighwa imitsani yoyose, na mfatule matofali ka pfamng'ali mtendagha.” <verse eid="EXO 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 5:19" />Apfo awo iwakulu we Waisiraeli hawalongelighwe ka matofali ghawobamighwa kutenda chila litsuwa ghaleke kuhunguka, webona ka wamna maghayo.<verse eid="EXO 5:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 5:20" />Hawalawile kwa Farao, tsawetingana na Musa na Aruni yawang'ali wowabeta, <verse eid="EXO 5:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 5:21" />wawalongela, “IMNDEWA yalole chinu chino, yawahighe mwemwe kwaapfila mumtenda mfalume na iwakulu wa Misiri watuhile. Muweng'a imbuli ya ukutukomela twetwe!”<verse eid="EXO 5:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Musa komnung'unikila IMNDEWA</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 5:22" />Kuya Musa kamuhundukila IMNDEWA, kalonga, “Ghwe IMNDEWA ebali kowatendela ghehile iwanu wano? Ule unitumile? <verse eid="EXO 5:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EXO 5:23" />Kwaapfila kulawa hanighendile kulonga na Farao kwa taghwa lyako, kawatendela ghehile iwanu wano. Naghwe ng'utendile chinu chochose kuwakombola iwanu wako!”<verse eid="EXO 5:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="EXO 6" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 6:1" />Lekeni IMNDEWA Imulungu kamlongela Musa, “Sambi kutsakona chanitsomtendela Farao, kwaapfila kwa ghumoko ghwangu ghune ngupfu katsowawinga iwanu wangu woke muisi mwake.”<verse eid="EXO 6:1" /></para>
  <para style="s">Imulungu komkema Musa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 6:2" />Imulungu kamlongela Mose, “Nene na IMNDEWA. <verse eid="EXO 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 6:3" />Tsanimlawila Abrahamu, Isaka, na Yakobu, nimanyika ka Imulungu Yane ngupfu tsose, lekeni simanyike kuna wawo ka taghwa lyangu, Imfalume. <verse eid="EXO 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 6:4" />Kuya tsanilaghana nawo, kuweng'a isi ya Kanaani, isi yawakalile ka wagheni. <verse eid="EXO 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 6:5" />Pfipfila nihulika chililo cha Waisiraeli iwodununzighwa na Wamisiri, kuya nikumbuka laghano lyangu. <verse eid="EXO 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 6:6" />Apfo walongele Waisiraeli ka nene nowalongela pfino, ‘Nene na Imfalume, nitsowalapfa kwa Wamisiri na mtsoleka kuwasang'anila ng'onde ng'omu. Nitsowakombola kulawa mna utumwa wenu. Nitsakwinula ghumoko ghwangu ghune ngupfu na kuwatowa Wamisiri, na kuwakombola mwemwe. <verse eid="EXO 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 6:7" />Nitsowatenda mwemwe muwe wanu wangu, na nene nakuwa Imulungu wenu. Mtsomanya ka nene na IMNDEWA wenu ahala haniwalapfa mna tsing'onde tsa utumwa ako Misiri. <verse eid="EXO 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 6:8" />Na nene nitsowaghala mna isi yanilahile kumwing'a Abrahamu, Isaka na Yakobu. Nitsomwing'ani isi ayo iwe yenu. Nene na IMNDEWA.’ ”<verse eid="EXO 6:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 6:9" />Musa kawalongela Waisiraeli mbuli ayo, lekeni ng'awamuhilikitse baye kwaapfila tsawatenyuka ghumoyo kwa kusang'ana ng'onde tsa utumwa.<verse eid="EXO 6:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 6:10" />Kuya IMNDEWA kamlongela Musa, <verse eid="EXO 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 6:11" />“Ghenda umlongele mfalume wa Misiri yawalekelele Waisiraeli woke mna isi yake.”<verse eid="EXO 6:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 6:12" />Lekeni Musa kedika, “Ka Waisiraeli ng'awanihulikitse baye, angu Farao katsonihulikitsa? Nene sidahile baye kulonga pfinoghile.” <verse eid="EXO 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 6:13" />Kuya IMNDEWA kawalaghitsa Aruni na Musa wamghendele mfalume wa Misiri, na wawalapfe Waisiraeli mna isi ya Misiri.<verse eid="EXO 6:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Iwabala wa Musa na Aruni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 6:14" />Awano wawo iwatsukulu wa Isiraeli, yakemighwe Yakobu. Aghano ghamataghwa gha iwana wamale wa Rubeni, iyakalile imwana chaudele wa Isiraeli, Hanoko, Palu, Hesironi na Kalimi. Awano tsawakala iwabala wa kolo tsa Rubeni. <verse eid="EXO 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 6:15" />Iwana wa Simoni tsawakala, Yemueli, Yamini, Ohadi, Yakini, Sohari na Shauri, imwana wa pinga yumwe Mkanani. Awano tsawakala iwabala wa kolo tsa Simoni. <verse eid="EXO 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 6:16" />Aghano mataghwa gha iwana wa Lawi, ne watsukulu wake, Gashoni, Kohasi na Merari. Lawi tsakakala kwa miaka miya imwe na selasini na saba. <verse eid="EXO 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 6:17" />Iwana wa Gerishoni tsa Libini na Shimei, nawo tsawana watsukulu wengi. <verse eid="EXO 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 6:18" />Iwana wa Kohati tsa Amramu, Ishari, Hebuloni na Uzieli. Kohati tsakakala kwa miaka miya imwe na salasini na ndatu. <verse eid="EXO 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 6:19" />Iwana wa Merari tsa, Mahili na Mushi. Awano tsa iwabala wa kolo tsa Walawi.<verse eid="EXO 6:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 6:20" />Amramu tsakamkwela Yokebeli, lumbu wa aba wake, iyamwelekele Aroni na Musa. Amramu tsakakala miyaka miya imwe na salasini na saba. <verse eid="EXO 6:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 6:21" />Iwana wa Ishari tsa Kola, Nefagi, na Zikiri. <verse eid="EXO 6:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 6:22" />Iwana wa Uzieli tsa, Mishaeli, Elisafani na Sitiri. <verse eid="EXO 6:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EXO 6:23" />Aruni tsakamkwela Elisheba, neghe Abinadabu, lumbu jake Nashoni, naye Elisheba kamweleka Nadabu, Abihi, Eleazari na Itamari. <verse eid="EXO 6:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EXO 6:24" />Nawo iwana wa Kora tsa, Asiri, Elikana na Abiasafu. Awo tsa iwabala wa kolo tsa Kora. <verse eid="EXO 6:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EXO 6:25" />Eleasari imwana wa Aruni tsakamkwela neghe yumwe wa Putieli, naye pinga ayo kamwelekela Eleasari imwana iyakemighwe Fineasi. Awo tsa iwabala wa kolo tsa Lawi. <verse eid="EXO 6:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EXO 6:26" />Aruni na Musa iwo wawala iwalongelighwe ne IMNDEWA, “Tsilapfeni Misiri kolo tsa Isiraeli.” <verse eid="EXO 6:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EXO 6:27" />Kuya wawo iwo iwamlongele Farao, mfalume wa Misiri, yawalekele Waisiraeli.<verse eid="EXO 6:27" /></para>
  <para style="s">Imulungu kowalaghitsa Musa na Aruni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="EXO 6:28" />IMNDEWA hayalongile na Musa ako Misiri, <verse eid="EXO 6:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="EXO 6:29" />tsakamlongela, “Nene yuyo IMNDEWA. Mlongele Farao, mfalume wa Misiri, chila chinu chanikulongele.”<verse eid="EXO 6:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="EXO 6:30" />Lekeni Musa tsakamlongela IMNDEWA, “Nene sidahile baye kulonga pfinoghile, lelo Farao katsonihulikitsa?”<verse eid="EXO 6:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="EXO 7" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 7:1" />Kuya IMNDEWA kamlongela Musa, “Ulole, nene nokutenda ghweghwe uwe ka mulungu kwa Farao, na ndughu yako Aruni katsolonga ghaubamighwe ghweghwe kulonga. <verse eid="EXO 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 7:2" />Umlongele Aruni ghose ghanikulaghitsa, naye Aruni katsomlongela Farao yawalekelele Waisiraeli walawe mna isi yake. <verse eid="EXO 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 7:3" />Lekeni nitsomtenda Farao yawe msughu. Hata ning'atenda pfihulo na pfinu pfingi pfa kukangawatsa mna isi ya Misiri, <verse eid="EXO 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 7:4" />Farao ng'atsokuhulikitsa baye, baho nitsogholosa ghumoko ghwangu ghune ingupfu na kuitowa isi ya Misiri na nitsowalapfa iwanu wangu, kolo tsa Isiraeli. <verse eid="EXO 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 7:5" />Baho Wamisiri watsomanya ka nene na IMNDEWA hanitsogholosa ghumoko ghwangu niwatowe Wamisiri na kuwalapfa Waisiraeli walawe mna wawo.” <verse eid="EXO 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 7:6" />Musa na Aruni tsawatenda ka IMNDEWA pfayawalaghitse. <verse eid="EXO 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 7:7" />Hawalongile na Farao Musa tsakana miyaka semanini, naye Aruni tsakana miyaka semanini na mitadatu.<verse eid="EXO 7:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ng'weku ya Aruni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 7:8" />IMNDEWA tsakawalongela Musa na Aruni, <verse eid="EXO 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 7:9" />“Farao hang'awalongela, ‘Mtende chinu cha kukangawatsa,’ Mlongele Aruni asole ng'weku yake ayase hasi hambele ha Farao, nayo itsakuwa nzoka.” <verse eid="EXO 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 7:10" />Apfo Musa na Aruni wamghendela Farao watenda ka Imulungu pfayawalaghitse. Aruni tsakayasa ng'weku yake hambele ha Farao na iwatawala weyaghe, nayo iwa nzoka. <verse eid="EXO 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 7:11" />Lekeni Farao kawakema iwanu wake iwakengele na iwahawi wake, nawo iwahawi wa Misiri tsawatenda pfipfo kwa uhawi wawo. <verse eid="EXO 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 7:12" />Wasa ng'weku tsawo hasi, natso tsiwa nzoka, kuya ng'weku ya Aruni itsimetsa ng'weku tsawo. <verse eid="EXO 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 7:13" />Hata apfo Farao kaghendelela kuwa msughu, ng'awahulikitse baye, ka IMNDEWA pfayalongile.<verse eid="EXO 7:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ghumto Naili ghwakuwa idamu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 7:14" />Kuya IMNDEWA kamlongela Musa, “Farao ka msughu, kolema kuwalekelela iwanu woke. <verse eid="EXO 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 7:15" />Lelo ilupfi nemitondo mghendele Farao hayoghenda kumto. Umbete mmbalimbali mwe ghumto. Usole ing'weku ila iighaluke nzoka. <verse eid="EXO 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 7:16" />Kuya umlongele, ‘IMNDEWA wa Waeburaniya, kanituma kuna ghweghwe nikulongele uwalekelele iwanu wake woke kunyika wakamtamanile. Lekeni mbaka sambi ng'uhulikitse baye. <verse eid="EXO 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 7:17" />Lelo IMNDEWA kolonga pfino, kutsommanya ka yeye ka Imfalume. Nitsoghatowa ghamatsi gha ghumto Naili kwa ing'weku ino, nagho ghatsakuwa idamu. <verse eid="EXO 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 7:18" />Iwasomba iwali mna ghumto Naili watsakufa, ghumto ghose ghutsonung'a ghendo, na Wamisiri ng'awatsodaha ghendo ukunwa ghamatsi ghake.’ ” <verse eid="EXO 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 7:19" />IMNDEWA kamlongela Musa, “Mlongele Aruni yasole ing'weku yake yaigholose mchanya mwe ghamatsi gha Misiri, mchanya mwe imito yose, tsimbwibwi na matsiwa ghose ili ghawe idamu. Kutsakuwa na idamu muisi mwose, hata mna pfinu pfawo pfa mibiki pfakwikila ghamatsi na mna mabigha ghawo.” <verse eid="EXO 7:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 7:20" />Musa na Aruni tsawatenda ka IMNDEWA pfayawalaghitse. Aruni tsakenula ng'weku yake hambele ha Farao na iwatawala weyaghe, kaghatowa ghamatsi gha ghumto Naili, ghamatsi ghose ghawa idamu. <verse eid="EXO 7:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 7:21" />Iwasomba wafa, ghumto ghunung'a pfihile ghendo mbaka Wamisiri ng'awadahile baye ukunwa ghamatsi ghake. Isi yose tsaikala na idamu. <verse eid="EXO 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 7:22" />Lekeni wahawi wa Misiri nawo watenda pfipfo kwa uhawi wawo. Apfo Farao kaghendelela kuwa msughu, tsaiwa ka IMNDEWA pfayalongile, Farao ng'awahulikitse baye Musa na Aruni. <verse eid="EXO 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EXO 7:23" />Kuya Farao koya ukaye yake, ng'aghalangule baye aghala ighalawile. <verse eid="EXO 7:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EXO 7:24" />Wamisiri wose wahimbahimba mmbalimbali mwa ghumto Naili ili wapate ghamatsi gha ukunwa, kwaapfila ng'awadahile baye ukunwa ghamatsi gha ghumto.<verse eid="EXO 7:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="EXO 7:25" />Ghamatsuwa saba tsaghabita kulawa Imulungu hayaghutowile ghumto aghula.<verse eid="EXO 7:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="EXO 8" />
  <para style="s">Pfibutwa wakwenela isi yose</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 8:1" />Kuya IMNDEWA kamlongela Musa, “Ghenda kwa Farao umlongele, ‘Imulungu kolonga apfi, uwalekelele iwanu wangu woke wakanitamanile. <verse eid="EXO 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 8:2" />Ung'alema kuwalekela woke, nitsoitowa isi yako yose kwa kuighalila pfibutwa. <verse eid="EXO 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 8:3" />Ghumto Naili ghutsomema pfibutwa, nawo watsopfika mbaka mng'anda mwako, mna chiheleto chako cha kuwasa, mna lusatsi lwako, na mng'anda mwa pfilongotsi wayagho na iwanu wako. Pfibutwa awo watsakwingila mpfikong'o mwenu, hata mna pfinu pfenu pfa kukandila usaghe. <verse eid="EXO 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 8:4" />Pfibutwa watsodina mlukuli mwako, mna ng'uli tse iwanu wako na iwatawala weyagho.’ ”<verse eid="EXO 8:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 8:5" />Kuya IMNDEWA kamlongela Musa, “Mlongele Aruni yenule ng'weku yake mchanya mwe imito, mchanya mwe tsimbwimbwi na matsiwa, pfibutwa watsolawa mumo na ukwenela chila hanu mna isi ya Misiri.” <verse eid="EXO 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 8:6" />Apfo Aruni kagholosa ng'weku yake mchanya mwe ghamatsi ghose. Bahala pfibutwa walawila waighubika isi yose ya Misiri. <verse eid="EXO 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 8:7" />Lekeni wahawi wa Misiri kwa uhawi wawo nawo wawaghala pfibutwa mna isi ya Misiri.<verse eid="EXO 8:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 8:8" />Baho Farao kawakema Musa na Aruni, kawalongela, “Mlombeni IMNDEWA yawalapfe pfibutwa kuna nene na kwe iwanu wangu, nani nitsowalekela Waisiraeli woke kumtambikila IMNDEWA.”<verse eid="EXO 8:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 8:9" />Musa kamwidika Farao, “Ona nongele lelo, tsuwachi kobama nikulombele kwe Imulungu, niwalombele watawala wako ne iwanu wako. Nitsomlomba yawakome pfibutwa iwali mna tsing'anda tsenu, watsokala iwali kumto waliyeka.”<verse eid="EXO 8:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 8:10" />Farao kedika, “Nombele ilupfi.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="EXO 8:10">Musa kamwidika, “Nitsotenda ka pfaulongile ili umanye ka kuduhu wowose yeghala ne IMNDEWA, Imulungu wetu. <verse eid="EXO 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 8:11" />Pfibutwa watsolawa mng'anda mwako, mna tsing'anda tse iwatawala wayagho na iwanu wako. Watsosighala awala iwali kumto waliyeka.” <verse eid="EXO 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 8:12" />Apfo Musa na Aruni woka ukaye kwa Farao, na Musa kamlomba IMNDEWA yawalapfe pfibutwa iyawaghalile kwa Farao. <verse eid="EXO 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 8:13" />IMNDEWA katenda ka Musa pfayalombile, pfibutwa wala wafa mna tsing'anda, mpfitala na mmighunda. <verse eid="EXO 8:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 8:14" />Iwanu tsawawakunga hamwe pfibutwa awo, waweka malundolundo, na isi yose tsainung'a. <verse eid="EXO 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 8:15" />Lekeni Farao hayonile pfibutwa wafa, kaghendelela kuwa msughu, ng'awahulikitse tsina Musa na Aruni ka IMNDEWA pfayalongile.<verse eid="EXO 8:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mvumpfu wakwenela chila hanu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 8:16" />Kuya Imulungu kamlongela Musa, “Mlongele Aruni yagholose ng'weku yake yalitowe litimbwisi, nalyo lyakuwa mvupfu mna isi yose ya Misiri.” <verse eid="EXO 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 8:17" />Apfo Aruni kagholosa ghumoko ghwake kalitowa timbwisi, na timbwisi lyose mna isi ya Misiri liwa mvupfu. Nawo wawatambala iwanu ne iwanyama. <verse eid="EXO 8:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 8:18" />Wahawi wa Misiri nawo kwa uhawi wawo waghetsa kughalusa timbwisi liwe mvumvu, lekeni ng'awadahile baye. Mvumvu awo tsawenela chila hanu. <verse eid="EXO 8:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 8:19" />Baho iwahawi awala wamlongela Farao, “Aino isang'ano ye Imulungu!” Lekeni Farao kaghendelela kuwa msughu, ng'awahulikitse baye tsina Musa na Aruni. Ka apfila pfayalongile IMNDEWA.<verse eid="EXO 8:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wang'onzi wakwenela chila hanu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 8:20" />Kuya IMNDEWA kamlongela Musa, “Ilupfi ulamke nemitondotondo umghendele Farao hayoghenda kumto umlongele, ‘IMNDEWA kolonga apfi, walekelele iwanu woke wakanitambikile. <verse eid="EXO 8:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 8:21" />Ung'alema kuwalekelela woke, nitsowaghalila pfunge lye wang'onzi wawadese, ghweghwe na iwatawala wayagho na iwanu wako wose. Watsakwingila mna tsing'anda tsenu na tsing'anda tsose tsa Wamisiri tsitsomema wang'onzi, isi yose itsakwenela wang'onzi. <verse eid="EXO 8:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 8:22" />Lekeni nitsoibaghula isi ya Gosheni, kwawokala iwanu wangu ileke kuwa na wang'onzi. Baho ghweghwe kutsomanya ka nene IMNDEWA nosang'ana muisi mwako. <verse eid="EXO 8:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EXO 8:23" />Nitsowakinga iwanu wangu na aghala ighatsowapata iwanu wako. Chihulo chino chitsolawila ilupfi.’ ” <verse eid="EXO 8:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EXO 8:24" />IMNDEWA katenda ka pfayalongile, tsakaghala mapfunge makulu ghe iwang'onzi, wapfingilila mng'anda mwa Farao, na mna tsing'anda tsa watawala wayaghe, mna isi yose ya Misiri. Iwang'onzi awala waihinya isi yose ya Misiri.<verse eid="EXO 8:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="EXO 8:25" />Kuya mfalume kamkema Musa na Aruni kawalongela, “Mwodaha kughenda mkamlapfile nambiko Imulungu wenu, lekeni mumuno mna isi aino.”<verse eid="EXO 8:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="EXO 8:26" />Lekeni Musa kamwidika, “Mbe! Ng'apfinoghile baye kutenda apfo, kwaapfila nambiko yatutsomlapfila IMNDEWA, Imulungu wetu, tsitsowehila Wamisiri. Na tung'awalapfila nambiko itsiwehila, ambe watsotutowa na ghamabwe? <verse eid="EXO 8:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EXO 8:27" />Twobamighwa tughende ghumwanza ghwa ghamatsuwa madatu kunyika tukamtambikile Imulungu wetu ka pfayatulaghitse.”<verse eid="EXO 8:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="EXO 8:28" />Farao kalonga, “Nitsowalekelela mghende mkamtambikile IMNDEWA wenu kunyika, lekeni mleke kughenda kutali ng'ani. Lelo mnombele.”<verse eid="EXO 8:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="EXO 8:29" />Musa kamwidika, “Bahala hanitsakuka, nitsomlomba IMNDEWA mapfunge ghe iwang'onzi ilupfi ghalawe kuna ghweghwe Farao, iwatawala wayagho na iwanu wako. Lekeni uleke kutughutsukila keli kwa ukulema kuwalekelela iwanu waghende kumtambikila IMNDEWA.”<verse eid="EXO 8:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="EXO 8:30" />Musa koka ukaye kwa Farao, kamlomba IMNDEWA, <verse eid="EXO 8:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="EXO 8:31" />na IMNDEWA katenda ka Musa pfayalombile. Wang'onzi walawa mng'anda mwa Farao, iwatawala wayaghe na iwanu wake. Ng'asighale baye hata ng'onzi yumwe. <verse eid="EXO 8:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="EXO 8:32" />Lekeni hata litsuwa lino Farao kaghendelela kuwa msughu, ng'awalekele baye Waisiraeli woke.<verse eid="EXO 8:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="EXO 9" />
  <para style="s">Iwanyama wakufa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 9:1" />Kuya IMNDEWA kamlongela Musa, “Ghenda kwa Farao umlongele, IMNDEWA wa Waeburaniya kolonga apfino, ‘Walekelele iwanu wangu woke wakanitambikile. <verse eid="EXO 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 9:2" />Ung'alema kuwalekelela woke na kughendelela kuwaghoma, <verse eid="EXO 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 9:3" />nitsogholosa ghumoko ghwangu kughala maghayo makulu ng'ani mna iwanyama wenu wose, wang'ombe, wafarasi, pfihongwe, wang'amiya, iwamene ne iwang'olo. <verse eid="EXO 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 9:4" />Nitsowabaghula iwanyama wa Waisiraeli na iwanyama wa Wamisiri, ili yaleke kufa hata mnyama yumwe wa Waisiraeli.’ <verse eid="EXO 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 9:5" />Nene IMNDEWA, nolonga, ‘ilupfi litsakuwa litsuwa lya kutenda apfino mna isi ya Misiri.’ ”<verse eid="EXO 9:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 9:6" />Ilupfi yake IMNDEWA katenda ka pfayalongile, wanyama wose wa Wamisiri wafa, lekeni kuduhu mnyama hata yumwe wa Waisiraeli iyafile. <verse eid="EXO 9:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 9:7" />Farao katuma iwanu waghutse mbuli tsa Waisiraeli. Iwanu awo hawoyile wamlongela kuduhu hata mnyama wawo yumwe iyafile. Lekeni hata apfo Farao kaghendelela kuwa msughu naye ng'awalekelele baye iwanu woke.<verse eid="EXO 9:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Waisiraeli woghula mapute</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 9:8" />Kuya IMNDEWA kawalongela Musa na Aruni, “Chila yumwe yasole ghawo limwe lye lipfu mna tanuri, kuya Musa adimle mchanya hambele ha Farao. <verse eid="EXO 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 9:9" />Lipfu alyo litsakuwa timbwisi ilitsakwenela mchanya mwe isi yose ya Misiri. Litsoghala mapute ighatsotulika na kuwa pfilonda kwe iwanu na iwanyama chila hanu mna isi ya Misiri.” <verse eid="EXO 9:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 9:10" />Apfo wasola lipfu mna tanuri, wamghendela Farao, naye Musa kalidimla mchanya. Nalyo liwaghalila iwanu mapute, nagho ghawa pfilonda kwe iwanu na kwe iwanyama. <verse eid="EXO 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 9:11" />Iwahawi wala ng'awadahile baye ukwima hambele ha Musa na kumpinga kwaapfila wawo tsawana mapute ka Wamisiri wangi. <verse eid="EXO 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 9:12" />Lekeni IMNDEWA kamtenda Farao yawe msughu. Naye ng'awahulikitse tsina Musa na Aruni ka IMNDEWA pfayalongile.<verse eid="EXO 9:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Imvula ya ghamabwe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 9:13" />Kuya IMNDEWA kamlongela Musa, “Ilupfi ulamke nemitondotondo umghendele Farao, umlongele ka nene IMNDEWA, Imulungu we Waeburaniya nolonga apfino, ‘Walekelele iwanu wangu woke wakanitumikile. <verse eid="EXO 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 9:14" />Kwaapfila sambi nitsoghala maghayo makulu kuna ghweghwe ghumwenyegho na kune watawala wayagho na kwe iwanu wako. Naghwe kutsotanga ka kuduhu wowose yeghala na nene mna isi yose. <verse eid="EXO 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 9:15" />Ning'enule ghumoko ghwangu kukutowa ghweghwe ne iwanu wako kwa kukughalila utamu, mng'amalile ghendo. <verse eid="EXO 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 9:16" />Lekeni nimlekani waghima kulangusa ngupfu yangu, na kutenda taghwa lyangu limanyike mna isi yose. <verse eid="EXO 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 9:17" />Lekeni ghweghwe ung'ali msughu, kolema kuwalekelela iwanu wangu woke. <verse eid="EXO 9:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 9:18" />Lelo ilupfi, isaa ka aino, noghala mvula ng'ulu ya ghamabwe, ng'ana ilawile baye mna isi ya Misiri kulawa isi ino hayanzile mbaka leloli. <verse eid="EXO 9:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 9:19" />Lelo ulaghitse iwanyama wako na chila chinu chako ichili kumghunda chighalighwe mng'anda. Kwaapfila imvula ya ghamabwe itsomtowela chila imunu na chila imnyama yali kumghunda na wowose iyang'aghalighwe ukaye, wose watsakufa.’ ” <verse eid="EXO 9:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 9:20" />Iwatawala wayaghe Farao wapfuka chayalongile IMNDEWA, wawoitsa ukaye iwatumwa ne iwanyama wawo. <verse eid="EXO 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 9:21" />Lekeni awala iwabetsile chayalongile IIMNDEWA, wawaleka kumighunda iwatumwa wawo ne iwanyama wawo.<verse eid="EXO 9:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 9:22" />Kuya IMNDEWA kamlongela Musa, “Winule ghumoko ghwako kulanga, imvula ya ghamabwe itowe mna isi yose ya Misiri, iwatowele iwanu ne iwanyama iwali kumghunda ne imimeya yose.” <verse eid="EXO 9:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EXO 9:23" />Musa hayagholose ng'weku yake kulanga, kulanga kuduma, lumwesa ne imvula ya ghamabwe pfihulumka muisi. Apfo IMNDEWA kaitenda imvula itowe isi yose ya Misiri. <verse eid="EXO 9:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EXO 9:24" />Imvula ayo ng'ulu ya ghamabwe haing'ali itowa, kulanga tsakuduma na lumwesa luhulumka. Ng'ana ilawile baye imvula ya ghamabwe ka ayo kulawa isi ya Misiri hayanzile. <verse eid="EXO 9:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EXO 9:25" />Imvula ayo ya ghamabwe tsaibenebena chila chinu ichili mmighunda na chila hanu mna isi ya Misiri, pfipfila iwakoma iwanyama ne iwanu. Kuya ghamabwe ghe imvula ayo ghaibenabena imimeya yose mna imighunda ne imibiki yose. <verse eid="EXO 9:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EXO 9:26" />Imvula ayo tsaitowa mna isi yose ya Misiri, lekeni ng'aitowile baye Gosheni, hanu hawakalile Waisiraeli. <verse eid="EXO 9:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EXO 9:27" />Farao tsakalaghitsa Musa na Aruni wakemighwe, hawapfikile kawalongela, “Sambi nitenda nzambi, IMNDEWA kana haki, nene ne iwanu wangu tutotsa. <verse eid="EXO 9:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EXO 9:28" />Umlombe Imulungu, kwaapfila imvula ino na lumwesa pfitsidi. Nitsowalekelela mghende, ng'amtsoghendelela baye kukala keli.”<verse eid="EXO 9:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="EXO 9:29" />Musa kamwidika, “Baho hanitsolawa kunze mwe ghumji, nitsakwinula ghamoko ghangu nitsomlomba IMNDEWA. Ukuduma kwitsenyamala ne imvula aino ya ghamabwe ng'aitsotowa keli baye ili umanye ka iisi yose yake IMNDEWA. <verse eid="EXO 9:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="EXO 9:30" />Lekeni nomanya ghweghwe na iwanu wako ng'amtsompfuka baye IMNDEWA.”<verse eid="EXO 9:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="EXO 9:31" />Kitani na shayiri tsapfihinyighwa kwaapfila shayiri tsa ina makungwi, na kitani tsa isanula maluwa. <verse eid="EXO 9:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="EXO 9:32" />Lekeni ngano ng'aihinyike baye kwaapfila tsang'ana ikomale baye. <verse eid="EXO 9:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="EXO 9:33" />Kuya Musa koka ukaye kwa Farao, kaghenda kunze kwe ghumji kenula ghamoko kamlomba Imulungu. Imvula ya ghamabwe tsaileka na ukuduma kwinyamala, na imvula imalila baho. <verse eid="EXO 9:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="EXO 9:34" />Mfalume hayonile imvula ya ghamabwe na ukuduma kwinyamala, tsakayuila keli nzambi yake. Yeye ne iwatawala wayaghe waghendelela kuwa wasughu. <verse eid="EXO 9:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="EXO 9:35" />Ka IMNDEWA pfayalongole kulonga kubitila Musa, Farao ng'awalekelele baye Waisiraeli woke.<verse eid="EXO 9:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="EXO 10" />
  <para style="s">Wanzighe wakwenela mna isi yose</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 10:1" />Kuya IMNDEWA kamlongela Musa, “Ughende kwa Farao, kwaapfila niwatenda wawe wasughu yeye na watawala wayaghe, ili nitende pfihulo mna wawo, <verse eid="EXO 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 10:2" />mwemwe mdahe kuwapetela iwana ne iwatsukulu wenu pfaniwatendile wabotsi Wamisiri kwa ukutenda pfihulo apfo mna wawo. Apfo mtsotanga ka nene na IMNDEWA.” <verse eid="EXO 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 10:3" />Apfo Musa na Aruni wamghendela Farao wamlongela, “IMNDEWA, Imulungu wa Waeburaniya kolonga apfino ‘Kutsolema kutenda ka pfanikulongela mbaka tsuwachi? <verse eid="EXO 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 10:4" />Ung'alema kuwalekelela iwanu wangu woke, ilupfi nitsokughalila wanzighe muisi mwako. <verse eid="EXO 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 10:5" />Nawo watsoighubika isi yose ya Misiri. Watsakuja chila chinu ichisighale mna imvula ya ghamabwe, pfipfila ng'awatsoghuleka mbiki ghwoghwose ghwaukota mmighunda. <verse eid="EXO 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 10:6" />Wanzighe awo watsomema mng'anda mwako, mna tsing'anda tse iwatawala wayagho, na tse Wamisiri wose, watsakuwa wengi hata iwabala tsenu ng'ana wone baye kulawa hawoneke mbaka leloli.’ ” Kuya Musa kalawa kwa Farao. <verse eid="EXO 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 10:7" />Iwatawala wayaghe Farao wamghutsa, “Angu munu yuno katsotutsupfa mbaka tsuwachi? Walekelele wanu wano woke wakamtambikile IMNDEWA, Imulungu wawo. Pfii ng'una umanye baye ka isi ya Misiri yohinyika?” <verse eid="EXO 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 10:8" />Kuya Musa na Aruni wakemighwa woye kwa Farao, naye kawalongela, “Mghende mkamtamanile IMNDEWA, Imulungu wenu. Lekeni nongeleni, tsina nani iwoghenda namwe?” <verse eid="EXO 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 10:9" />Musa kamwidika, “Chila munu, wasongolo ne wanzehe, twakuka ne iwana wetu wamale ne wapinga, wang'olo ne wamene ne wang'ombe tsetu, kwaapfila twobamighwa tumtendele chihungo IMNDEWA.” <verse eid="EXO 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 10:10" />Mfalume kawalongela, “Nelaha kwe IMNDEWA sitsowalekela baye mghende ne iwapinga wenu ne iwanenu. Yakoneka ghendo mwepfikitsa pfihile mna mimoyo yenu, mwobama mleke kuya keli. <verse eid="EXO 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 10:11" />Baye! Iwamale waliyeka wawo iwatsoghenda kumtambikila IMNDEWA, kwaapfila acho chicho chambama.” Baho Musa na Aruni wawingighwa hambele ha Farao. <verse eid="EXO 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 10:12" />Kuya IMNDEWA kamlongela Musa, “Gholosa ghumoko ghwako mchanya mwe isi ya Misiri, wanzighe walawile wengile Misiri, waje imimeya yose na pfose ipfisighale mna imvula ya ghamabwe.” <verse eid="EXO 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 10:13" />Apfo Musa kaigholosa ng'weku yake mchanya mwe isi ya Misiri, IMNDEWA kaghala libeho kulawa ubali wa mashaliki, libeho tsaliduma misi yose ne chilo chose. Hakuchile libeho lila lighala wanzighe. <verse eid="EXO 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 10:14" />Wanzighe awo tsawenela chila hanu mna isi yose ya Misiri. Tsa wawengi ng'ani, ng'ana ilawile baye na ng'aitsolawila keli ka apfo. <verse eid="EXO 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 10:15" />Tsaighubika isi yose ya Misiri, mbaka isi ingila chisi, tsawaja imimeya yose ye isi, na matunda ghose ighasighale mna imvula ila ya ghamabwe. Kuduhu hata tsani limwe ilisighale muisi. Kuduhu tsani lyolyose ilisighale mna imibiki wala mna imimeya mna isi yose ya Misiri.<verse eid="EXO 10:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 10:16" />Baho Farao kawakema himahima Musa na Aruni kawalongela, “Nimtendela nzambi Imulungu na mwemwe pfipfila. <verse eid="EXO 10:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 10:17" />Lelo mnileghusile nzambi tsangu mala ino keli na mnombele kwa IMNDEWA wenu yatuleke tuleke ukufa kwa chinu chino.”<verse eid="EXO 10:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 10:18" />Musa kalawa kwa Farao, kamlomba IIMNDEWA. <verse eid="EXO 10:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 10:19" />IMNDEWA kaghala libeho kulu lya ubali wa maghalibi, liwasola wanzighe wala na kuwaghala kuna ibahari ya Shamu. Tsakuduhu hata nzighe yumwe iyasighale mna isi yose ya Misiri. <verse eid="EXO 10:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 10:20" />Lekeni IMNDEWA kamtenda Farao yawe msughu, naye ng'awalekelele Waisiraeli woke.<verse eid="EXO 10:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ichisi choghubika isi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 10:21" />Kuya IMNDEWA kamlongela Musa, “Winule ghumoko ghwako kulanga, na chisi chikulu chilawile mna isi ya Misiri, mbaka iwanu wabamase bamase mna ichisi acho.” <verse eid="EXO 10:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 10:22" />Apfo Musa kagholosa ghumoko ghwake kulanga, baho chisi chikulu chilawila mna isi yose ya Misiri kwa ghamatsuwa madatu. <verse eid="EXO 10:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EXO 10:23" />Tsakuduhu imunu yadahile kumwona miyaghe au kuka kulawa hanu hayali kwa ghamatsuwa madatu. Lekeni Waisiraeli wose tsawakala na ghumwanga hanu kwawakalile.<verse eid="EXO 10:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="EXO 10:24" />Kuya mfalume kamkema Musa kamlongela, “Mghende mkamtamanile IMNDEWA, hata iwapinga ne iwanenu wodaha kuka namwe. Lekeni iwang'olo ne iwamene wenu ne wang'ombe wenu mleke kuka nawo.”<verse eid="EXO 10:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="EXO 10:25" />Musa kalonga, “Kobamighwa utulekele tusole iwanyama we inambiko na sadaka tsa ukulakatsighwa tukamtambikile IMNDEWA, Imulungu wetu. <verse eid="EXO 10:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EXO 10:26" />Iwanyama wetu pfipfila tutsoghenda nawo, ng'atumleka baye hata yumwe. Kwaapfila kulawa mna wanyama wetu wenyegho, tutsomtambikila IMNDEWA, Imulungu wetu, kuya twetwe ng'atumanyile imnyama yuhi yatutsomlapfila IMNDEWA mbaka hatutsopfika ako.”<verse eid="EXO 10:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="EXO 10:27" />Lekeni IMNDEWA kamtenda Farao yawe msughu, na ng'abamile baye kuwalekelela woke. <verse eid="EXO 10:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EXO 10:28" />Farao kamlongela Musa, “Ulawe hambele hangu! Walangitse uleke ukutsa keli kuna nene. Kwaapfila ung'atsa keli kuna nene, litsuwa alyo nitsokukoma!” <verse eid="EXO 10:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="EXO 10:29" />Musa kamwidika, “Ona. Ghweghwe kulonga ghoya, ng'utsombona keli baye.”<verse eid="EXO 10:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="EXO 11" />
  <para style="s">Iwana iwalongole ukwelekighwa wokomighwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 11:1" />Kuya IMNDEWA kamlongela Musa, “Nitsotenda chihulo chingi chimwe kumtowa Farao na isi yake ya Misiri. Kuya katsowalekeleni mghende. Naye katsowawinga ghendo mlawe hano. <verse eid="EXO 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 11:2" />Lelo walongele Waisiraeli wawalombe iwanu wa habehi yawo waweng'e pfinu pfa nzahabu na fetsa.” <verse eid="EXO 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 11:3" />IMNDEWA kawatenda Waisiraeli wakundighwe na Wamisiri. Naye Musa imwenyegho tsakakala imunu iyotogholighwa mna isi ya Misiri, hambele ha iwatawala wa Farao ne iwanu wose.<verse eid="EXO 11:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 11:4" />Kuya Musa kamlongela mfalume, “IMNDEWA Imulungu kolonga apfino, ‘Leloli nechilo ghendo, nitsobita mna isi ya Misiri. <verse eid="EXO 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 11:5" />Hanitsobita, chila imwana mmale iyalongole ukwelekighwa mna isi ya Misiri katsakufa, kwanzila mwanagho, yali mhala wako, mbaka mwana wa mtumwa wako pinga iyosagha usaghe kwa libwe. Hata iwana iwalongole ukwelekighwa we iwanyama nawo wose watsakufa. <verse eid="EXO 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 11:6" />Kutsakuwa ne chililo chikulu mna isi ya Misiri ng'ana chilawile baye, kuya ng'achitsolawila keli. <verse eid="EXO 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 11:7" />Lekeni Waisiraeli watsokala tseghamba na kuduhu hata yumbwa iyatsomkughila imunu wowose au imnyama wawo. Kuya mtsomanya ka IMNDEWA kowabaghula Waisiraeli na Wamisiri.’ ” <verse eid="EXO 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 11:8" />Musa kamalitsila kwa kumlongela Farao, “Iwatawala wayagho awano watsonitsila na ukwinamila na ukulonga, ‘Ughende ghweghwe ne iwanu wose yuwalongotsa!’ Baho nitsakuka.” Kuya Musa kaghudubuka koka. <verse eid="EXO 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 11:9" />IMNDEWA kamlongela Musa, “Farao katsoghendelela kuwa msughu, ili pfihulo pfangu pfongetseke mna isi ya Misiri.” <verse eid="EXO 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 11:10" />Musa na Aruni tsawatenda pfihulo apfo pfose hambele ha Farao. Lekeni IMNDEWA tsakamtenda Farao yawe msughu, kalema kuwalekelela Waisiraeli woke muisi mwake.<verse eid="EXO 11:10" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="EXO 12" />
  <para style="s">Wayahudi wokombolighwa kwa idamu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 12:1" />IMNDEWA kawalongela Musa na Aruni mna isi ya Misiri, <verse eid="EXO 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 12:2" />“Mwetsi ghuno ghutsakuwa ghumwetsi ghwa kwanza ghwa ghumwaka kuna mwemwe. <verse eid="EXO 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 12:3" />Uwalongele iwanu wose wa Isiraeli apfino, mna litsuwa lya kumi lya ghumwetsi ghuno, chila imunu kobamighwa yaisolele ikaye yake imwana we ing'olo au imwana we imene. <verse eid="EXO 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 12:4" />Ka iwanu wa ikaye yake wachidogho ng'ani na ng'awodaha baye kummalitsa kumja imnyama wose, iwanu we ikaye ayo na iwanu we ikaye iili habehi yake wodaha kumja hamwe imnyama ayo. Imnyama ayo yamumsaghula, iwanu wang'amja wose wenele. <verse eid="EXO 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 12:5" />Mwodaha kusaghula ing'olo au imene, yawe imlume iyali na ghumwaka ghumwe, yaleke kuwa na chilema. <verse eid="EXO 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 12:6" />Muwadime mbaka nemihe ya litsuwa lya kumi na nne lya ghumwetsi ghuno, kuya iwanu wose wa Isiraeli watsowasubutula iwanyama awo. <verse eid="EXO 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 12:7" />Iwanu watsosola idamu chidogho, watsobaka mmbalimbali na mchanya mwe pfitsingiti pfa ghumlango mna tsing'anda tsawatsomjila imnyama ayo. <verse eid="EXO 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 12:8" />Ichilo chicho inyama yokighwe na ijighwe na tsimbogha itsisungu na chighate ing'achighumighwe ihamila. <verse eid="EXO 12:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 12:9" />Mleke kuija mbisi wala iyambikighwe, ila yokighwe na litwi lyake, ghamaghulu ghake na tsinyama itsili mghati mwake. <verse eid="EXO 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 12:10" />Mleke kuileka inyama yoyose mbaka nemitondo, inyama yoyose ka ilekighwa mbaka nemitondo ilakatsighwe kwa ghumoto. <verse eid="EXO 12:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 12:11" />Apfi pfipfo pfamtsomja imnyama ayo. Mwohe imisipi mchuno, mpfale imikwabatsa mmaghulu, mkinde tsing'weku mna ghamoko ghenu. Muije himahima. Achino ichihungo che Ipasaka ye IMNDEWA.<verse eid="EXO 12:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 12:12" />“Mne chilo acho nitsobita mna isi ya Misiri, kumkoma chila imwana immale we iwanu iyalongole ukwelekighwa, na imnyama iyalongole kwelekighwa, na kuitowa imilungu yose ya Misiri. Nene na IMNDEWA. <verse eid="EXO 12:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 12:13" />Idamu mna pfitsingiti itsakuwa chitango kulangusa tsinganda tsamkala. Hanitsoyona idamu ayo, nitsowadaluka. Sitsomlaghani baye, baho hanitsowatowa iwanu wa Misiri. <verse eid="EXO 12:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 12:14" />Mdeng'eleleghe litsuwa lino ka ichihungo cha ukuwatenda mwemwe mkumbuke achila nene IMNDEWA chaniwatendele. Nowalaghitsa mtende pfino ghamatsuwa ghose.”<verse eid="EXO 12:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Chihungo cha pfighate ipfilihela ihamila</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 12:15" />IMNDEWA kalonga, “Kwa ghamatsuwa saba, mtsakuja pfighate pfilihela ihamila. Litsuwa lya mwanduso lya matsuwa agho saba, mtsolapfa ihamila mna tsing'anda tsenu mna ghamatsuwa agho saba. Munu wowose yang'aja ichinu ichili ne ihamila mna ghamatsuwa agho saba yawingighwe mghati mwa Waisiraeli. <verse eid="EXO 12:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 12:16" />Litsuwa lya mwanduso na litsuwa lya saba mwitingane mnitambikile nene. Mne matsuwa agho meli mleke kusang'ana ng'onde yoyose, ila ya ukwambika ichijo iliyeka. <verse eid="EXO 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 12:17" />Mdeng'elele chihungo chino cha pfighate ipfilihela ihamila, mkumbuke litsuwa lyaniwalapfile mwemwe Waisiraeli kulawa Misiri. Pfeleko pfenu pfose ipfikutsa pfitsodeng'elela litsuwa alyo, ka laghitso lya matsuwa ghose. <verse eid="EXO 12:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 12:18" />Apfo mtsakuja ipfighate ipfilihela ihamila, kwandusila mihe ya litsuwa lya kumi na nne lya mwetsi ghwa mwanduso, mbaka mihe ya litsuwa lya ishilini na limwe lya mwetsi ghuno ghwa mwanduso. <verse eid="EXO 12:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 12:19" />Mne ghamatsuwa agho saba, mleke kuwa ne ihamila yoyose mna tsing'anda tsenu. Imunu wowose, yawe mgheni au mwenyekaye, yang'aja chinu chine ihamila, katsowingighwa mghati mwa kaye tsa Waisiraeli. <verse eid="EXO 12:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 12:20" />Mleke ukuja chinu chochose ichili ne ihamila. Hohose hamkala mtsakuja ipfighate ipfilihela ihamila.”<verse eid="EXO 12:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Waisiraeli wodeng'elela Ipasaka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 12:21" />Kuya Musa kawalaghitsa iwakulu wose wa Waisiraeli, kawalongela, “Haya mwemwe wose mghende mkatsisaghulile kaye tsenu imwana ng'olo au imwana we mene, mumsubutule na mumje mna chihungo che Ipasaka. <verse eid="EXO 12:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 12:22" />Msole imitsani ya hisopo muipfabike mna idamu iili mna chiya, kuya mbakatse idamu ayo mna pfitsingiti na mmbalimbali mwose mwe imibani ye tsing'anda tsenu. Imunu wowose yaleke kulawa kunze chilo acho mbaka nemitondo. <verse eid="EXO 12:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EXO 12:23" />IMNDEWA hayatsobita Misiri kuwakoma Wamisiri, hayatsoyona idamu mna chitsingiti na mmbalimbali mwe libani katsoidaluka ing'anda ayo, ng'atsomleka baye mkoma wanu yengile mna tsing'anda tsenu kumkomani mwemwe. <verse eid="EXO 12:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EXO 12:24" />Mwemwe ne iwanenu mkinde ghamalaghitso gha ghamatsuwa ghose. <verse eid="EXO 12:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EXO 12:25" />Hamtsakwingila mna isi ila IMNDEWA iyalongile katsomwing'ani, mtende chihungo chino. <verse eid="EXO 12:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EXO 12:26" />Iwanenu hawatsomghutsani ‘Chihendo chino china mana yachi?’ <verse eid="EXO 12:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EXO 12:27" />Muwalongele ‘Aino inambiko ye Ipasaka ye IMNDEWA, iyatsidaluke tsing'anda tsa Waisiraeli ako Misiri na kutsileka kaye tsetu hayawatowile Wamisiri.’ ”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="EXO 12:27">Waisiraeli tsawatowa ghamaghoti wamtamanila IMNDEWA. <verse eid="EXO 12:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EXO 12:28" />Kuya Waisiraeli tsawatenda ka IMNDEWA pfayawalaghitse Musa na Aruni.<verse eid="EXO 12:28" /></para>
  <para style="s">Iwana chaudele wa Wamisiri wakufa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="EXO 12:29" />Mne chilo chikulu IMNDEWA kawakoma iwana chaudele wose wa isi ya Misiri, kwandusila imwana chaudele wa Farao iyokala mng'anda kwe mfalume, mbaka imwana chaudele we imunu yula iyali mchifungo. Hata iwana we iwanyama iwalongole kwelekighwa tsawakomighwa. <verse eid="EXO 12:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="EXO 12:30" />Apfo Farao, na watawala wayaghe ne iwanu wose wa Misiri walamka chilo chicho. Tsakulawila chililo chikulu mna isi yose ya Misiri kwaapfila tsahaduhu ing'anda hata imwe ilihela imunu yafile.<verse eid="EXO 12:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="EXO 12:31" />Chilo chicho Farao kawakema Musa na Aruni, kawalongela, “Mlawe, mke sambi baha kune iwanu wangu, mghende mwemwe na Waisiraeli awo mkamtamanile IMNDEWA ka pfamlongile. <verse eid="EXO 12:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="EXO 12:32" />Msole iwang'olo wenu iwamene wenu ne wang'ombe wenu mke. Kuya mkanombele na nene.”<verse eid="EXO 12:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="EXO 12:33" />Wamisiri tsawawawinga Waisiraeli woke himahima mna isi ya Misiri, walonga, “Ka ng'amkuka baye, twetwe wose tutsakufa ghendo!” <verse eid="EXO 12:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="EXO 12:34" />Apfo Waisiraeli wasola usaghe iukandighwe bila kughelighwa ihamila, wasola na pfiha pfawo wapfoha mna mabwende wapfighala mmahegha. <verse eid="EXO 12:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="EXO 12:35" />Waisiraeli tsawatenda ka Musa pfawalaghitse aho mwanduso. Tsawawalomba Wamisiri pfinu pfa fetsa, nzahabu na ghamaghwanda. <verse eid="EXO 12:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="EXO 12:36" />Naye Imulungu tsakawatenda Waisiraeli wakundighwe na Wamisiri, nawo tsawaweng'a Waisiraeli chila chinu chawabamile. Apfo pfipfo Waisiraeli pfawawabokile Wamisiri pfinu pfawo.<verse eid="EXO 12:36" /></para>
  <para style="s">Waisiraeli wolawa Misiri</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="EXO 12:37" />Waisiraeli tsawoka Ramesesi mbaka Sukosi. Iwamale tsawapfika ka laki sita bila kuwapeta iwapinga ne iwana. <verse eid="EXO 12:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="EXO 12:38" />Kuya tsakuna iwanu wangi iwelongotse nawo, hamwe ne iwanyama wengi, iwang'olo na iwang'ombe. <verse eid="EXO 12:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="EXO 12:39" />Kwaapfila tsawoka Misiri himahima, ng'awadahile baye ukwambika imao ye ghumwanza, ila usaghe ula uliyeka iukandighwe bila kughelighwa ihamila. Apfo wambika ipfighate ipfilihela hamila. <verse eid="EXO 12:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="EXO 12:40" />Waisiraeli tsawakala Misiri kwa miyaka miya nne na selasini. <verse eid="EXO 12:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="EXO 12:41" />Halimalile litsuwa lya mwaka wa miya nne na selasini, kolo tsose tse iwanu we IMNDEWA tsuka mna isi ya Misiri. <verse eid="EXO 12:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="EXO 12:42" />Chilo chicho Imulungu tsakakala meso kowalolesa Waisiraeli yawalapfe mna isi ya Misiri, chilo chino Waisiraeli wose wobamighwa wakale meso kwa kumkumbuka Imulungu pfayawalapfile mna isi ya Misiri, wao na watsukulu wose iwakutsa.<verse eid="EXO 12:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="EXO 12:43" />IMNDEWA kawalongela Musa na Aruni, “Ghumwiko ghwe Pasaka aghuno hano, mwiko mgheni wowose ukuja chijo che Pasaka, <verse eid="EXO 12:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="EXO 12:44" />lekeni mtumwa wowose yamumghulile kwa sendi ka kengila ngoma, kodaha kuja. <verse eid="EXO 12:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="EXO 12:45" />Mwiko kwa Mbita nzila au yakemighwe kusang'ana kwa misi imwe kuja chijo acho.”<verse eid="EXO 12:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="EXO 12:46" />“Nyama yose ijighwe mng'anda, ileke kulapfighwa kunze, mleke kughubena mpate ghwoghwose ghwa mnyama wa Pasaka. <verse eid="EXO 12:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="EXO 12:47" />Iwanu wose wa Isiraeli wadeng'elele chihungo acho. <verse eid="EXO 12:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="EXO 12:48" />Mgheni wowose iyakutsa kukala na mwemwe, yang'abama kudeng'elela chihungo cha Pasaka, tanu muwengitse ngoma iwamale wose iwokala mng'anda mwake, baho katsotangika ka mwenyekaye miyenu, naye katsodaha ukuja ichijo acho. Lekeni mleke kumleka mmale wowose yang'engile ngoma yaje ichijo acho. <verse eid="EXO 12:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="EXO 12:49" />Imiko ino iwe kwa Muisiraeli na mgheni iyokala na mwemwe.” <verse eid="EXO 12:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="EXO 12:50" />Waisiraeli wose tsawategheletsa malaghitso agho na watenda ka IMNDEWA pfayawalaghitse Musa na Aruni. <verse eid="EXO 12:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="EXO 12:51" />Litsuwa lilila IMNDEWA tsakawalapfa Waisiraeli mna isi ya Misiri.<verse eid="EXO 12:51" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="EXO 13" />
  <para style="s">Iwana wamale iwalongole ukwelekighwa walapfighwe kwe Imulungu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 13:1" />IMNDEWA kamlongela Musa, <verse eid="EXO 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 13:2" />“Nilapfile iwana wamale iwalongole ukwelekighwa. Kwaapfila chila mwana mmale chaudele wa Waisiraeli ayo wangu nene, na iwana we iwanyama iwalongole ukwelekighwa nawo wangu nene.”<verse eid="EXO 13:2" /></para>
  <para style="s">Chihungo che ipfighate ipfilihela ihamila</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 13:3" />Musa kawalongela iwanu, “Mleke kulisemwa litsuwa lino lyamlawile mna isi ya Misiri ako kwamkalile watumwa. Litsuwa lino IMNDEWA tsakawalapfa amwo kwa ghumoko ghwake ghune ngupfu. Mne litsuwa lino, mleke ukuja ichighate chine ihamila. <verse eid="EXO 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 13:4" />Litsuwa lino lya mwetsi ghwa mwanduso, ighukemighwa Abibu, mtsolawa Misiri. <verse eid="EXO 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 13:5" />Imulungu hayatsomghaleni mna isi yawokala Wakanani, Wahiti, Waamori, Wahipfi, na Wayebusi, isi yawalongele iwabala wenu ka katsomwing'ani mwemwe, isi inoghile kwa ukufugha na ukulima, mdeng'elele chihungo chino chila ghumwaka mna ghumwetsi ghuno ghwa mwanduso. <verse eid="EXO 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 13:6" />Kwa matsuwa saba mtsakuja ipfighate ipfilihela ihamila. Mne litsuwa lya saba mtsotenda chihungo kwa kumtunya IMNDEWA. <verse eid="EXO 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 13:7" />Kwa ghamatsuwa agho saba mtsakuja ipfighate ipfilihela ihamila, wala ihamila ileke ukwoneka mna mwemwe na mna isi yose. <verse eid="EXO 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 13:8" />Litsuwa alyo muwalongele iwanenu ka mwotenda apfo kukumbuka chayawatendele IMNDEWA hamlawile mna isi ya Misiri. <verse eid="EXO 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 13:9" />Chihungo chino chitsowakumbusa na chakuwa ka chitango ichili mna ghamoko ghenu na mna pfihanga pfenu ili mkumbukeghe ghamalaghitso ghe Imulungu. Kwaapfila Imulungu tsakawalapfa mna isi ya Misiri kwa ghumoko ghwake ghune ngupfu. <verse eid="EXO 13:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 13:10" />Apfo mtsodeng'elela chihungo chino mna chipindi chake, chila ghumwaka.<verse eid="EXO 13:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Welekighwa wa mwanduso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 13:11" />“IMNDEWA katsowaghalani mna isi ya Kanaani, na katsomwing'eni isi ayo, ka pfayalaghane na mwemwe na iwabala wenu. <verse eid="EXO 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 13:12" />Mwobamighwa mumlapfile IMNDEWA chila imwana mmale iyolongola ukwoneka. Chila mwana mmale we iwanyama iyolongola koneka, awo wose we Imulungu. <verse eid="EXO 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 13:13" />Lekeni chila imwana we chihongwe iyalongole ukwelekighwa kutsomkombola kwa kumlapfila Imulungu imwana we ng'olo, ka ng'ubama baye kumkombola, mbobotole isingo yake yafe. Chila mwana mmale we iwanu iyolongola ukwoneka mghati mwenu mtsomkombola. <verse eid="EXO 13:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 13:14" />Ghamatsuwa ighakutsa, iwanenu wang'awaghutsa, Angu achino choni? Muwalongele, ‘Kwa ghumoko ghune ngupfu IMNDEWA katulapfa Misiri, isi yatukalile watumwa. <verse eid="EXO 13:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 13:15" />Farao kwa usughu wake tsakalema kutulekelela tuke, apfo IMNDEWA tsakamkoma chila imwana mmale iyalongole ukwoneka mna isi ya Misiri, chila imwana mmale we iwanu na chila imwana mmale we iwanyama. Apfo twetwe tutsomlapfila nambiko IMNDEWA chila imwana mmale we iwanyama wetu, lekeni iwanetu iwamale iwalongole ukwoneka tutsowakombola. <verse eid="EXO 13:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 13:16" />Chihendo chino chitsakuwa chitango mna ghamoko au mna pfihanga pfenu cha kuwakumbusa ka IMNDEWA tsakatulapfa mna isi ya Misiri kwa ghumoko ghune ngupfu.’”<verse eid="EXO 13:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Imulungu kowalongotsa iwanu wake kulawa Misiri</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 13:17" />Farao hayawalekile iwanu woke, Imulungu ng'awalongotse baye wabitile mna isi ya Wafilisti, hata ka tsaikala nzila ya habehi ya kupfika Kanaani. Kwaapfila Imulungu kalonga, “Wang'etingana ne iwanu na ukwitowa nawo, wodaha kughutuka woye Misiri.” <verse eid="EXO 13:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 13:18" />Apfo Imulungu kawalongotsa nzila ya kutsunguluka kubitila kunyika, mmbalimbali mwe ibahari ya Shamu. Waisiraeli tsawagheluka kulawa Misiri aku wesafulula kwa ing'ondo.<verse eid="EXO 13:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 13:19" />Musa tsakasola mipate ila ya Yosefu, ka Yosefu pfayawalaghitse ahala ng'ana yafe. Tsakawalongela Waisiraeli, “Mwilahe ka Imulungu hayatsowatsilani kuwalapfa muisi mno, mtsoisola imipate yangu kulawa muisi mno.”<verse eid="EXO 13:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 13:20" />Apfo Waisiraeli walawa Sukosi waghenda Etamu, kwaitsighile inyika, kuko watsenga ipfibumbulika wabwihila. <verse eid="EXO 13:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 13:21" />Nemisi IMNDEWA tsakawalongola kwa kuwekila ingutso ya liwingu kuwalangusa inzila. Nechilo kawalongola kwa kuwekila ingutso ya liwenge kuwamwemwesela inzila, ili wadahe kughenda chilo ne imisi. <verse eid="EXO 13:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 13:22" />Ngutso ila ya liwingu ng'ayukile baye nemisi hambele ha Waisiraeli, wala ila ya ghumoto ng'ayukile baye nechilo hambele ha Waisiraeli.<verse eid="EXO 13:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="EXO 14" />
  <para style="s">Waisiraeli woloka ibahari ya Shamu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 14:1" />Kuya IMNDEWA kamlongela Musa, <verse eid="EXO 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 14:2" />“Uwalongele iwanu woye kuchughu, watsenge pfimbulika wabwihile hambele he Pihahilosi, haghatighati ha Migidoli na ibahari ya Shamu, hambele ha Baalisefoni. Mtsokala baho habehi na ibahari. <verse eid="EXO 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 14:3" />Kwaapfila Farao katsepfikitsa, ‘Waisiraeli wakwangakwanga kuno na kuno, inyika iwadiwa waleke kulawa.’ <verse eid="EXO 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 14:4" />Kuya nene nitsomtenda Farao yawe msughu, naye katsomuwinzani. Na nene nitsotunyighwa kwa kumkoma Farao na maasikali wake. Baho Wamisiri watsomanya ka nene yuyo IMNDEWA.” Apfo Waisiraeli watenda pfipfo.<verse eid="EXO 14:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 14:5" />Imfalume wa Misiri hayahulike ka Waisiraeli watsuma, Farao ne iwatawala wayaghe waghalusa ghamawatso ghawo, walonga, “Angu choni chino chatutendile? Tuwaleka Waisiraeli woke waleke kutusang'anila keli!” <verse eid="EXO 14:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 14:6" />Imfalume kasola mtuka ghwake ghwe ing'ondo ighukweghighwa ne iwafalasi, ne iwamasikali wake. <verse eid="EXO 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 14:7" />Tsakasola mituka yake ye ng'ondo inoghile ghendo miya sita na kasola mituka ingi ya Misiri ye ing'ondo, tsailongotsighwa ne iwakulu wa maasikali. <verse eid="EXO 14:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 14:8" />IMNDEWA kamtenda Farao yawe msughu, naye kawakoleletsa Waisiraeli iwokile aku wodeng'elela. <verse eid="EXO 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 14:9" />Wamisiri na farasi wawo wose, mituka ya farasi ye ng'ondo na iwadina farasi wawo wawawinza Waisiraeli, wawapfika baho hawatsengile pfibumbulika mmbalimbali mwe ibahari, habehi na Pihahirosi, hambele ha Baalisefoni. <verse eid="EXO 14:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 14:10" />Farao hayapfikile habehi, Waisiraeli wawona Wamisiri wakutsa kuchughu kwawo, tsawapfuka ghendo, wamlilila Imulungu. <verse eid="EXO 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 14:11" />Wamlongela Musa, “Pfii Misiri tsahaduhu hanu ha ukutsikila mbaka utughale tufile kuno kunyika? Angu ebali ututendile tulawe Misiri? <verse eid="EXO 14:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 14:12" />Pfii ng'atukulongele baye hatung'ali mna isi ya Misiri? Tsatukulongela utuleke tughendelele kuwasang'anila Wamisiri. Tsapfinogha kuwasang'anila Wamisiri kubita kufila akuno kunyika.”<verse eid="EXO 14:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 14:13" />Musa kawedika, “Mleke kupfuka! Mwime ghoya! Lelo mtsakona IMNDEWA pfayatsomkombolani. Wamisiri wano wamuwona leloli, ng'amtsowona keli baye. <verse eid="EXO 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 14:14" />IMNDEWA katsetowa nawo, mwemwe mwinyamale.” <verse eid="EXO 14:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 14:15" />Kuya IMNDEWA kamlongela Musa, “Ebali mwonililila? Uwalongele Waisiraeli waghendelele na ghumwanza. <verse eid="EXO 14:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 14:16" />Winule ng'weku yako uigholose mchanya mwe ibahari. Ghamatsi ghatseghola, Waisiraeli watsodaha kuloka mna ibahari hanu hasakale. <verse eid="EXO 14:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 14:17" />Nene nitsowatenda Wamisiri wawe wasughu, nawo watsomuwinzani mghati mwe ibahari, na nene nitsotunyighwa kwa kumkoma Farao na maasikali wake, mituka yake ye ing'ondo na iwadina farasi wake. <verse eid="EXO 14:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 14:18" />Na nitsotunyighwa kwa kumkoma Farao na maasikali wake, ne mituka yake ye ing'ondo na iwadina farasi wake, nawo watsomanya ka nene yuyo IMNDEWA.”<verse eid="EXO 14:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 14:19" />Kuya malaika we Imulungu iyakalile hambele ha Waisiraeli, kalawa katsa kukala kuchughu kwawo. Na ngutso ila ye liwingu pfipfila ilawa hambele yawo ima kuchughu kwawo, <verse eid="EXO 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 14:20" />tsaikala haghatighati ha Waisiraeli na Wamisiri. Wingu liwaghela chisi Wamisiri, lekeni liwalangatsila Waisiraeli nechilo, apfo maasikali wa Farao ng'awadahile baye kupfika habehi na Waisiraeli chilo chose.<verse eid="EXO 14:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 14:21" />Musa kagholosa ghumoko ghwake mchanya mwe ibahari, naye IMNDEWA kaitenda ibahari yuye kuchughu kwa libeho kulu lilawile ubali wa mashaliki, libeho alyo liduma chilo chose, liighola ibahari, nayo ibahari iwa isi isakale. <verse eid="EXO 14:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 14:22" />Waisiraeli wabita haghatighati hanu he ibahari hanu hasakale ghendo, ghamatsi tsaghema ka imibanda ikalile ubali wao wa kujilo na wa kumoso. <verse eid="EXO 14:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EXO 14:23" />Wamisiri wawawinza kwa kubita haghatighati he ibahari hanu hasakale, wengila na wafarasi wawo, mituka yawo, na wadina farasi wawo wose. <verse eid="EXO 14:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EXO 14:24" />Lupfilipfili IMNDEWA tsakawalola Wamisiri kubitila ingutso ila ya liwenge na ngutso ila ya liwingu, kuya kawatenda wapfuke ng'ani. <verse eid="EXO 14:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EXO 14:25" />Tsakaghatenda magadi ghe imituka yawo ghakwame, imituka yawo ighende lughalugha. Wamisiri walonga, “Tutsume tukale kutali na Waisiraeli. IMNDEWA kowapfila kututowa twetwe.”<verse eid="EXO 14:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="EXO 14:26" />Kuya IMNDEWA kamlongela Musa, “Gholosa ghumoko ghwako mchanya mwe ibahari, ghamatsi ghoye keli, ghawaghubike Wamisiri, na mituka yawo na iwadina farasi wawo.” <verse eid="EXO 14:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EXO 14:27" />Apfo Musa kagholosa ghumoko ghwake mchanya mwe ibahari. Hakuchile ibahari yuya ka pfaikalagha, Wamisiri tsawabama watsume kulawa mmatsi, lekeni IMNDEWA kawakunughitsa mwibahari. <verse eid="EXO 14:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EXO 14:28" />Ghamatsi tsaghaghubika mituka ne iwadina farasi, iwamasikali wose wa Farao iwawawinzile Waisiraeli tsawafa mna ghamatsi. Ng'ahonile baye hata Mmisiri yumwe. <verse eid="EXO 14:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="EXO 14:29" />Lekeni Waisiraeli tsawabita haghatighati he ibahari hanu hasakale ghendo na ghamatsi tsaghema ka mibanda ubali wawo wa kujilo na wa kumoso.<verse eid="EXO 14:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="EXO 14:30" />Apfo pfipfo IMNDEWA pfayawakombole Waisiraeli mna ghamoko gha Wamisiri, nawo Waisiraeli wawona Wamisiri iwafile mmbalimbali mwe ibahari. <verse eid="EXO 14:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="EXO 14:31" />Waisiraeli hawonile chinu acho chikulu chayatendile IMNDEWA kwa Wamisiri, wampfuka Imulungu na wamtoghola Imulungu ne imtumwa wake Musa.<verse eid="EXO 14:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="EXO 15" />
  <para style="s">Wila wa Musa na Mariamu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 15:1" />Baho Musa na Waisiraeli wamwimbila IMNDEWA wila uno,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EXO 15:1">“Nitsomwimbila IMNDEWA kwaapfila kahuma kwa kutunyighwa ghendo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EXO 15:1">kawasa mwibahari iwafarasi ne imdina farasi wake.<verse eid="EXO 15:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 15:2" />Imulungu yuyo yangaile nene ingupfu na nene nomwimbila yeye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EXO 15:2">yeye imwenyegho yuyo yang'ombole.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EXO 15:2">Yeye ka Imulungu wangu nitsomtunya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EXO 15:2">Imulungu wa aba wangu, na nene nitsomtunya,<verse eid="EXO 15:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 15:3" />Imulungu ka imunu wa ng'onde, taghwa lyake IMNDEWA.”<verse eid="EXO 15:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 15:4" />“Mituka ya Farao na maasikali wake kawasa mwibahari, iwatawala wayaghe yawakundile watsama mna ibahali ya Shamu.<verse eid="EXO 15:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 15:5" />Ghamatsi mengi ghawaghubika,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EXO 15:5">tsawatsama mna pfina pfighendese ka libwe.”<verse eid="EXO 15:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 15:6" />“Ghwee Imulungu, ghumoko ghwako ghwa kujilo ghuna ngupfu ya ukukangawatsa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EXO 15:6">kwa ghumoko ghwako ghugho kuwahondahonda Wamisiri.<verse eid="EXO 15:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 15:7" />Kwa uwetso wako mkulu ghweghwe kowalaghatsa awala iwokuhila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EXO 15:7">koilekelela imaya yako, nayo yowalakatsa ka mabiwi.<verse eid="EXO 15:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 15:8" />Kwa muhe wako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EXO 15:8">ghamatsi tsaghelundika hamwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EXO 15:8">ghamatsi tsa ghema wima ka lubanda,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EXO 15:8">ghamatsi ighali mna pfina pfighendese hasi mwe ibahari tsaghaghanda.”<verse eid="EXO 15:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 15:9" />Ayula iyotuhila tsakalonga, “Nowakoleletsa niwaghoghe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EXO 15:9">nitsoghola pfinu pfawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EXO 15:9">nisole pfanibama,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EXO 15:9">nitsosomola limaghe lyangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EXO 15:9">ghumoko ghwangu ghutsowakoma.”<verse eid="EXO 15:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 15:10" />Kwa kuhumula kwako mala lumwe, ghwee Imulungu, kulitenda libeho lidume, nayo ibahari iwaghubika,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EXO 15:10">watsama ka ichuma mna ghamatsi mengi.<verse eid="EXO 15:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 15:11" />“Ghwee Imulungu, angu mna milungu, yuhi iyeghala naghwe?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EXO 15:11">Yuhi iyali ka ghweghwe, yuli mwenzeluka mkulu?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EXO 15:11">Yuhi iyodaha kutenda pfihulo pfikulu</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EXO 15:11">na ghamatendo makulu ka ghweghwe?<verse eid="EXO 15:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 15:12" />Tsakugholosa ghumoko ghwako ghwa kujilo ghune ingupfu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EXO 15:12">nayo isi iwametsa iwotuhila.<verse eid="EXO 15:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 15:13" />Kwa uluso wako mkulu tsakuwalongotsa iwanu wako yauwakombole,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EXO 15:13">kwa ngupfu tsako kuwalongotsa kune isi yako ihenzeluke.<verse eid="EXO 15:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 15:14" />Iwanu wa isi tsingi wahulika, nawo wodedema kwa kupfuka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EXO 15:14">Wafilisti wengilighwa na wogha.<verse eid="EXO 15:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 15:15" />Iwakulu wa Edomu wengilighwa na wogha mkulu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EXO 15:15">Pfilongotsi wa Moabu waghudema,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EXO 15:15">iwanu wose wa Kanaani watenyuka.<verse eid="EXO 15:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 15:16" />Wengilighwa na wogha na wapfuka.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EXO 15:16">Kwa ukulu wa ngupfu tsako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EXO 15:16">wawo wenyamala tulu ka libwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EXO 15:16">mbaka iwanu wako ghwee IMNDEWA wabite,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EXO 15:16">mbaka iwanu awo yuwakombole wapfose.<verse eid="EXO 15:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 15:17" />Ghweghwe kutsowaghala iwanu wako na kuweka wakale mchidunda,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EXO 15:17">hanu yuhasaghule hawe hakaye hako ghwee IMNDEWA,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EXO 15:17">hanu haenzeluke uhatsengile kwa ghamoko ghako ghwe IMNDEWA.<verse eid="EXO 15:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 15:18" />Ghwee IMNDEWA kutsakuwa mfalume ghamatsuwa ghose.”<verse eid="EXO 15:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wila wa Mariamu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 15:19" />Waisiraeli wapfosa hanu hasakale mna ibahari, lekeni Wamisiri hawalutile hanu hasakale mna ibahari ne mituka yawo na iwafalasi wawo na iwadina iwafarasi wawo, IMNDEWA tsakaghoitsa keli ghamatsi gha ibahari, nagho ghawaghubika.<verse eid="EXO 15:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 15:20" />Nabii Mariamu, lumbu wake Aruni, tsakasola chigoma chake mmoko, na iwapinga wose wamuwinza aku wotowa pfigoma pfawo na kupfina. <verse eid="EXO 15:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 15:21" />Mariamu kawalongotsa wayaghe ukwimba, kemba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EXO 15:21">“Nitsomwimbila IMNDEWA kwaapfila kahuma kwa kutunyighwa ghendo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EXO 15:21">ifarasi ne imdina farasi wake kawasa mwibahari.”<verse eid="EXO 15:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ghamatsi gha usungu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 15:22" />Kuya Musa kawalongotsa Waisiraeli kulawa mna ibahari ya Shamu, nawo waghende mbaka mna inyika ya Shuri. Tsawaghenda mna inyika ayo kwa ghamatsuwa madatu bila kona ghamatsi. <verse eid="EXO 15:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EXO 15:23" />Hawapfikile hanu hakemighwe Mala, ng'awadahile baye kunwa ghamatsi gha hanu aho kwaapfila ghang'ali ghosungu. Hanu aho tsahakemighwa Mala kwaapfila ghamatsi ghake ghosungu <verse eid="EXO 15:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EXO 15:24" />Apfo iwanu wose wamnung'unikila Musa, walonga, “Tutsakunwa choni lelo?” <verse eid="EXO 15:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EXO 15:25" />Musa kamlilila IMNDEWA, naye Imulungu kamlangusa chibiki, Musa kachasa chibiki acho mmatsi, baho ghamatsi ghanogha.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="EXO 15:25">Kuko Imulungu kaweng'a Waisiraeli malaghitso ghawalongotse pfawatsokala. Kuya tsakawaghetsa, ili yamanye ka wodaha kumtegheletsa, <verse eid="EXO 15:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EXO 15:26" />kawalongela, “Mng'anihulikitsa pfinoghile nene IMNDEWA, Imulungu wenu hanilonga, na kutenda aghala ghanighona nene ghanogha, na kutegheletsa pfinoghile aghala ghose ghaniwalaghitsa, nene sitsomghalilani matamu ghala ghaniwaghalile Wamisiri. Kwaapfila nene yuyo IMNDEWA yanimhonetsani mwemwe.”<verse eid="EXO 15:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="EXO 15:27" />Kuya Waisiraeli wapfika Elimu, hakukalile na tsimbwibwi kumi na mbili ne imitende sabini. Nawo tsawakala baho habehi ne ghamatsi.<verse eid="EXO 15:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="EXO 16" />
  <para style="s">Imulungu koghala mana na iwang'wale</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 16:1" />Waisiraeli wose tsawalawa mna isi ya Elimu, nawo wapfika mna inyika ya Sini ikalile haghatighati mwa isi ya Elimu na Sinai. Tsa tsuwa lya kumi na tano mna ghumwetsi ghwa keli kulawa Waisiraeli hawalawile Misiri. <verse eid="EXO 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 16:2" />Ako kunyika Waisiraeli wose wawanung'unikila Musa na Aruni <verse eid="EXO 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 16:3" />wawalongela, “Ng'apfu IMNDEWA yang'atukomile hatung'ali Misiri. Ako kwatukalile aku pfiya pfe tsinyama pfitutsunguluka, ako tsatung'ali twakuja pfijo pfose pfatubamile, lekeni mwemwe mtughala akuno kunyika mtukome kwe nzala!”<verse eid="EXO 16:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 16:4" />Baho IMNDEWA kamlongela Musa, “Nene nitsowaghalila mvula ye pfighate kulawa kulanga. Chila tsuwa iwanu watsolawa na kudondola ichijo che litsuwa alyo. Kwa kutenda pfino nitsowaghetsa mbone ka watsoghakinda ghamalaghitso ghangu. <verse eid="EXO 16:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 16:5" />Mne litsuwa lya sita watsodondola mala mbili ya ichijo chila chawadondolagha.”<verse eid="EXO 16:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 16:6" />Apfo Musa na Aruni wawalongela Waisiraeli wose, “Nemihe ino mtsomanya ka Imulungu yuyo iyawalapfile Misiri! <verse eid="EXO 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 16:7" />Ilupfi nemitondo mtsakona ukulu we Imulungu kwaapfila kaghahulika manung'uniko ghenu ighamnung'unikila. Twetwe tsina nani mbaka mtunung'unikile?” <verse eid="EXO 16:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 16:8" />Kuya Musa kalonga, “Nemihe, IMNDEWA katsomwing'ani nyama mje, nemitondo katsomwing'ani pfighate mje mwighute, kwaapfila kaghahulika manung'uniko ighamnung'unikila. Ng'amtunung'unikila twetwe baye ila mwomnung'unikila IMNDEWA.”<verse eid="EXO 16:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 16:9" />Kuya Musa kamlongela Aruni, “Walongele Waisiraeli wose wetingane hambele he Imulungu kwaapfila kaghahulika manung'uniko ghenu.” <verse eid="EXO 16:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 16:10" />Aruni hayang'ali yolonga na Waisiraeli wose, iwanu wose walola kwaili inyika, bahala ukulu we IMNDEWA woneka mna liwingu. <verse eid="EXO 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 16:11" />IMNDEWA kamlongela Musa, <verse eid="EXO 16:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 16:12" />“Nighahulika manung'uniko gha Waisiraeli. Lelo walongele pfino nemihe watsakuja inyama, na nemitondo watsakuja pfighate. Baho mtsomanya ka nene, yanili IIMNDEWA, na Imulungu wenu.”<verse eid="EXO 16:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 16:13" />Mihe ayo tsawatsa ng'wale wengi, nawo waghubika pfibumbulika pfa Waisiraeli. Nemitondo yake lilawila litungwe litsunguluka pfibumbulika pfose pfa Waisiraeli. <verse eid="EXO 16:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 16:14" />Litungwe alyo halyukile muisi, kunyika tsakoneka chinu ka chighate chidoghodogho na chibewe. <verse eid="EXO 16:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 16:15" />Waisiraeli hawachonile, ng'awachimanyile baye, tsaweghutsa, “Achi chinu chachi lelo?” Kwaapfila ng'awamanyile baye tsa chinu chachi.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="EXO 16:15">Musa kawalongela, “Achi chicho ichijo chayaweng'ile IMNDEWA mje. <verse eid="EXO 16:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 16:16" />Imulungu kowalaghitsa apfi, chila imunu yadondole ichijo chayodaha ukuja, yadondole makimbo meli kwa chila munu iyali mkaye mwake.”<verse eid="EXO 16:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 16:17" />Waisiraeli Watenda apfo, wamwenga wadondola pfingi, wamwenga wadondola chidogho. <verse eid="EXO 16:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 16:18" />Hawapfipimile pfighate pfawadondole, na awala iwadondole pfingi, tsawahela ipfitsidile, na awala iwadondole chidogho, tsawahela ipfihunguke. Chila munu tsakadondola chayadahile kuja. <verse eid="EXO 16:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 16:19" />Musa kawalongela, “Imunu wowose yaleke kuchileka ichijo acho chikale mbaka nemitondo.” <verse eid="EXO 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 16:20" />Lekeni iwanu wamwenga ng'awamuhulikitse Musa baye. Tsawachileka chijo acho mbaka nemitondo. Lekeni nemitondo haipfikile chijo acho tsa china membele wengi na chanza kunung'a. Apfo Musa kawonela maya iwanu awo. <verse eid="EXO 16:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 16:21" />Chila nemitondo chila munu tsakadondola ichijo chayodaha ukuja. Tsuwa haliwile kali chijo chila chawachilekile hasi tsachilumbuka. <verse eid="EXO 16:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 16:22" />Mne litsuwa lya sita Waisiraeli tsawadondola chijo chila mala mbili, chila imunu makimbo mane. Iwabala wose wa Waisiraeli wamghendela Musa, wamlongela chinu acho. <verse eid="EXO 16:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EXO 16:23" />Musa kawalongela, “Apfo pfipfo pfayalongile IMNDEWA, ilupfi litsuwa lya kubwihila, litsuwa alyo lilapfighwa liwe lya IMNDEWA. Mghende mkambike na mpiluse chijo chambama ukwambika, na chijo chila ichikala mchileke mje ilupfi.” <verse eid="EXO 16:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EXO 16:24" />Apfo wachileka ichijo chikalile mbaka nemitondo ka pfayalaghitse Musa, nacho ng'acholile baye na tsa chahela membele. <verse eid="EXO 16:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EXO 16:25" />Musa kawalongela, “Mchije lelo, kwaapfila leloli Litsuwa lya Kubwihila lye IMNDEWA. Leloli ng'amtsochona baye ako kunze. <verse eid="EXO 16:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EXO 16:26" />Ghamatsuwa sita mtsodondola ichijo, lekeni litsuwa lya saba, Litsuwa lya kubwihila, litsuwa alyo ng'amtsodondola baye.”<verse eid="EXO 16:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="EXO 16:27" />Mne litsuwa lya saba iwanu wamwenga tsawalawa wakadondole, lekeni ng'awonile baye pfighate. <verse eid="EXO 16:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EXO 16:28" />Baho IMNDEWA kamlongela Musa, “Mbaka tsuwachi mtsolema kughakinda malaghitso ghangu? <verse eid="EXO 16:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="EXO 16:29" />Mlole, nene IMNDEWA nimwing'ani Litsuwa lya kubwihila, ndo mana mna litsuwa lya sita nimwing'ani ichijo cha ghamatsuwa meli. Chila imunu yabwihile ukaye yake, imunu wowose aleke kulawa mna litsuwa lya saba.” <verse eid="EXO 16:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="EXO 16:30" />Apfo iwanu wabwihila mna litsuwa lya saba.<verse eid="EXO 16:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="EXO 16:31" />Waisiraeli tsawachikema ichijo acho “Mana.” Nacho tsachoneka ka tsinama tse uhemba, tsachitselu, na umta wake weghala na chighate ichikighwe uki. <verse eid="EXO 16:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="EXO 16:32" />Musa kawalongela, “Imulungu kawalaghitsa pfino, ‘Muwekile Imana iwatsukulu wenu iwakutsa, ili wachone ichijo chaniweng'ile mwemwe kunyika, haniwalapfile kulawa Misiri.’” <verse eid="EXO 16:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="EXO 16:33" />Apfo Musa kamlongela Aruni, “Sola ichiya, wike mghati makimbo meli ghe Mana, wike hambele he Imulungu, muwekile iwatsukulu wenu.” <verse eid="EXO 16:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="EXO 16:34" />Kuya Aruni keka Mana hanu haenzeluke, hane lisanduku lya laghano ili itunzighwe ka Imulungu pfayamlaghitse Musa. <verse eid="EXO 16:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="EXO 16:35" />Waisiraeli waja Mana kwa miyaka alubaini, mbaka hawapfikile habehi na isi ya Kanani, ako kwawakalile. <verse eid="EXO 16:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="EXO 16:36" />Chipimo chawapimile imana, cheghala na makimbo ishilini kwa chipimo cha efa.<verse eid="EXO 16:36" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="EXO 17" />
  <para style="s">Ghamatsi kulawa mbambalawe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 17:1" />Waisiraeli wose tsawoka mna inyika ya Sini, waghenda kulawa hanu hamwe mbaka hanu hangi ka IMNDEWA pfayalaghitse. Watsenga pfibumbulika wabwihile ako Refidimu. Lekeni ako tsakuduhu ghamatsi gho kunwa. <verse eid="EXO 17:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 17:2" />Apfo iwanu wesonga na Musa, walonga, “Utwing'e ghamatsi tunwe.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="EXO 17:2">Musa kawaghutsa, “Ule mwisonga na nene? Mbona mwomghetsa IMNDEWA?” <verse eid="EXO 17:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 17:3" />Lekeni wose tsawana ing'ilu sideke, wamnung'unikila musa, walonga, “Ebali utulapfile Misiri utukome kwa ng'ilu twetwe wose ne iwanetu ne iwanyama wetu?”<verse eid="EXO 17:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 17:4" />Apfo Musa kamlilila IMNDEWA, kalonga, “Nitendetse nene ne iwanu wano? Wahabehi ghendo kunitowa na ghamabwe.”<verse eid="EXO 17:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 17:5" />IMNDEWA kamlongela Musa, “Ulongole hambele ha iwanu wano, uwasole iwabala wawo, na ukinde mmoko mwako ing'weku ila yautowele ghumto Naili. <verse eid="EXO 17:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 17:6" />Nitsakwima hambele ako Horebu, hane libambalawe, naghwe kutsolitowa libambalawe alyo ne ng'weku yako, ghamatsi ghatsolawa mna libambalawe alyo, na iwanu wose watsakunwa.” Musa katenda pfipfo aku iwabala wa Waisiraeli womlola.<verse eid="EXO 17:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 17:7" />Hanu aho Musa tsakahakema Masa na Meriba kwaapfila Waisiraeli tsawesonga na wamghetsa Imulungu, tsawalonga, “Apfi Imulungu ghendo ka hamwe na twetwe?”<verse eid="EXO 17:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Waisiraeli wetowa na Waamaleki</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 17:8" />Waamaleki tsawatsa kwitowa ne Waisiraeli ako Rafidimu. <verse eid="EXO 17:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 17:9" />Musa kamlongela Yoshua, “Saghula wamale mghende mketowe ne Waamaleki. Ilupfi nitsakwima kuchanya aku nikinda ing'weku ila iyanongele Imulungu nikinde.” <verse eid="EXO 17:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 17:10" />Yoshua tsakatenda ka Musa pfayamlaghitse, kaghenda kwitowa ne Waamaleki. Lekeni Musa na Aruni na Huri, wao tsawadina kuchanya. <verse eid="EXO 17:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 17:11" />Musa hayenule ghamoko ghake kuchanya, Waisiraeli tsawahuma, lekeni hayauhulumse Waamaleki tsawahuma. <verse eid="EXO 17:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 17:12" />Ghamoko gha Musa haghepfile, Aruni na Huri wasola libwe kulu wamghalila Musa yakalile. Kuya waghakindilitsa ghamoko ghake, Yumwe kenula ghumoko ghwa kujilo na yungi kenula ghumoko ghwa kumoso. Apfo ghamoko gha Musa ghagholoka uchanya mbaka litsuwa haliswele. <verse eid="EXO 17:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 17:13" />Kwa kutenda apfo Yoshua tsakawatowa ghendo Waamaleki.<verse eid="EXO 17:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 17:14" />Imulungu kamlongela Musa, “Uchandike mchitabu chinu chino, chiwakumbuse. Kuya umlongele Yoshua ka nene nitsowakoma ghendo Waamaleki wahupe.” <verse eid="EXO 17:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 17:15" />Musa tsakatsenga hanu ha kutambikila, kahakema hanu aho, “IMNDEWA yuyo ibendela yangu.” <verse eid="EXO 17:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 17:16" />Kalonga, “Mwinule uchanya bendela ye IMNDEWA! Imulungu katsetowa na Waamaleki kulawa lukolo mbaka lukolo lungi.”<verse eid="EXO 17:16" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="EXO 18" />
  <para style="s">Yesiro komwangila Musa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 18:1" />Yetiro, aba mkwe wake Musa, mlapfa nambiko wa Midiani, tsakahulika pfinu pfose IMNDEWA pfayamtendele Musa, na Imulungu pfayawalapfile Waisiraeli mna isi ya Misiri.<verse eid="EXO 18:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 18:2" />Apfo Yetiro kamghendela Musa aku kelongotsa na Sipora, mwehe wa Musa. Musa tsakamuyitsa ipinga ayo ukaye kwa aba wake. <verse eid="EXO 18:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 18:3" />Yetiro pfipfila kaghenda ne iwana weli wa Musa. Imwana yumwe tsakakemighwa Geshom, kwaapfila Musa tsakalonga, “Nitsumila mna isi ya ugheni.” <verse eid="EXO 18:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 18:4" />Wakabili tsakakemighwa Eliezeli, kwaapfila Musa tsakalonga, “Imulungu wa aba wangu iyo iyanyapfile ndeke kukomighwa na Farao.” <verse eid="EXO 18:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 18:5" />Yetiro mkwe wake Musa, tsakatsa ne imwanaghe, mwehe wa Musa, ne iwana, kampfika Musa kunyika ako kwayakalile hane chidunda che Imulungu. <verse eid="EXO 18:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 18:6" />Yetiro tsakatuma iwanu wamlongele Musa ka yeye kakutsa na Sipora ne iwanaghe weli, <verse eid="EXO 18:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 18:7" />Musa kalawa, kaghenda kumbokela mkwe wake, kenama hambele hake kamnonela. Welamsa kuya woya ukaye mna chibumbulika. <verse eid="EXO 18:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 18:8" />Musa tsakamlongela mkwe wake pfinu pfose IMNDEWA pfayamtendele Farao na Wamisiri kwaajili ya Waisiraeli. Kuya kamlongela pfawang'ali wotingwa mna ghumwanza na IMNDEWA pfayawakombole. <verse eid="EXO 18:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 18:9" />Yetiro kadeng'elela hayahulike ghose IMNDEWA ghayawatendele Waisiraeli. <verse eid="EXO 18:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 18:10" />Yetiro kalonga, “Yatunyighwe IMNDEWA iyawakombole mna ghamoko gha Wamisiri na kuwalapfa mna utumwa wa Farao. <verse eid="EXO 18:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 18:11" />Sambi nomanya IMNDEWA ka mkulu kubita milungu yose, kwaapfila kawakombola iwanu wano mna ghamoko gha Wamisiri iwawatendele ghehile.” <verse eid="EXO 18:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 18:12" />Kuya Yetiro mkwe wa Musa kamlapfila IMNDEWA nambiko tsa kulakatsighwa na tsisadaka tsingi. Naye Aruni tsakatsa ne iwabala wa Isiraeli ili waje ichijo cho ukumtunya IMNDEWA hamwe na Yetiro.<verse eid="EXO 18:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Walamutsi wosaghulighwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 18:13" />Ilupfi yake Musa tsakakala hasi kulamla maghomba gha Waisiraeli, nawo tsawakala wema aku wamtsunguluka, kulawa mitondo mbaka nemihe. <verse eid="EXO 18:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 18:14" />Yetiro, mkwe wake Musa, haghonile ghose Musa ghayang'ali yowatendela iwanu, kalonga, “Ebali kowatendela pfino iwanu wano? Mbona kokala hasi uliheka aku iwanu wakutsunguluka kulawa nemitondo mbaka tsuwa lyakuswa?”<verse eid="EXO 18:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 18:15" />Musa kedika, “Notenda apfi kwaapfila iwanu wonitsila nene kughutsa chayobama Imulungu. <verse eid="EXO 18:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 18:16" />Iwanu weli wang'awa na lighomba, wonitsila, na nene nolamla, kuya nowalongela ghamalaghitso ghe Imulungu na choni chayobama Imulungu.”<verse eid="EXO 18:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 18:17" />Yetiro kamlongela, “Achino chautenda ng'achinoghile baye. <verse eid="EXO 18:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 18:18" />Ghweghwe ne iwanu wano wose mtsakwipfa ghendo, kwaapfila ing'onde ino ng'omu, ng'udaha baye kutenda uliheka. <verse eid="EXO 18:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 18:19" />Lelo uleke nikulongele chinu chinoghile, na Imulungu katsokwapfila. Ghweghwe kutsowemila iwanu hambele he Imulungu. Naghwe kutsomghalila Imulungu maghomba ghawo. <verse eid="EXO 18:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 18:20" />Kuya uwalangulitse malaghitso ghe Imulungu, na achila chayobama Imulungu, naghwe uwalangulitse pfawobamighwa kukala na pfawobamighwa kutenda. <verse eid="EXO 18:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 18:21" />Pfipfila usaghule iwanu iwodaha kukwapfila, iwanu iwanoghile iwompfuka Imulungu, ing'awobokela hongo baye. Uweke iwanu awo wawe iwakulu wa makingili ghe iwanu elufu elufu, miya miya, hamsinihamsini na kumi kumi. <verse eid="EXO 18:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 18:22" />Hawo watsowalamlitsa iwanu chila litsuwa. Ghamaghomba makulu watsokughalila ghweghwe, lekeni maghomba mado mado watsoghalamla iwenyegho. Kwa nzila ayo kutsodaha kuitenda sang'ano yako ileke kuwa ng'omu kwaapfila iwanu awo watsotenda na ghweghwe sang'ano ayo. <verse eid="EXO 18:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EXO 18:23" />Ung'atenda apfo, na ka apfo pfipfo pfayobama Imulungu, ghweghwe ng'utsakwipfa baye na iwanu wose wano watsakuya mmakae mwawo aku maghomba ghawo ghamala.”<verse eid="EXO 18:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="EXO 18:24" />Musa tsakategheletsa ghayalongile mkwe wake, kaghatenda ghose ghayamlongele. <verse eid="EXO 18:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EXO 18:25" />Tsakawasaghula iwanu iwodaha kumwapfila kulawa mna Waisiraeli, kawatenda wawe iwakulu we iwanu elufu elufu, miya miya, hamsini hamsini na kumi kumi. <verse eid="EXO 18:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EXO 18:26" />Nawo walamla maghomba ghe iwanu ghamatsuwa ghose, maghomba makulu wamghalila Musa, lekeni ghala mado mado waghalamla iwenyegho.<verse eid="EXO 18:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="EXO 18:27" />Kuya Musa kamuwagha Yetiro mkwe wake, naye Yetiro koya muisi mwake.<verse eid="EXO 18:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="EXO 19" />
  <para style="s">Waisiraeli mna chidunda Sinai</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 19:1" />Litsuwa lya mwanduso lya ghumwetsi ghwa kadatu kulawa hawalawile Misiri, Waisiraeli wapfika hane inyika ya Sinai. <verse eid="EXO 19:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 19:2" />Hawokile Refidimu na kupfika inyika ya Sinai, wakala habehi na chidunda Sinai. <verse eid="EXO 19:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 19:3" />Kuya Musa kagheluka mna chidunda kulonga ne Imulungu.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="EXO 19:3">Imulungu kamkema Musa kulawa mchidunda, kamlongela, “Uwalongele pfino iwana wa Yakobu, awo Waisiraeli. <verse eid="EXO 19:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 19:4" />‘Mwemwe muwenyegho tsamwona pfaniwatendele Wamisiri na pfanimsoleni ka chimanga pfayowasolagha iwanaghe kwa mapamanilo, tsaniwaghala hano kuna nene. <verse eid="EXO 19:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 19:5" />Lelo mng'anitegheletsa ghendo na kukindisa laghano lyangu, mwemwe mtsakuwa iwanu wangu. Iwanu wose iwali muisi wakwangu. Lekeni mwemwe nimsaghulani mghati mwa tsiisi tsose, <verse eid="EXO 19:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 19:6" />mwemwe kuna nene mtsakuwa undewa wa iwalapfa nambiko, na kabila ilihenzeluke.’ Uwalongele pfino Waisiraeli.” <verse eid="EXO 19:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 19:7" />Apfo Musa koya, kawakema hamwe iwabala wa Waisiraeli, kawalongela chayalaghitsighwe ne IMNDEWA. <verse eid="EXO 19:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 19:8" />Kuya Waisiraeli wose wedikila lumwe walonga, “Pfinu pfose pfayalongile IMNDEWA tutsopfitenda.” Naye Musa kamlongela IMNDEWA chinu acho.<verse eid="EXO 19:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 19:9" />IMNDEWA kamlongela Musa, “Nitsokutsila mna liwingu tito ili hanilonga naghwe Waisiraeli wanihulike, na kukutoghola ghamatsuwa ghose.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="EXO 19:9">Musa kamlongela Imulungu Waisiraeli pfawedike. <verse eid="EXO 19:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 19:10" />IMNDEWA kamlongela Musa, “Ghenda kuna iwanu wano uwadeghetse leloli na ilupfi, Walongele waghatsupfe maghwanda ghawo <verse eid="EXO 19:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 19:11" />kuya ikacha wawe tiyali, kwaapfila nene IMNDEWA nitsohulumka mna chidunda cha Sinai, na iwanu wose watsombona. <verse eid="EXO 19:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 19:12" />Kuya ghweghwe uwekile iwanu ghumbaka kutsunguluka chidunda. Uwalongele iwanu walangitse waleke kudina mchidunda wala kughughusa ghumbaka ghwake. Imunu wowose iyatsochighusa chidunda acho katsokomighwa. <verse eid="EXO 19:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 19:13" />Imunu wowose yaleke kumdonza imunu yula yalokile ghumbaka, ayo katsokomighwa kwa kutowighwa ghamabwe au kwa mghowa, yawe imunu au mnyama, ng'atsolekelighwa yawe mghima. Lekeni imalati haitsoghendelela kulila, iwanu wose watsakutsa habehi ne chidunda.”<verse eid="EXO 19:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 19:14" />Musa kahulumka mchidunda kawalongela iwanu, kawadeghesa iwanu, nawo watsapfa ghamaghwanda ghawo. <verse eid="EXO 19:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 19:15" />Kuya kawalongela iwanu wose, “Mwiyandae kwa litsuwa lya ikacha, mmale wowose aleke kuwasa ne pinga.” <verse eid="EXO 19:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 19:16" />Litsuwa lya kadatu halipfikile, nemitondo tsakulawila mdumo mchidunda, na ghumwanga na liwingu tito, na litsi kulu lya malati iliwatendile iwanu wose iwali mkambi wadedeme kwa ukupfuka. <verse eid="EXO 19:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 19:17" />Kuya Musa kawalongotsa iwanu wose kulawa kune pfibumbulika pfawo waketingane ne Imulungu. Wose waghenda, no ukwima hasi mwe chidunda. <verse eid="EXO 19:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 19:18" />Chidunda cha Sinai tsachighubikighwa na lihosi kwaapfila IMNDEWA tsakahulumka mchanya mwake kwa ghumoto. Lihosi lya ghumoto aghwo tsalighenda kuchanya ka hosi lya tanuri kulu, chidunda chose tsachidedema kwa ngupfu. <verse eid="EXO 19:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 19:19" />Litsi lya malati lyongetseka, Musa kalonga ne Imulungu. Naye Imulungu kamwidika kwa ukuduma. <verse eid="EXO 19:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 19:20" />IMNDEWA tsakahulumka mchidando mwe chidunda cha Sinai, kamkema Musa aghende mchidando, naye Musa kagheluka mchidando. <verse eid="EXO 19:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 19:21" />Kuya Imulungu kamlongela Musa, “Hulumka ukawalongele iwanu waleke kutsa kundola, hela wanu wengi mna wawo watsakufa. <verse eid="EXO 19:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 19:22" />Hata iwalapfa nambiko iwakutsa habehi na nene, wobamighwa wedeghese, hela nitsowatowa.” <verse eid="EXO 19:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EXO 19:23" />Musa kamlongela IMNDEWA, “Iwanu wano ng'awodaha baye kugheluka kuchidunda Sinai kwaapfila ghweghwe ghumwenyegho tsakutulaghitsa tughupfuke, twike ghumbaka kutsunguluka chidunda.”<verse eid="EXO 19:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="EXO 19:24" />IMNDEWA Imulungu kamlongela, “Hulumka hasi, kuya uye na Aruni. Lekeni uwaghome walapfa nambiko ne iwanu wangi waleke kuloka ghumbaka kutsa kuna nene, hela nitsowatowa.” <verse eid="EXO 19:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EXO 19:25" />Apfo Musa kawahulumkila iwanu awo, kawalongela ghose ghayalaghitsighwe.<verse eid="EXO 19:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="EXO 20" />
  <para style="s">Malaghitso kumi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 20:1" />Imulungu tsakalonga agha, tsakalonga,<verse eid="EXO 20:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 20:2" />“Nene iyo IMNDEWA, Imulungu wako, yanikulapfile mna isi ya Misiri, kwaukalile mtumwa.<verse eid="EXO 20:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 20:3" />“Uleke kuwa na milungu mingi ila nene niliyeka.<verse eid="EXO 20:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 20:4" />“Uleke kwitendela mwenyegho chinyagho ichighalile na ichinu chochose ichili kulanga, ichili muisi au mna ghamatsi hasi mwe isi. <verse eid="EXO 20:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 20:5" />Uleke kuchinamila wala kuchitambikila kwaapfila nene IMNDEWA, Imulungu wako, na Imulungu yane chepfu. Nowahigha iwana kwa nzambi tse aba tsawo, mbaka mweleko wa kadatu na mweleko wa kane wa awo iwonihila, <verse eid="EXO 20:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 20:6" />lekeni nonoghelwa na maelufu ya pfeleko iyaniwanoghela na kukinda ghamalaghitso ghangu.<verse eid="EXO 20:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 20:7" />“Uleke kulitumila pfihile taghwa lya Imfalume, Imulungu wako, kwaapfila nene IMNDEWA nitsomlagha ayula iyotumila pfihile taghwa lyangu.<verse eid="EXO 20:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 20:8" />“Uleke kulisemwa Litsuwa lya kubwihila, ulideghese. <verse eid="EXO 20:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 20:9" />Ghamatsuwa sita utende sang'ano, utende pfinu pfako pfose, <verse eid="EXO 20:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 20:10" />lekeni litsuwa lya saba, alyo Litsuwa lya kubwihila lya IMNDEWA, Imulungu wako. Litsuwa alyo uleke kutenda ng'onde yoyose, ghweghwe, wala imwanagho mmale wala imwanagho pinga, wala mtumwa wako mmale, wala mtumwa wako pinga, wala mnyama wako wa kufugha, wala mgheni iyali mkaye mwako. <verse eid="EXO 20:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 20:11" />Kwaapfila kwa ghamatsuwa sita nene IMNDEWA tsanilumba lilanga na iisi, ibahari na pfose ipfili mumo, kuya mna litsuwa lya saba tsanibwihila. Apfo nene IMNDEWA nilibaliki Litsuwa lya kubwihila, nilideghesa.”<verse eid="EXO 20:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 20:12" />“Wateghelese aba wako na mai wako, ili ukale ghamatsuwa mengi mna isi iyanitsokwing'a nene IMNDEWA, Imulungu wako.<verse eid="EXO 20:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 20:13" />“Uleke kumkoma imunu.<verse eid="EXO 20:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 20:14" />“Uleke ughoni.<verse eid="EXO 20:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 20:15" />“Uleke ukwiba.<verse eid="EXO 20:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 20:16" />“Uleke kum'bangitsila miyagho.<verse eid="EXO 20:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 20:17" />“Uleke kusulukila ing'anda ya miyagho, uleke kumsulukila mwehe wake wala mtumwa wake, ng'ombe wake wala punda wake, au ichinu chochose cha miyagho.”<verse eid="EXO 20:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Iwanu wopfuka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 20:18" />Iwanu hawahulike ukuduma na kona lumwesa lwakwaka na kuhulika litsi lya malati mna chidunda acho ichikali cholawa lihotsi, wose tsawapfuka, wadedema. Tsawema kutali, <verse eid="EXO 20:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 20:19" />wamlongela Musa, “Ulonge na twetwe ghweghwe umwenyegho, na twetwe tutsokuteghelesa, lekeni IMNDEWA Imulungu yaleke kulonga na twetwe, hela tutsakufa.”<verse eid="EXO 20:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 20:20" />Musa kawalongela, “Mleke kupfuka, kwaapfila Imulungu katsa kumghetsani ili mumtamanile yeye ghamatsuwa ghose na mleke kutenda nzambi.” <verse eid="EXO 20:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 20:21" />Iwanu hawemile kutali, Musa tsakaghenda habehi na liwingu lila tito kwayakalile Imulungu.<verse eid="EXO 20:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Malaghitso gha hanu ho ukutambikila</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 20:22" />IMNDEWA kamlongela Musa yawalongele Waisiraeli, “Mwemwe muwenyegho tsamuhulika pfanilongile namwe kulawa kulanga. <verse eid="EXO 20:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EXO 20:23" />Mnitamanile nene niliyeka, mleke kwitendela milungu ya fetsa wala nzahabu. <verse eid="EXO 20:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EXO 20:24" />Mnitsengele hanu ha kutambikila ha lidongo, baho mtsonitambikila iwang'olo wenu na wang'ombe wenu ka nambiko tsa kulakatsighwa na nambiko tsa ukukala tseghamba ne Imulungu. Hanu hohose hanihabaghule mwemwe mnitamanile, nitsakutsa baho na kumbalikini. <verse eid="EXO 20:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EXO 20:25" />Mng'anitendela hanu ha kutambikila ha ghamabwe, mleke kuhatsenga kwa ghamabwe ighasongolighwe, kwaapfila mng'atumila pfinu pfa ukusongolela ghamabwe, ng'ahatsakuwa hanu hanoghile kuna nene. <verse eid="EXO 20:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EXO 20:26" />Kuya mleke kutsenga hanu ha kutambikila hane pfidanando, hela imunu yang'adina mchanya mwake katsokala mwatsi.<verse eid="EXO 20:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="EXO 21" />
  <para style="s">Waisiraeli pfawabamighwe kuwatendela iwatumwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 21:1" />“Aghano ghagho ghamalaghitso ghautsoweng'a Waisiraeli. <verse eid="EXO 21:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 21:2" />Ung'amghula mtumwa Mweburaniya, katsokusang'anila kwa miyaka sita, lekeni ghumwaka ghwa saba, yalekelelighwe yoke bila kumliha chinu chochose. <verse eid="EXO 21:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 21:3" />Ka hayatsile kuna ghweghwe katsa yaliyeka, yalekelelighwe yoke yaliyeka. Lekeni ka katsa na mwehe wake, yoke na mwehe wake. <verse eid="EXO 21:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 21:4" />Ka munu yamghulile tsakamkwelela pinga, na ipinga ayo kamwelekela wana wamale ne wapinga, ipinga ayo ne wanaghe watsakuwa wa mtwatsa wake, mtumwa ayo yoke yaliyeka. <verse eid="EXO 21:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 21:5" />Lekeni imtumwa ayo yang'alonga konoghelwa na imtwatsa wake, mwehe wake na iwanaghe na ng'obama baye kulekelighwa yoke, <verse eid="EXO 21:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 21:6" />Imunu ayo katsomghala hambele he Imulungu. Kuya katsomghala hane ghumlango au chitsingiti katsomtogha ghutwi lyake kwa sanzia, naye katsomsang'anila imtwatsa wake matsuwa ghose gha ughima wake<verse eid="EXO 21:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 21:7" />“Imunu yang'amuutsa imwanaghe pinga yawe mtumwa, ayo ng'atsolekelelighwa yoke baye ka iwatumwa iwamale pfawolekelelighwa. <verse eid="EXO 21:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 21:8" />Ka imunu'yo iyamghulile kobama yawe pinga wake, lekeni ambele ng'onoghelwa naye baye, imunu'yo yamuyitse kwa aba wake, kwayamghulile. Imunu'yo yaleke kumuutsa keli kwa iwagheni, kwaapfila chinu chayamtendele si cha kutogholighwa baye. <verse eid="EXO 21:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 21:9" />Ka kamghula yakwelighwe ne imwanaghe, yamtendele ka pfayowatendela neghe tsake. <verse eid="EXO 21:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 21:10" />Imunu yang'akwela ipinga yungi, yaghendelele kumwing'a mwehe wake wa mwanduso ichijo chichila, ghamaghwanda na kuwasa naye ka pfaikalile mwanduso. <verse eid="EXO 21:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 21:11" />Ka imunu'yo ng'odaha baye kumtendela agho madatu, pinga ayo yalekelelighwe yoke kwa aba wake bila kuliha chinu chochose.<verse eid="EXO 21:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ukwilagha na Malaghitso ghake.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 21:12" />“Imunu wowose iyomtowa miyaghe na kumkoma, naye yakomighwe. <verse eid="EXO 21:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 21:13" />Lekeni ka ng'abamile baye kumkoma, ila Imulungu kaleka ilawile apfo, imunu'yo kodaha kutsumila hanu hanitsomlangusani. <verse eid="EXO 21:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 21:14" />Lekeni imunu yang'amtowa miyaghe na kumkoma kwa ghiladi, hata ka kutsumila hanu hangu ha kulapfila nambiko, mtsomlapfa ako na kumkoma.<verse eid="EXO 21:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 21:15" />“Imunu wowose iyomtowa aba wake au mai wake, ayo naye yakomighwe ghendo.<verse eid="EXO 21:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 21:16" />“Imunu wowose iyomwiba miyaghe na kumuutsa au kumtenda yawe mtumwa wake, imunu'yo yakomighwe.<verse eid="EXO 21:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 21:17" />“Imunu iyomligha aba wake au mai wake, ayo naye yakomighwe.<verse eid="EXO 21:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 21:18" />“Ka wanu weli wesonga, kuya munu yumwe komtowa miyaghe kwa libwe au kwa ligumi lekeni ng'afile baye, ila kamlagha mbaka kawasa mlusatsi koghula, <verse eid="EXO 21:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 21:19" />hayatsokwinuka keli na kulawa kunze kwa ng'weku, imunu'yo iyamlaghile miyaghe katsolekelighwa. Lekeni katsomliha kwa ghamatsuwa ghayawasile mlusatsi, naye katsomng'osola mbaka ahone ghendo.<verse eid="EXO 21:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 21:20" />“Munu yang'amfapula imtumwa wake mmale au imtumwa wake pinga na kumkoma baho, imunu'yo naye yakomighwe. <verse eid="EXO 21:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 21:21" />Lekeni imtumwa ayo yang'ahona mna litsuwa limwe au meli, mtwatsa wake ng'atsohighighwa baye, kwaapfila imtumwa ayo yang'ali wa kwake.<verse eid="EXO 21:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 21:22" />“Iwamale wang'etowa na baho wamlaghe ipinga yane inda mbaka inda yake ilawe, bila kumlagha hanu hangi, ayula iyamlaghile katsoliha chochose choyobama immale we ipinga ayo yamlihe na ka walamtsi pfawatsolamla. <verse eid="EXO 21:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EXO 21:23" />Lekeni ka kamlagha ng'ani, naye imunu'yo yalaghighwe pfipfo, ka kamkoma naye yakomighwe <verse eid="EXO 21:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EXO 21:24" />nenge kwa nenge, tsino kwa tsino, ghumwoko kwa ghumoko, mghulu kwa mghulu, <verse eid="EXO 21:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EXO 21:25" />ka kamlakatsa naye yalakatsighwe, ka kamlapfa chilonda naye yalapfighwe chilonda, ka kamlapfa nundu naye yalapfighwe nundu.<verse eid="EXO 21:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="EXO 21:26" />“Imunu yang'amtowa imtumwa wake mmale au pinga na kumlagha nenge yake, yamlekelele imtumwa ayo yoke kwa achila chayamtendile mna nenge yake. <verse eid="EXO 21:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EXO 21:27" />Pfipfila yang'amtowa mtumwa wake na kumng'ola litsino, yamlekelele yoke kwa achila chayamtendile mna tsino lyake.<verse eid="EXO 21:27" /></para>
  <para style="s">Malaghitso kwe imunu yofugha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="EXO 21:28" />“Ing'ombe yang'amuhoma imunu na membe yake na kumkoma, ing'ombe'yo yakomighwe kwa kutowighwa ghamabwe na nyama yake ileke kujighwa, lekeni imunu yane ing'ombe'yo katsolekelelighwa. <verse eid="EXO 21:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="EXO 21:29" />Lekeni ka ing'ombe'yo katsowela kuhoma iwanu na membe tsake, naye imunu yane ing'ombe tsakalongelighwa mbuli'yo, lekeni ng'amwohile baye, ing'ombe'yo yang'amkoma imunu, yatowighwe kwa ghamabwe na imunu yane ing'ombe'yo naye yakomighwe. <verse eid="EXO 21:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="EXO 21:30" />Lekeni imunu'yo ka kobamighwa yalihe kukombola ughima wake, kobamighwa yalihe chochose chayabamighwe kuliha. <verse eid="EXO 21:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="EXO 21:31" />Ing'ombe yang'amkoma imwana mmale au imwana pinga, laghitso lilino litsotumika. <verse eid="EXO 21:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="EXO 21:32" />Ka ing'ombe kamkoma imtumwa mmale au pinga, yane ng'ombe'yo katsomliha yane imtumwa'yo tsisendi selasini, na ng'ombe'yo katsokomighwa kwa kutowighwa ghamabwe.<verse eid="EXO 21:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="EXO 21:33" />“Ka imunu ng'aghubike baye lisimo lyake, au yang'ahimba lisimo na ng'alighubike baye, na ing'ombe au ipunda we imunu yungi yang'engila amwo, <verse eid="EXO 21:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="EXO 21:34" />yane lisimo'lyo katsoliha fidia, yamlihe yane ing'ombe'yo au ipunda'yo na mnyama ayo yafile katsakuwa wake. <verse eid="EXO 21:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="EXO 21:35" />Ng'ombe we munu yang'amlagha ing'ombe we imunu yungi na kumkoma, wamuutse ng'ombe'yo mghima wegholele tsisendi, pfipfila wegholele tsinyama tsa ng'ombe'yo iyafile. <verse eid="EXO 21:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="EXO 21:36" />Lekeni ka ing'ombe'yo tsakatsowela kuwatowa wayaghe na tsimembe tsake, na imunu yane ing'ombe'yo ng'amwohile baye, munu'yo kamtsoliha miyaghe ing'ombe yungi, na ayula iyafile katsakuwa wa kwake.<verse eid="EXO 21:36" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 21" />
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="EXO 22" />
  <para style="s">Ghamalaghitso gho ukumliha miyagho</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 22:1" />“Ka munu keba ing'ombe au ing'olo, naye komkoma au komuutsa, imunu'yo yalihe wang'ombe watano kwa ng'ombe yula yumwe iyamwibile na wang'olo wane kwa ing'olo yula yumwe iyamwibile. <verse eid="EXO 22:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 22:2" />Mwitsi yang'aghoghighwa aku kobena ing'anda nechilo, naye yang'atowighwa mbaka yafe, imunu iyamkomile ng'atotsile baye. <verse eid="EXO 22:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 22:3" />Lekeni mwitsi'yo yang'aghoghighwa nemisi, naye yang'akomighwa, imunu'yo iyamkomile katotsa.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="EXO 22:3">“Mwitsi kobamighwa yalihe achila chayebile. Ka kahela chinu cha kuliha, yeye imwenyegho yautsighwe yakawe mtumwa na sendi itsibokelighwa tsilihile achila chayebile. <verse eid="EXO 22:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 22:4" />Ka keba mnyama na imnyama ayo koneka ka mghima kwa mwitsi'yo, yawe ing'ombe, au ipunda au ing'olo, mwitsi'yo katsoliha wanyama weli kwa ayula yumwe iyamwibile.<verse eid="EXO 22:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 22:5" />“Imunu yang'awaleka wanyama wake waje mna mghunda ghwa mitsabibu ghwa miyaghe, au kumlekela mnyama wake mna mghunda ghwe imunu yungi, katsoliha pfijo pfinoghile ipfili mumghunda mwake imwenyegho, au ipfili mna mghunda ghwake ghwa mitsabibu.<verse eid="EXO 22:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 22:6" />“Imunu yang'abwina ghumoto mna mghunda ghwake, naghwo ghung'alakatsa imitsani no ukwenela mbaka ghulakatse malundo gha ngano au ngano ng'ana ipfunighwe ye imunu yungi, au mghunda ghose, imunu'yo yabwinile ghumoto'ghwo yalihe.<verse eid="EXO 22:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 22:7" />“Imunu yang'amlekela miyaghe fetsa au mali ingi yamwikile, kuya pfibighwa mng'anda mwake, mwitsi yang'aghoghighwa katsoliha mala mbili. <verse eid="EXO 22:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 22:8" />Lekeni ka mwitsi'yo ng'oneke baye, iyane ing'anda katsoghalighwa kwe walamtsi ili yalanguse ka si yeye baye iyebile mali ya miyaghe.<verse eid="EXO 22:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 22:9" />“Ka iwanu weli wesongela ing'ombe, au ipunda, au ing'olo, au maghwanda au chinu chochose ichaghile, na chila imunu kolonga cha kwake, iwanu awo weli waghalighwe kwe walamtsi iwakalile hambele he Imulungu. Ayula walamtsi yawatsolamla katotsa, ayo katsomliha miyaghe mala mbili.<verse eid="EXO 22:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 22:10" />“Imunu yang'amwing'a miyaghe ipunda, ing'ombe, ing'olo au mnyama wowose yamwikile, na mnyama ayo yafe au yalaghighwe au yasolighwe bila imunu wowose kumwona, <verse eid="EXO 22:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 22:11" />imunu iyamwikile mnyama ayo yelahe hambele he IMNDEWA ka ng'ebile baye mnyama wa miyaghe, naye imunu yane imnyama ayo katsotoghola, na ayo miyaghe ng'atsoliha baye chinu chochose. <verse eid="EXO 22:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 22:12" />Lekeni ka imnyama kebighwa kuna yeye, yeye imwenyegho kobamighwa yamlihe imnyama ayo. <verse eid="EXO 22:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 22:13" />Ka imyama ayo kakomighwa ne iwanyama wa kumuhulo, imunu ayo iyamwikile imnyama ayo yamghale imnyama ayo yafile yakamlanguse imwenyegho. Kuya yeye ng'atsoliha chinu chochose baye kwa imnyama ayo iyakomighwe ne iwanyama wa kumuhulo.<verse eid="EXO 22:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 22:14" />“Imunu ang'atsima imnyama kwa miyaghe, kuya mnyama ayo yalaghighwe au yafe aku mwenyegho ng'ali baho baye, imunu iyatsimile mnyama ayo, katsoliha. <verse eid="EXO 22:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 22:15" />Lekeni ka imwenyegho tsakabaho, imunu ayo iyatsime ng'atsoliha chinu chochose baye. Ila ka tsakamkodi imnyama ayo, yane imnyama ayo yasole isendi ya kodi iliyeka.<verse eid="EXO 22:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Iwanu pfawobamighwa kukala</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 22:16" />“Ka imunu komnyenganyenga imwali yang'ana yawase ne mmale baye, na wala ng'ana yalapfighwe tsengele, na kuwasa naye, imunu ayo yalampfile tsengele na yamkwele imwali ayo. <verse eid="EXO 22:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 22:17" />Lekeni aba wa imwali ayo ang'alema kumleka imwanaghe yakwelighwe, imunu ayo katsoliha sendi ya tsengele iibamighwa kwa imwali yang'ana yawase ne mmale.<verse eid="EXO 22:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 22:18" />“Umkome ipinga mhawi, uleke kumleka yawe mghima.<verse eid="EXO 22:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 22:19" />“Imunu yowasa ne imnyama, ayo yakomighwe.<verse eid="EXO 22:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 22:20" />“Imunu yomlapfila nambiko mulungu yungi, na si IMNDEWA yaliyeka baye, ayo yakomighwe ghendo.<verse eid="EXO 22:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 22:21" />“Mleke kumtendela pfihile imgheni wala kumdununza, kwaapfila mwemwe pfipfila tsamkala wagheni mna isi ya Misiri. <verse eid="EXO 22:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 22:22" />Mleke kumtendela pfihile mghane, wala imwana mchuwa. <verse eid="EXO 22:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EXO 22:23" />Mng'awatendela apfo, nawo wang'anililila, nene nitsohulika chililo chawo, <verse eid="EXO 22:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EXO 22:24" />nitsowonelani maya, na nitsowakoma mna ing'ondo. Wehe tsenu watsakuwa waghane na iwanenu watsakuwa wachuwa.<verse eid="EXO 22:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="EXO 22:25" />“Ung'amwatsima tsisendi imunu wowose mhingwa mna iwanu wangu, uleke kumlongela yakulihe, wala kusola liba kuna yeye. <verse eid="EXO 22:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EXO 22:26" />Ka miyagho kakwikila poni lighwanda lyake, umuyitsile lighwanda alyo ng'ana litsuwa liswe. <verse eid="EXO 22:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EXO 22:27" />Kwaapfila lighwanda lyake lyo kwighubika lilyo liliyeka. Lelo atseghubika choni hayatsowasa nechilo? Ang'andilila nitsomuhulika kwaapfila nene nina libatsi.<verse eid="EXO 22:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="EXO 22:28" />“Uleke kumlonga pfihile Imulungu, wala kumlighita imkulu we iwanu wako.<verse eid="EXO 22:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="EXO 22:29" />“Mleke kukawa kundapfila ipfijo pfinoghile pfampfuna na idipfai yenu.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="EXO 22:29">“Mngaye iwana wenu iwamale iwalongole ukwelekighwa. <verse eid="EXO 22:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="EXO 22:30" />Mngaye iwana iwamale iwalongole kwelekighwa we iwang'ombe na we iwang'olo wenu. Muwaleke wakale na mamo tsawo kwa ghamatsuwa saba, na mna litsuwa lya nane ndapfileni nene.<verse eid="EXO 22:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="EXO 22:31" />“Mwemwe mtsakuwa iwanu wangu, apfo mleke kuija inyama ye imnyama wowose iyakomighwe ne iwanyama wa kumuhulo, ila wasileni iwambwa inyama ayo.<verse eid="EXO 22:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 22" />
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="EXO 23" />
  <para style="s">Watendeleni pfinoghile iwanu ne iwanyama</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 23:1" />“Mleke kulonga ung'enye. Mleke kumwapfila imunu yehile kwa kulonga ughutsu. <verse eid="EXO 23:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 23:2" />Mleke ukwanga ne iwanu iwotenda ghehile, wala kulonga ughutsu hane libalatsa kwaapfila iwanu wengi iwali baho wolonga ughutsu. <verse eid="EXO 23:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 23:3" />Hamuhigha lighomba lya mhingwa, mleke kumlola mchihanga.<verse eid="EXO 23:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 23:4" />“Ung'amwona ing'ombe au ipunda we imuhile wako kagha, umuyitsile imwenyegho. <verse eid="EXO 23:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 23:5" />Ung'amwona ipunda we imuhile wako kaghwa na mtsigho ghwake, uleke kumleka, umwapfile kumwinula.<verse eid="EXO 23:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 23:6" />“Hamuhigha lighomba lya mhingwa, muhighe ka Imulungu pfayobama. <verse eid="EXO 23:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 23:7" />Mleke kuwabangitsila iwanu maghomba gha ughutsu, wala kuwakoma iwanu yawang'atendile ghehile na iwanoghile, kwaapfila nene sitsomleka baye imunu yehile. <verse eid="EXO 23:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 23:8" />Mleke kubokela hongo, kwaapfila hongo yowatenda iwakulu wawe pfifita na kuleka kuhigha pfinoghile mbuli tsa iwanu wanoghile.<verse eid="EXO 23:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 23:9" />“Uleke kumtendela pfihile imgheni, mwemwe mwomanya ugheni pfauli, kwaapfila tsamkala wagheni mna isi ya Misiri.<verse eid="EXO 23:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ghumwaka wa saba na litsuwa lya saba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 23:10" />“Kutsohanda na kupfuna mighunda yako kwa miyaka sita, <verse eid="EXO 23:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 23:11" />lekeni mna ghumwaka ghwa saba, kutsoileka imighunda yako iwase, ili iwahingwa yamkala nawo wadahe kusalalitsa mna imighunda ayo, na iwanyama wa kumuhulo waje. Kutsotenda pfipfo mna mighunda ye mitsabibu na mitseituni.<verse eid="EXO 23:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 23:12" />“Kutsosang'ana ng'onde tsako tsose kwa matsuwa sita, lekeni mna litsuwa lya saba kutsobwihila, ili nawo ng'ombe wako na punda wako wabwihile, na iwanagho na iwatumwa wako mapinga na iwagheni wabwihile.<verse eid="EXO 23:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 23:13" />“Mghakinde ghose ghaniwalongele. Mleke kuitambikila milungu ingi, wala mataghwa ghawo ghaleke kuhulikighwa mna milomo yenu.<verse eid="EXO 23:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pfihungo pfikulu pfidatu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 23:14" />“Chila mwaka mtsonitendela chihungo mala ndatu kunideng'elela nene. <verse eid="EXO 23:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 23:15" />Mtsotenda chihungo che pfighate ipfilihela ihamila. Kwa matsuwa saba mje ipfighate ipfilihela ihamila ka pfaniwalaghitse. Mtende apfo mna matsuwa ighasaghulighwe ighali mna ghumwetsi ghwa Abibu, kwaapfila mna ghumwetsi aghwo mwemwe tsamlawa Misiri. Imunu wowose hayakutsa kunitambikila, yaleke kutsa ghamoko ghaliheka.<verse eid="EXO 23:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 23:16" />“Mtsotenda ichihungo cha kupfuna ahala hamngalila pfijo pfenu pfamkwandusa kupfuna kulawa mna tsimbeghu tsenu tsamuwandile mna mighunda yenu. Ghumwaka haghumala hamkunga mapfuno gha isang'ano yenu, mtsotenda chihungo che ukukunga mapfuno. <verse eid="EXO 23:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 23:17" />Chila ghumwaka mna pfihungo pfino pfidatu, iwamale wose wetingane kunitamanila nene IMNDEWA.<verse eid="EXO 23:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 23:18" />“Uleke kundapfila inambiko ne chighate chine ihamila. Uleke kughaleka ghamafuta ghe imnyama yamtambikile mna chihungo changu ghakale mbaka ilufi nemitondo.<verse eid="EXO 23:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 23:19" />“Chila mwaka hampfuna, mngalile ipfijo pfamkwandusa kupfuna, kune ng'anda yamnitambikilagha nene Imulungu.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="EXO 23:19">“Uleke kwambika inyama ye imwana we ing'olo au we imene mna matombo gha mai wake.<verse eid="EXO 23:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Malaghano na malaghitso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 23:20" />“Nitsomtuma malaika wangu yawalongolele, ayo katsowalolesa hamghenda mnzila na katsowaghala mbaka hanu haniwekile. <verse eid="EXO 23:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 23:21" />Mumtegheletse, na mtende chayolonga, mleke kumpinga, kwaapfila mng'ampinga, yeye ng'atsowalekelela hela baye, kwaapfila nimtuma kwa taghwa lyangu. <verse eid="EXO 23:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 23:22" />Lekeni mng'amtegheletsa chayolonga na kutenda ghose ghayatsowalaghitsani, nene nitsetowa ne wanu iwomuhilani, na nitsowapinga awala iwowapinga mwemwe. <verse eid="EXO 23:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EXO 23:23" />Kwaapfila malaika wangu katsolongola hambele henu, na kowaghala mna isi yawokala Waamori, Wahiti, Waperizi, Wakanani, Wahipfi na Wayebusi, na nene nitsowatowa awo wose. <verse eid="EXO 23:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EXO 23:24" />Mleke kuinamila wala kuitambikila milungu yawo, wala mleke kutenda ka wawo. Ila mtsihinye ghendo na mtsibenebene ngutso tsawo.<verse eid="EXO 23:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="EXO 23:25" />“Mng'anitambikila nene IMNDEWA, yanili Imulungu wenu, nene nitsowabaliki muwe na chijo na ghamatsi na nitsowakinga mwemwe mleke kuwa watamu. <verse eid="EXO 23:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EXO 23:26" />Kutsakuwa kuduhu pinga wowose iyokinda inda na kweleka mwana yafile wala ipinga ing'ayokinda inda baye. Na nene nitsoweng'a ghamatsuwa mengi gho kukala.<verse eid="EXO 23:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="EXO 23:27" />“Nitsowatenda iwanu iwomuhilani wanipfuke, nitsotsihanganya tsimbutsi tse iwanu yamwitowa nawo. Nitsowatenda awala yamwitowa nawo wahunduke na kumtsuma. <verse eid="EXO 23:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EXO 23:28" />Nitsoghala iwalondola wawalongole hambele henu, wawawinge Wahipfi, Wakanani na Wahiti. <verse eid="EXO 23:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="EXO 23:29" />Sitsowalapfa baye iwanu awo kwa ghumwaka ghumwe, ning'awawinga wose, isi itsokala yahela munu na iwanyama wa kumuhulo watsakongetseka ng'ani mna mwemwe. <verse eid="EXO 23:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="EXO 23:30" />Nitsowawinga chidogho chidogho mbaka hamtsakongetseka na kwenela mna isi yose. <verse eid="EXO 23:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="EXO 23:31" />Mibaka ya isi yenu itsakuwa kulawa ibahari ya Shamu mbaka ibahari ya Mediteraniya, na kulawa kulwanda mbaka ghumto Eufurate, kwaapfila nitsowaghela iwanu we isi ayo mna ghamoko ghenu, namwe mtsowawinga woke. <verse eid="EXO 23:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="EXO 23:32" />Mleke kwilaghana nawo, wala kwilaghana ne imilungu yawo. <verse eid="EXO 23:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="EXO 23:33" />Mleke kuwaleka wakale mna isi yenu hela watsowahonza mnandele nzambi, kwaapfila mng'aitumikila milungu yawo, aghwo ghutsakuwa mtegho ghendo ghwa kuwakoma.”<verse eid="EXO 23:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 23" />
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="EXO 24" />
  <para style="s">Waisiraeli wakwika laghano ne Imulungu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 24:1" />IMNDEWA kamlongela Musa, “Mtse kuna nene, ghweghwe na Aruni, Nadabu na Abihu, ne iwabala sabini wa Waisiraeli, hampfika habehi mnitamanile kwa kutali. <verse eid="EXO 24:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 24:2" />Ghweghwe Musa uliyeka yautsonitsila, lekeni wayagho waleke kutsa hanili nene, na Waisiraeli waleke kudina kuchidunda.”<verse eid="EXO 24:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 24:3" />Apfo Musa kaghenda kuwalongela iwanu ghose ghayamlongele IMNDEWA na ghose ghayamlaghitse. Iwanu hawahulike wose wedikila lumwe, “Ghose ghayalongile IMNDEWA tutsoghatenda.” <verse eid="EXO 24:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 24:4" />Musa kaghandika ghose ghayalongile Imulungu.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="EXO 24:4">Kuya kalamka nemitondotondo katsenga kwa ghamabwe hanu hakutambikila hasi mwe chidunda, kemitsa ghamabwe kumi na mbili ghawile ka ngutso ka pfatsili kolo kumi na mbili tsa Isiraeli. <verse eid="EXO 24:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 24:5" />Kuya kawatuma iwasongolo wamlapfile IMNDEWA nambiko tsa kulakatsighwa na kumsubutulila wang'ombe wamale ka nambiko tsa kukala tseghamba ne Imulungu. <verse eid="EXO 24:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 24:6" />Musa kasola idamu chidogho keka mna pfiya, na nusu ingi kamitsa hanu ha kulapfila nambiko. <verse eid="EXO 24:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 24:7" />Kuya kasola ichitabu che laghano lye Imulungu, kachisoma hambele he iwanu, nawo walonga, “Agho ghose ghayalongile IMNDEWA, tutsoghatenda na tutsoghakinda.”<verse eid="EXO 24:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 24:8" />Musa kaisola idamu ila yekile mchiha, kawamitsila iwanu, kalonga, “Aino idamu ya laghano yalikile Imulungu na mwemwe, hayaweng'ile malaghitso ghano.”<verse eid="EXO 24:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 24:9" />Kuya Musa, Aruni, Nadabu na Abihu ne iwabala sabini wa Isiraeli wadina kuchidunda. <verse eid="EXO 24:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 24:10" />Baho wamwona Imulungu wa Waisiraeli. Hane maghulu ghake tsahoneka ka ibahari ya chiyoo, kwenzeluka ka kulanga. <verse eid="EXO 24:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 24:11" />Naye Imulungu ng'awalaghile baye iwabala awo wa Waisiraeli. Wamwona Imulungu, waja na ukunwa.<verse eid="EXO 24:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Musa ako kuchidunda Sinai</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 24:12" />IMNDEWA kamlongela Musa, “Utse kuno kuchidunda kwanili nene, nikwing'e ghamabwe ghanyandike ghamalaghitso ghangu ghose gha kuwalangulitsa Waisiraeli.”<verse eid="EXO 24:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 24:13" />Kuya Musa koka na Yoshua, miyaghe iyomwapfilagha, kadina kuchidunda kwayali Imulungu. <verse eid="EXO 24:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 24:14" />Lekeni ng'ana yoke Musa tsakawalongela iwabala wala, “Mtubete hano mbaka hatutsakuya. Aruni na Huri wa hamwe namwe, imunu wowose ang'awa na lighomba yawaghendele wawo.”<verse eid="EXO 24:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 24:15" />Musa kagheluka kuchidunda, na liwingu lighubika ichidunda. <verse eid="EXO 24:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 24:16" />Mng'alo we IMNDEWA ghuhulumka kuchidunda Sinai na liwingu lichighubika chidunda acho kwa ghamatsuwa sita. Litsuwa lya saba IMNDEWA kamkema Musa kulawa mna liwingu lila. <verse eid="EXO 24:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 24:17" />Mng'alo ghwe IMNDEWA tsaghwoneka kwa Waisiraeli ka ghumoto ighukwaka mchidunda. <verse eid="EXO 24:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 24:18" />Musa kengila mna liwingu lila, kagheluka kuchidunda. Kakala ako ghamatsuwa alubaini chilo ne imisi.<verse eid="EXO 24:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 24" />
  <chapter number="25" style="c" sid="EXO 25" />
  <para style="s">Tsisadaka tse lihema lye Imulungu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="EXO 35:4-9">Kul 35:4-9</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 25:1" />IMNDEWA tsakamlongela Musa, <verse eid="EXO 25:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 25:2" />“Walongele Waisiraeli wangalile ipfinu. Unibokelele ipfinu pfawatsolapfa iwanu. Chila munu yalapfe ka ghumoyo ghwake pfaghubama. <verse eid="EXO 25:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 25:3" />Apfino pfipfo ipfinu pfautsobokela, nzahabu, fetsa, shaba, <verse eid="EXO 25:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 25:4" />nyutsi tsa langi ya buluu, nzambalau na ndung'u, maghwanda matselu, na maghwanda ighatendighwe ne imighala ye wamene, <verse eid="EXO 25:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 25:5" />na ngotsi tse iwang'olo mvulati itsitengenetsighwe tsiwe ndung'u, ngotsi tse wamene, mibani ye mjoholo, <verse eid="EXO 25:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 25:6" />ghamafuta ghe chitasa, pfilungo ipfikwikighwa mna ghamafuta gho kughidila wawe watambika na pfilungo pfa upfumba iunung'ila ghoya, <verse eid="EXO 25:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 25:7" />ghamabwe gha bei ng'ulu ighokemighwa sadoniki, na mabwe ghangi gha bei ng'ulu, agho ghatsakuwa ka unzolingo mna chisibau che mtambika mkulu, ne ichifuko cha mmambagha ichipfalighwa na imtambika mkulu. <verse eid="EXO 25:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 25:8" />Kuya Waisiraeli wanitsengele Hema Lienzeluke, ili nene nikale haghati hawo. <verse eid="EXO 25:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 25:9" />Kutsotsenga lihema alyo na ipfinu pfake pfose ipfitsotumika mghati mwake ka pfanitsokulangusa.<verse eid="EXO 25:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lisanduku lya laghano</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="EXO 37:1-9">Kul 37:1-9</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 25:10" />“Waisiraeli watengenetse lisanduku lya mibani ya mjoholo, line utali wa futi nne, ughatsi wake uwe wa futi mbili, na chimo chake futi mbili. <verse eid="EXO 25:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 25:11" />Ulikandike lisanduku alyo nzahabu iliyeka mghati na kunze, kuya wike kingamitsi ya nzahabu iitsunguluke. <verse eid="EXO 25:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 25:12" />Kuya utengenetse mabangili mane gha nzahabu na ughananike hane ghamatendeghu mane gha lisanduku, mabangili meli ubali umwe na mabangili meli ubali ungi. <verse eid="EXO 25:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 25:13" />Naghwe usongole mifumbati mili ya mjoholo kuya uikandike nzahabu. <verse eid="EXO 25:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 25:14" />Ne mifumbati'yo kutsoingitsa mna ghamabangili ighali mna chila ubali wa lisanduku, iwe yo ukulighalila lisanduku. <verse eid="EXO 25:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 25:15" />Imifumbati ikaleghe mumo mna ghamabangili'gho, ileke kulapfighwa. <verse eid="EXO 25:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 25:16" />Wike mghati mwe lisanduku'lyo ghamabamba meli gha libwe ghanyandike malaghitso ghangu.<verse eid="EXO 25:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 25:17" />“Kuya utengenetse chighubiko che lisanduku kwe nzahabu iliyeka, chighubiko'cho chitsakuwa hanu ha libatsi, utali wake uwe futi ndatu na lobo ndatu na ughatsi wake uwe futi mbili na lobo. <verse eid="EXO 25:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 25:18" />Uhonde nzahabu na ufine pfiumbe pfili pfine mapamanilo ipfikemighwa makelubi upfike kune pfitsighilo pfe chighoda. <verse eid="EXO 25:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 25:19" />Kerubi yumwe umwike hachandusile ichighoda na kerubi wakeli umwike hachitsighile ichighoda. Lekeni makelubi'wo uwalumbitse ne ichighoda acho wawe chinu chimwe. <verse eid="EXO 25:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 25:20" />Pfiumbe'wo wakale aku welola, mapamanilo ghawo ghapamanyale kughubika ichighoda cha libatsi. <verse eid="EXO 25:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 25:21" />Mghati mwe lisanduku kutsakwika ghamabamba meli gha ghamalaghitso ghanitsokwing'a na kuchika chighoda cha libatsi mchanya mwake. <verse eid="EXO 25:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 25:22" />Na nene nitsetinganagha naghwe bahala hane chighoda che libatsi, kulawa haghati ha makelubi awala weli iwali mchanya mwa lisanduku lya laghano, nitsolonga naghwe no kukwing'a ghamalaghitso ghose ghaubamighwa kuwalongela Waisiraeli.<verse eid="EXO 25:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Imetsa yo kwikila pfighate ipfilapfighwa kwe Imulungu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="EXO 25:23" />“Utengenetse metsa ya mibani ya mjoholo ine utali wa futi ndatu, ughatsi wake uwe futi imwe na nusu, na chimo chake chiwe futi mbili na lobo. <verse eid="EXO 25:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EXO 25:24" />Uikandike nzahabu iliyeka na kuitsungulusila kingamitsi ya nzahabu. <verse eid="EXO 25:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EXO 25:25" />Kuya kutsosungulusila ubapi une ughatsi wa lobo futi na ubapi'wo uukandike nzahabu. <verse eid="EXO 25:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EXO 25:26" />Utengenetse bangili nne tse nzahabu utsinanike mna tsimembe tsake mna ghamatendeghu ghake. <verse eid="EXO 25:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EXO 25:27" />Tsibangili'tso tsitsakuwa habehi ne ubapi ula utsunguluka imetsa na tsitsakuwa tso kwingitsila mifumbati ya kughalila imetsa ayo. <verse eid="EXO 25:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EXO 25:28" />Usongole mifumbati ya mjoholo na uikandike nzahabu, imifumbati'yo itsakuwa ya kuighalila imetsa. <verse eid="EXO 25:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="EXO 25:29" />Naghwe utengenetsele sahani tsake ne pfikombe pfake ne mitela yake, kuya uitengenetsele bilika ne pfipeo pfo kughumila nambiko tse pfakunwa. Upfitengenetse kwa nzahabu iliyeka. <verse eid="EXO 25:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="EXO 25:30" />Na mchanya mwe imetsa'yo upfike pfighate ipfilangusa ka nene nabaho. Matsuwa ghose mnyikile pfighate'pfo mna metsa ayo.<verse eid="EXO 25:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Chigutso che pfitasa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="EXO 25:31" />“Utengenetse chitasa kwa nzahabu iliyeka yo kuhonda, ichitasa acho chiwe pfino, ichikalilo chake, lufito lwake, ipfikonyo pfake, pfifundo pfake na ghamaluwa ghake, pfose pfilumbitsighwe pfiwe chinu chimwe. <verse eid="EXO 25:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="EXO 25:32" />Maputila ghalawe chila lubali lwe lufito lwake, maputila madatu lubali lumwe na madatu lubali lungi. <verse eid="EXO 25:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="EXO 25:33" />Mne chila putila kuwe na pfikonyo pfidatu ipfighalile na maluwa gha mlotsi, chila chimwe na chifundo chake na luwa lyake. <verse eid="EXO 25:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="EXO 25:34" />Mne lufito kuwe ne pfikonyo pfine ipfighalile ne maluwa gha mlotsi, hamwe ne pfifundo pfake na maluwa ghake. <verse eid="EXO 25:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="EXO 25:35" />Hasi ha chila hanu hagholawila maputila mabili, mna ghamaputila aghala sita, hatsakuwa na chifundo chimwe ichili chinu chimwe ne lufito lwe chitasa acho. <verse eid="EXO 25:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="EXO 25:36" />Ipfifundo'pfo na ghamaputila ghake ghatsakuwa chinu chimwe ne chitasa, pfose pfitengenetsighwe kwa nzahabu iliyeka yo kuhonda. <verse eid="EXO 25:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="EXO 25:37" />Kuya uchitengenetsele ichitasa acho tsitambi saba, utsike mchanya mwake, pfilangatse hambele hake. <verse eid="EXO 25:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="EXO 25:38" />Ipfinu pfake pfo kulapfila tsitambi na tsisahani tsake pfiwe pfa nzahabu iliyeka ihondighwe. <verse eid="EXO 25:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="EXO 25:39" />Ichitasa acho hamwe ne pfinu pfake pfose, pfitsotengenetsighwa kwa kutumila kilo salasini na tano tse nzahabu iliyeka. <verse eid="EXO 25:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="EXO 25:40" />Walangitse, upfitengenetse ka apfila pfanikulanguse kuchidunda.<verse eid="EXO 25:40" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 25" />
  <chapter number="26" style="c" sid="EXO 26" />
  <para style="s">Hema lye Imulungu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="EXO 36:8-38">Kul 36:8-38</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 26:1" />“Kuya utsenge Hema Lihenzeluke kwa mapanzia kumi gha maghwanda matselu ghanoghile, na kwa nyutsi tsa buluu, nzambalau na ndung'u. Mapanzia agho kutsoghahamba na picha tsa makelubi iwacholighwe na mafundi iwakubuhu. <verse eid="EXO 26:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 26:2" />Chila panzia liwe na utali wa futi alubaini na mbili na ughatsi wa futi sita. Mapanzia agho ghawe gha chipimo chimwe. <verse eid="EXO 26:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 26:3" />Mapanzia matano ughalumbitse hamwe, alino na alino, na mapanzia matano ghangi ughalumbitse hamwe, alino na alino. <verse eid="EXO 26:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 26:4" />Kuya udadatse pfitanzi pfa langi ya buluu mna mindo ya utsighilo wa panzia limwe lya hande lya mwanduso, pfipfila udadatse pfitanzi mna mindo ya utsighilo wa panzia limwe lya hande lya keli. <verse eid="EXO 26:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 26:5" />Wike pfitanzi hamsini mna lipanzia limwe na pfitanzi hamsini pfingi kune mindo ya lipanzia lya hande lya kabili, ipfitanzi'pfo pfilolese. <verse eid="EXO 26:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 26:6" />Kuya utengenetse pfifungo hamsini pfa nzahabu, apfo pfitsakuwa pfo kulumbitsa ghamahande agho meli ili lihema liwe limwe.<verse eid="EXO 26:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 26:7" />“Pfipfila utengenetse mapanzia ighatengenetsighwe kwe mighala ya wamene ghawe chighubiko mchanya mwe lihema. Ghamapanzia agho ghawe kumi na limwe. <verse eid="EXO 26:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 26:8" />Chila panzia liwe na utali wa futi alubaini na tano, na ughatsi wake futi sita. Mapanzia agho ghose kumi na limwe ghelingane. <verse eid="EXO 26:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 26:9" />Kuya kutsoghalumbitsa hamwe mapanzia matano, na mapanzia sita ghangi kutsoghalumbitsa hangi, na lipatsia lya sita ulikunje mala mbili hambele ha lihema. <verse eid="EXO 26:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 26:10" />Kuya wike pfitanzi hamsini mna hande limwe, na pfitanzi hamsini pfingi kune mindo ya lipanzia lye lihande lya keli, na ipfitanzi'pfo pfilolese. <verse eid="EXO 26:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 26:11" />Utengenetse pfifungo hamsini pfa shaba, upfike mna pfitanzi pfila hamsini ili kulumbitsa mahande ghala meli gha mapanzia na kutenda lipanzia lya lihema liwe limwe. <verse eid="EXO 26:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 26:12" />Na inusu ila ya panzia iikalile kutsoika ilebele ubali wa kunzingo kwe kaye ienzeluke. <verse eid="EXO 26:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 26:13" />Na ayo futi imwe na nusu ya ubali umwe, na ila ifuti imwe na nusu ya ubali wa kabili, ya utali wa ghamapanzia gha lihema usighale, utsileke tsilebele kune ubali umwe na kune ubali ungi wa ing'anda ienzeluke ili kuighubika.<verse eid="EXO 26:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 26:14" />“Utengenetse maghubiko ghangi meli gha lihema, limwe litendighwe kwa ngotsi tsa ng'olo wamale lighelighwe udung'u, na lingi litendighwe kwa ngotsi tsa mene.<verse eid="EXO 26:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 26:15" />“Utengenetse fulemu tsa mibani ya mjoholo yo ukwimitsila wima ikaye ienzeluke. <verse eid="EXO 26:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 26:16" />Chila fulemu utali wake uwe futi kumi na tano, na ughatsi wake futi mbili na lobo. <verse eid="EXO 26:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 26:17" />Chila fulemu iwe ne ndimi mbili, atso tsiwe tsa kukindilitsila. Fulemu tsose tse ikaye ienzeluke utsitengenetse pfipfo. <verse eid="EXO 26:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 26:18" />Kutsotsitengenetsela ikaye ienzeluke fulemu ishilini kune ubali wa kusini, <verse eid="EXO 26:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 26:19" />na pfikalilo alubaini pfa pfetsa hasi mwe mibani ayo ishilini, pfikalilo pfibili hasi ha bani limwe tso kubokela tsindimi tsake mbili, na pfikalilo pfibili hasi ha libani lingi tso kubokela tsindimi tsake mbili. <verse eid="EXO 26:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 26:20" />Na kune ubali wa kasikazini we ikaye ienzeluke, utengenetse mibani ishilini, <verse eid="EXO 26:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 26:21" />na pfikalilo pfake alubaini pfa fetsa, pfikalilo pfibili hasi mwa libani limwe, na pfikalilo pfibili hasi mwa libani lingi. <verse eid="EXO 26:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 26:22" />Kwa ubali wa kuchughu we ing'anda ienzeluke, ubali wa kwalikuswela litsuwa, utengenetse mibani sita. <verse eid="EXO 26:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EXO 26:23" />Pfipfila utengenetse mibani mibili, ayo ikale mna tsimembe tse ikaye ienzeluke ubali wake wa kuchughu. <verse eid="EXO 26:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EXO 26:24" />Imibani'yo ibase kulawa hasi, na kwa uchanya ilumbitsighwe kune bangili imwe ya mwanduso. Mibani yose ya mna tsimembe itendighwe pfipfo kune tsimembe mbili. <verse eid="EXO 26:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EXO 26:25" />Apfo kutsakuwa na mibani minane ne pfikalilo pfake kumi na sita pfa pfetsa, pfikalilo pfibili hasi mwa chila bani.<verse eid="EXO 26:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="EXO 26:26" />“Utengenetse mifumbati ya mjoholo, mifumbati mitano ya kulumbitsa mibani ubali umwe wa ikaye ienzeluke, <verse eid="EXO 26:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EXO 26:27" />na mifumbati mitano kwaajili ya ubali wa kabili wa ikaye ienzeluke, na mifumbati mitano ya ukulumbitsa imibani ya ubali wa kuchughu wa ikaye ienzeluke, kwalikuswela litsuwa. <verse eid="EXO 26:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EXO 26:28" />Mfumbati ghwa haghati ighuli nusu ya utali we mibani ghulumbilile kulawa utsighilo uno mbaka utsighilo ungi wa ikaye ienzeluke. <verse eid="EXO 26:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="EXO 26:29" />Mibani yose uikandike nzahabu na uitengenetsele bangili tsa nzahabu itsitsokindilisa mifumbati, ne mifumbati'yo uikandike nzahabu. <verse eid="EXO 26:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="EXO 26:30" />Apfo kutsoitsenga ikaye ienzeluke ka apfila pfanikulanguse akula kuchidunda.<verse eid="EXO 26:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="EXO 26:31" />“Utengenetse panzia lya nyutsi tsa langi ya buluu, nzambalau na ndung'u na chitani inoghile. Panzia alyo ulihambe kwa picha tsa makelubi iwacholighwe kwe isang'ano ya ifundi iyakubuhu. <verse eid="EXO 26:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="EXO 26:32" />Kuya ulinanike mna ngutso nne tsa mjoholo itsikandikighwe nzahabu, ne pfinanikilo pfake pfa nzahabu, mna pfikalilo pfine pfa fetsa. <verse eid="EXO 26:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="EXO 26:33" />Naghwe ulinanike lipanzia alyo kune pfinanikilo'pfo, kuya ulighale Lisanduku lya laghano ahala hane lipanzia. Lipanzia alyo litsoghola Hanu Haenzeluke na Hanu Haenzeluke ng'ani. <verse eid="EXO 26:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="EXO 26:34" />Kuya uchike ichighubiko ichikemighwa Hanu ha Libatsi mchanya mwe Lisanduku lya laghano lili ihanu'ho Haenzeluke ng'ani. <verse eid="EXO 26:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="EXO 26:35" />Imetsa ila uike kunze kwe lipanzia, ne ichitasa uchike ubali wa kusini wa lihema, chilolese ne imetsa. Imetsa ayo iwe ubali wa kasikazini.<verse eid="EXO 26:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="EXO 26:36" />“Utengenetse lipanzia lya nyutsi tsa langi ya buluu, nzambalau na ndung'u, na chitani inoghile ifoghosighwe na kutalitsighwa, alyo liwe lya kudiwila lilango lya lihema. <verse eid="EXO 26:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="EXO 26:37" />Pfipfila utengenetse ngutso tano tsa mijoholo na utsikandike nzahabu. Ngutso atso tsiwe na pfifungo pfe nzahabu, chila imwe iwe na chikalilo cha shaba.<verse eid="EXO 26:37" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 26" />
  <chapter number="27" style="c" sid="EXO 27" />
  <para style="s">Sanduku lya kulakatsila nambiko</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="EXO 38:1-7">Kul 38:1-7</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 27:1" />“Utengenetse sanduku lya kulakatsila nambiko kwa mibani ya mjoholo, chiwe na membe nne. Utali wake na ughatsi wake pfilingane, chila ubali uwe futi saba na nusu, na chimo chake chiwe futi nne na nusu. <verse eid="EXO 27:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 27:2" />Mna chila membe ye lisanduku utengenetse membe imwe ka ye mnyama. Tsimembe'tso tsiwe chinu chimwe na lisanduku'lyo, naghwe ulikandike shaba. <verse eid="EXO 27:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 27:3" />Utengenetse tsinongo tsake tso kulaghalila lipfu, tsikoleo tsake tso kulapfila lipfu, bakuli tsake, pfuma pfo kuhomela inyama, ne pfihali pfa kuhalila ghumoto. Pfinu pfose pfino pfitengenetsighwe kwa shaba. <verse eid="EXO 27:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 27:4" />Kuya ulitengenetsele wapfu wa shaba une bangili nne tsa shaba kune membe tsake nne. <verse eid="EXO 27:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 27:5" />Uwike wapfu awo mna ukingo we lisanduku ubali wa hasi ili upfike haghati mwe lisanduku. <verse eid="EXO 27:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 27:6" />Pfipfila utengenetse mifumbati ya mjoholo yo kudutila lisanduku alyo, nayo uikandike shaba. <verse eid="EXO 27:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 27:7" />Mifumbati ayo itsakwingitsighwa mna tsibangili tsila, ili ikale mna tsibanzi mbili tse lisanduku ahala halitsodutighwa. <verse eid="EXO 27:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 27:8" />Lisanduku alyo ulitengenetse kwe mibani, na mghati liwe mwatsi, ka pfipfila pfanikulanguse akula kuchidunda pfipfo pfautsolitengenetsa.<verse eid="EXO 27:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Luwa lwe Lihema Lienzeluke</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 27:9" />“Ikaye ayo ienzeluke iwe na luwa. Ubali wa Kusini we iluwa alwo wike mapanzia ighatendighwe kwa maghwanda matselu ighanoghile ghalebele, utali wake uwe futi miya na hamsini. <verse eid="EXO 27:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 27:10" />Tsingutso tse luwa tsiwe ishilini na pfikalilo pfake pfiwe ishilini. Apfo pfose pfiwe pfa shaba. Lekeni pfinanikilo na tsifito tsake tsiwe tsa fetsa. <verse eid="EXO 27:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 27:11" />Pfipfila ubali wa Kasikazini we iluwa alwo uwe na panzia line utali wa futi miya na hamsini, na tsingutso tsake tsiwe ishilini, na pfikalilo ishilini, apfo pfose pfiwe pfa shaba, lekeni pfinanikilo pfa tsingutso na tsifito, pfiwe pfa fetsa. <verse eid="EXO 27:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 27:12" />Na ughatsi we iluwa alwo ubali wa Maghalibi, lipanzia lyake litsakuwa na futi sabini na tano, na tsingutso kumi na pfikalilo pfake kumi. <verse eid="EXO 27:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 27:13" />Na ughatsi we iluwa alwo ubali wa Mashaliki kwaghuli ghumlango utsakuwa futi sabini na tano. <verse eid="EXO 27:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 27:14" />Lipanzia lya ubali umwe wa ghumlango, liwe na futi ishilini na mbili na nusu na tsingutso ndatu na pfikalilo pfake pfidatu. <verse eid="EXO 27:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 27:15" />Pfipfila mna ubali wa kabili we ghumlango, lipanzia liwe na futi ishilini na mbili na nusu, na tsingutso tsake ndatu na pfikalilo pfake pfidatu. <verse eid="EXO 27:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 27:16" />Hane ghumlango ghwe iluwa kuwe na panzia alyo kudiwa ghumlango, utali wake uwe futi salasini. Lipanzia alyo lidadatsighwe na nyutsi tsa langi ya buluu, nzambalau na ndung'u, na maghwanda matselu ighanoghile ighekighwe unzolingo udadatsighwe. Lipanzia alyo likindighwe na ngutso nne tsine pfikalilo pfine. <verse eid="EXO 27:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 27:17" />Tsingutso tsose itsitsunguluka iluwa tsikindisighwe kwa fito tsa fetsa, pfinanikilo pfake pfiwe pfa fetsa na pfikalilo pfake pfiwe pfa shaba. <verse eid="EXO 27:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 27:18" />Utali we iluwa alwo utsakuwa na futi miya na hamsini, ughatsi wake futi sabini na tano, na chimo chake chiwe futi saba na nusu, iluwa alwo luwe na panzia lya maghwanda matselu ighanoghile, na pfikalilo pfake pfiwe pfa shaba. <verse eid="EXO 27:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 27:19" />Pfinu pfose pfa kutumila mna ikaye ienzeluke, ipfitumika mna isang'ano yake yose, ne pfighingi pfake pfose, na ipfighingi pfose pfe iluwa pfiwe pfa shaba.<verse eid="EXO 27:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Malaghitso ghe Chitasa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 27:20" />“Walaghitse Waisiraeli wakughalile mapfuta gha nzeituni ighalengele, agho ghawe gha kutuwila ichitasa, na iochitasa acho chakeghe ghamatsuwa ghose. <verse eid="EXO 27:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 27:21" />Aruni na iwanaghe watsochituwa ichitasa acho chakeghe mna Ikaye Ienzeluke kunze kwa lipanzia ilili hambele ha lisanduku lye laghano. Watsochika chakeghe hambele hangu kulawa hamihe mbaka hamitondo. Laghitso lino likindighwe na Waisraeli wose mna ghamatsuwa ghao ghose, na mna pfeleko pfao pfose.<verse eid="EXO 27:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 27" />
  <chapter number="28" style="c" sid="EXO 28" />
  <para style="s">Maghwanda gha iwatambika</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 28:1" />“Naghwe Musa umsole ndughu yako Aruni ne iwanaghe, Nadabu, Abihu, Elietsari na Isamari, kulawa mna Waisiraeli watse habehi naghwe, ili wanitumikile ka watambika. <verse eid="EXO 28:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 28:2" />Umdadatsile ndughu yako Aruni maghwanda ghaenzeluke gha ukumtenda yawe na ukulu na yanoghe. <verse eid="EXO 28:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 28:3" />Naghwe uwalongele iwanu wose iwakubuhu mna ukudadatsa, awala yaniweng'ile tsimbutsi tso kumanya, wamdadatsile Aruni maghwanda gho kumuhimika ili yanisang'anile ka mtambika. <verse eid="EXO 28:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 28:4" />Walongele wamdadatsile ipfinu pfino, chikoba che mmambagha, chisibau, kanzu, joho ilihambighwe, chilemba na msipi. Watsowatengenetsela maghwanda maenzeluke ndughu yako Aruni ne iwanaghe ili wanitumikile ka watambika. <verse eid="EXO 28:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 28:5" />Nawo watsosola ipfitambala pfa langi ya nzahabu, buluu, nzambalau, ndung'u, na maghwanda matselu ighanoghile.<verse eid="EXO 28:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 28:6" />“Wafume chitsibau kwa chitambala chitselu chinoghile, na weke unzolingo kwa nyutsi tsa langi ya nzahabu, ya buluu, nzambalau, ndung'u. Ifumighwe kwa sang'ano ye fundi iyakubuhu. <verse eid="EXO 28:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 28:7" />Chiwe na pfihande pfibili pfa mmayegha, pfitsolumbitsighwa kwa tsili tsimembe tse pfihande'pfo. <verse eid="EXO 28:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 28:8" />Na ghumsipi gho kohela ghufumighwe ghoya kwa ichitambala chicho, kwa tsinyutsi tsitso tsa langi ya nzahabu, ya buluu, nzambalau, na ndung'u, ghumsipi'gho ghufumighwe ghuwe chinu chimwe ne chitsibau. <verse eid="EXO 28:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 28:9" />Kuya usole mabwe meli gha sadoniki, agho ughandike kwa kukwangula ghamataghwa kumi na meli gha iwana wa Isiraeli, <verse eid="EXO 28:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 28:10" />mataghwa sita mna libwe limwe, na mataghwa sita ghangi mna libwe lingi, ka pfawelekighwe. <verse eid="EXO 28:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 28:11" />Ka sonara iyakubuhu pfayakwandika ghumuhuri kwa kukwangula, ughandike pfipfo ghamataghwa gha wana wa Isiraeli mna ghamabwe agho meli. Kuya ugheke ghamabwe agho mna pfinanikilo pfa nyutsi tse nzahabu. <verse eid="EXO 28:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 28:12" />Naghwe ugheke ghamabwe'gho meli mchanya mwe pfihande pfibili pfa mmayegha pfa chitsibau'cho, agho ghawe ukumbuso kwa wana wa Isiraeli. Aruni yagheleke ghamataghwa agho mmayegha mwake ka ukumbuso hambele he IMNDEWA. <verse eid="EXO 28:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 28:13" />Naghwe wike pfinanikilo pfibili pfa nzahabu, <verse eid="EXO 28:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 28:14" />na mikufu mibili ya nzahabu iliyeka iifoghosighwe ka lutsabi. Uyohe mikufu'yo kune ipfinanikilo'pfo.<verse eid="EXO 28:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Chikoba cha mmambagha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 28:15" />“Utengenetse chikoba cha mmambagha cho kulamlila, ichifumighwe ghoya ka pfipfila pfachifumighwe ichitsibau, kwa chitambala chitselu chinoghile, ichikighwe unzolingo kwa nyutsi tse nzahabu, tse buluu, tse nzambalau na tsindung'u. <verse eid="EXO 28:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 28:16" />Chiwe cha membe nne, nacho chikunjighwe, utali wake na ughatsi wake pfilingane, chila ubali uwe na utali wa nchi tisa. <verse eid="EXO 28:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 28:17" />Chihambighwe kwa milia minne ya ghamabwe gha bei ng'ulu, mna mlia ghwa mwanduso wike ghamabwe gha akiki, topasi na alimasi ndung'u, <verse eid="EXO 28:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 28:18" />mna mlia ghwa kabili wike ghamabwe gha tumaridi, yakuti samawi na alimasi, <verse eid="EXO 28:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 28:19" />mna mlia ghwa kadatu wike ghamabwe gha yasinto, akiki ndung'u na ametisto, <verse eid="EXO 28:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 28:20" />na mna mlia ghwa kane wike ghamabwe gha tsabarajadi, shohamu, na yasipi. Ghamabwe agho ghekighwe mna pfindikilo pfa nzahabu. <verse eid="EXO 28:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 28:21" />Kutsakuwa na mabwe kumi na meli, chila libwe lyandikighwe taghwa limwe lya mwana yumwe wa Isiraeli, chila taghwa lyandikighwe kwa kukwangulighwa ka muhuli, ka pfaghali ghamakabila kumi na meli. <verse eid="EXO 28:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 28:22" />Utengenetse mikufu ya nzahabu iliyeka iifoghosighwe ka mitsabi, ayo iwe ya kohela chikoba cha mmambagha. <verse eid="EXO 28:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EXO 28:23" />Kuya uchitengenetsele ichikoba acho bangili mbili tsa nzahabu na utsike kune tsimembe mbili tse ichikoba acho. <verse eid="EXO 28:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EXO 28:24" />Kuya uike mikufu'yo ye nzahabu mna tsibangili'tso mbili hane tsimembe tse ichikoba cha mmambagha. <verse eid="EXO 28:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EXO 28:25" />Na tsimembe tsingi itsikalile tsa mikufu'yo mili utsike mna pfindikilo pfila pfibili, kuya upfike mna pfihande pfila pfibili pfa mmayegha pfe chisibau ubali wa hambele. <verse eid="EXO 28:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EXO 28:26" />Kuya utengenetse bangili mbili tsa nzahabu, utsike mna tsimembe mbili tsa ubali wa mghati we chikoba cha mmambagha, habehi ne ichisibau. <verse eid="EXO 28:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EXO 28:27" />Kuya utengenetse bangili tsingi mbili tse nzahabu utsike hambele mna tsimembe tsa hasi tsa pfihande pfa chisibau, hanu hapfilunga chisibau na msipi ighufoghosighwe ghoya. <verse eid="EXO 28:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EXO 28:28" />Ichikoba cha mmambagha chohighwe kune chitsibau kwa kukindilisa tsibangili tsake na chisibau kwa lutsabi lwa buluu, ili ichikoba'cho cha mmambagha chiwasile ghumsipi ghula ighufoghosighwe ghoya na chileke kuleghela mna ichisibau.<verse eid="EXO 28:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="EXO 28:29" />“Apfo Aruni hayakwingila Ihanu Haenzeluke, katsopfala ichikoba chila cho kulamlila mmambagha ichandikighwe ghamataghwa gha makabila gha iwana wa Isiraeli, kwa kutenda apfo, nene IMNDEWA nitsowakumbuka iwanu wangu ghamatsuwa ghose. <verse eid="EXO 28:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="EXO 28:30" />Mne chikoba cha mmambagha cho kulamlila wike ghamabwe ighokemighwa Urimu na Thumimu, agho ghatsokala mchanya mwe ghumoyo ghwa Aruni ahala hayakwingila hambele hangu nene IMNDEWA, na Aruni katsobapa ghamalamlitsi ghe iwana wa Isiraeli mna ghumoyo ghwake hambele hangu.<verse eid="EXO 28:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Maghwanda ghangi gha iwatambika</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="EXO 28:31" />“Naghwe ufume joho ilighubikighwa ne ichisibau halipfalighwa kwa nyutsi tsa buluu tsiliyeka. <verse eid="EXO 28:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="EXO 28:32" />Nalyo litsakuwa na tobo haghatighati hake ho kwingitsila litwi, litobo lyake litsotsungulusighwa mindo iifumighwe ghoya, ili ileke kudegheka. <verse eid="EXO 28:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="EXO 28:33" />Kune mindo yake ya hasi, ulihambe kwa makomamanga gha nyutsi tsa langi ya buluu, nzambalau, na ndung'u, na mbughi tsa nzahabu haghatighati ha makomamanga'gho, <verse eid="EXO 28:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="EXO 28:34" />mbughi ya nzahabu na komamanga, mbughi ya nzahabu na komamanga, mna mindo yose. <verse eid="EXO 28:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="EXO 28:35" />Aruni katsopfala lijoho'lyo ahala hayosang'ana ing'onde yake yo kulapfa nambiko, na litsi lye tsimbughi'tso litsohulikighwa ahala hayatsakwingila Hanu Haenzeluke hambele hangu, na ahala hayatsolawa, ili yaleke ukukomighwa.<verse eid="EXO 28:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="EXO 28:36" />“Utengenetse chibamba cha nzahabu iliyeka na uchandike kwa kukwangula mchanya mwake ka imunu pfayakwandika ghumuhuli, wandike pfino: ‘ILAPFIGHWA KWE IMTWATSA IMULUNGU.’ <verse eid="EXO 28:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="EXO 28:37" />Naghwe uchohe ichibamba'cho mchanya mwe chilemba kwa msipi ghwa langi ya buluu, nacho chitsokala hambele mna chilemba. <verse eid="EXO 28:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="EXO 28:38" />Ichibamba'cho chitsakuwa mchanya mwe chihanga cha Aruni, naye Aruni katsobapa ghamatotso gha ipfinu pfienzeluke pfawonilapfila iwanu Waisiraeli ka nzawadi tsao tsienzeluke. Ichibamba'cho chitsokalagha mchihanga mwake, ili watogholighwe hambele he Imfalume. <verse eid="EXO 28:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="EXO 28:39" />Na ikanzu uifume kwa maghwanda matselu ghanoghile, na ufume chilemba che nguo ye maghwanda matselu ghanoghile, naghwe ufume msipi kwa sang'ano ye fundi wa kudalitsi.<verse eid="EXO 28:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="EXO 28:40" />“Iwana wa Aruni uwafumile makanzu, misipi, na kofiya, utsitengenetse ili hawotsipfala woneke wanogha na wana utunitso. <verse eid="EXO 28:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="EXO 28:41" />Uwapfatse ndughu yako Aruni ne iwanaghe ghamaghwanda agho, kuya uwaghele mafuta na uwahimike kwe sang'ano yenzeluke ili wanitumikile ka watambika. <verse eid="EXO 28:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="EXO 28:42" />Watendele kaputula tsa maghwanda matselu ghanoghile itsitsowaghubika kulawila mchuno mbaka mna ghamafindi, waghubike ng'uli tsawo. <verse eid="EXO 28:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="EXO 28:43" />Aruni ne iwanaghe watsopfala tsikaputula atso chila hawakwingila mna lihema lya kwitinganila, au hawakutsa habehi na lisanduku lyo kulakatsila tsinambiko, wasang'ane ng'onde mghati mwe Kaye Ihenzeluke. Kwa kutenda apfo ng'awatsokala chidako, ili waleke kukomighwa. Alino litsakuwa laghitso lya ghamatsuwa ghose kwa Aruni ne mweleko ghwake.<verse eid="EXO 28:43" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 28" />
  <chapter number="29" style="c" sid="EXO 29" />
  <para style="s">Ghamalaghitso gho kuwahimika Aruni ne wanaghe wawe watambika</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 29:1" />“Apfi pfipfo pfaubamighwa kuwatendela Aruni ne iwanaghe ili walapfighwe wawe wangu wanisang'anile nene ka watambika. Usole ng'ombe yumwe mmale iyali mdodo, na ng'olo weli wamale iwalihela chilonda wala chilema, <verse eid="EXO 29:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 29:2" />pfighate ipfilihela hamila, maandatsi ighalihela hamila ighakandighwe kwa mafuta, na pfighate pfisisili ipfilihela hamila ila ipfibakighwe mafuta. Pfose apfo upfitende kwa usaghe unoghile wa ngano. <verse eid="EXO 29:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 29:3" />Upfike mna chiseghe na undapfile hamwe ne ing'ombe ayo na wang'olo awo weli.<verse eid="EXO 29:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 29:4" />“Kuya waghale Aruni ne wanaghe hane ghumlango ghwa Lihema lya Kwitinganila, uwalongele wehopfughe kwa ghamatsi ka pfachili ichihendo chawo. <verse eid="EXO 29:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 29:5" />Kuya usole maghwanda ghe iwatambika umpfatse Aruni, usole ikanzu, ilighubikighwa ne ichisibau, ichisibau, chikoba cha mmambagha, umwohe ne msipi ghwe ichisibau ighufumighwe ghoya. <verse eid="EXO 29:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 29:6" />Umpfatse chilemba mwitwi, kuya mchanya mwe chilemba acho wike ichibamba che nzahabu ichandikighwe ‘ILAPFIGHWA KWE MTWATSA IMULUNGU’. <verse eid="EXO 29:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 29:7" />Haumalitsa kutenda apfo, usole ghamafuta ghala gha kubaka, umghume Aruni mwitwi mwake ili yawe mtambika.<verse eid="EXO 29:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 29:8" />“Kuya uwaghale hane ghumlango iwanaghe Aruni uwapfatse tsikanzu, <verse eid="EXO 29:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 29:9" />uwohe imisipi mpfuno na uwapfatse tsikofia tsawo. Apfo pfipfo pfautsowatenda Aruni ne iwanaghe wawe watambika. Wao na watsukulu wao watsonitambikila nene ghamatsuwa ghao ghose.<verse eid="EXO 29:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 29:10" />“Kuya umghale ing'ombe yula mmale hambele ha Lihema lya Kwitinganila. Aruni na wanaghe watsakwika ghamoko ghawo mwitwi mwe ing'ombe'yo. <verse eid="EXO 29:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 29:11" />Naghwe kutsomsubutula hambele hangu nene IMNDEWA, hane ghumlango ghwa Lihema lyo Kwitinganila. <verse eid="EXO 29:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 29:12" />Kutsosola chidogho idamu ye ng'ombe'yo kwa chidole chako, na uibake mna tsimembe tse lisanduku lyo kulakatsila tsinambiko, na idamu yose ikalile uimwaghe hasi he lisanduku. <verse eid="EXO 29:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 29:13" />Kuya ulapfe ghamafuta ghose ighaghubike pfinu ipfili munda, na ulapfe likini na figho tsose mbili hamwe na mafuta ghake, upfilakase pfose mchanya mwe lisanduku. <verse eid="EXO 29:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 29:14" />Lekeni inyama ye ng'ombe'yo na tsingotsi tsake na mipfi yake kutsopfilakatsa kunze kutali na indalo yenu. Aino itsakuwa nambiko ya kuleghusa nzambi tsa watambika.<verse eid="EXO 29:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 29:15" />“Kuya kutsomsola ing'olo yumwe mna iwang'olo wala wamale, umlongele Aruni ne iwanaghe weke ghamoko ghawo mchanya mwe litwi lyake. <verse eid="EXO 29:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 29:16" />Kuya kutsomsubutula ing'olo'yo, uisole idamu yake uimitse mna lisanduku lyo kulakatsila iwanyama chila ubali. <verse eid="EXO 29:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 29:17" />Umghane ng'olo ayo mahunde mahunde, uhopfughe usapi wake na maghulu ghake, upfike hamwe ne litwi. <verse eid="EXO 29:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 29:18" />Kuya umlakakatse ing'olo wose mchanya mwe lisanduku ili undapfile nene inambiko ya kulakatsighwa, kunung'ila ghoya kwa nambiko iilapfighwa kwa ghumoto, kutsoninoghelesa nene IMNDEWA.<verse eid="EXO 29:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 29:19" />“Umsole ing'olo yula yungi, Aruni ne iwanaghe watsomwikila ghamoko ghawo mwitwi mwake. <verse eid="EXO 29:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 29:20" />Naghwe kutsomtsubutula ing'olo'yo na kusola idamu chidogho na umbakatse Aruni ne iwanaghe hane tsimembe tsa maghutwi ghawo gha kujilo na mna pfidole ghumba pfa ghamoko ghawo gha kujila, na pfidole ghumba pfa ghamaghulu ghawo gha kujilo. Idamu ikalile kutsoimitsa mna lisanduku chila ubali. <verse eid="EXO 29:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 29:21" />Kuya kutsosola idamu iili mchanya mwe lisanduku hamwe na ghamafuta ghala gha kubaka ummitsile Aruni na maghwanda ghake, pfifila uwamitsile ne iwanaghe na maghwanda ghawo. Aruni ne iwanaghe watsakuwa waenzeluka, na maghwanda ghao ghose ghatsakuwa ghaenzeluka.<verse eid="EXO 29:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 29:22" />“Kuya usole ghamafuta gha ing'olo ayo mmale, mkila ghwake ighunonile, ghamafuta ighoghubika munda, likini, na tsifigho tsose mbili na ghamafuta ghake, na lihatsa lya kujilo, ing'olo'yo kakuwa wa kuhimikila watambika, <verse eid="EXO 29:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EXO 29:23" />pfipfila usole chighate chimwe, na liandatsi limwe ilighumighwe ghamafuta, na chighate chisisili chimwe, ipfili mna chiseghe chila che pfighate ipfilihela ihamila ichili hambele hangu nene IMNDEWA. <verse eid="EXO 29:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EXO 29:24" />Pfijo pfose pfino kutsomwing'a Aruni ne iwanaghe nawo wapfikinde mna ghamoko ghao, kuya watsopfinula uchanya, wapfiighiseighise pfiwe nambiko yo kuhighisighwa hambele hangu nene IMNDEWA. <verse eid="EXO 29:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EXO 29:25" />Kuya kutsopfisola mna ghamoko ghawo na kupfilakatsa mchanya mwe nambiko ila ya kulakatsighwa iili mchanya mwe chilanda, pfininung'ile ghoya na pfininoghele nene IMNDEWA.<verse eid="EXO 29:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="EXO 29:26" />“Kuya usole chidali che ing'olo ayo yumtendele Aruni yawe mtambika, uchinule chiwe nambiko yo kwinulighwa hambele hangu nene IMNDEWA. Nacho chitsakuwa chako.<verse eid="EXO 29:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="EXO 29:27" />“Kuya upfike hambele hangu ichidali'cho, na lihatsa alyo, apfo ipfinulighwe, pfe ing'olo mmale yula yalapfighwe ahala Aruni ne wanaghe hawahimikighwe wawe watambika, ipfinu'pfo yeng'ighwe Aruni ne wanaghe. <verse eid="EXO 29:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EXO 29:28" />Apfo ghamatsuwa ghose Waisiraeli watsosola ipfinu'pfo kulawa mna tsinambiko tsawo tso kukala tseghamba na nene tsawatsondapfila nene IMNDEWA, watsomwing'a Aruni ne iwanaghe. <verse eid="EXO 29:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="EXO 29:29" />Hayatsakufa Aruni, maghwanda ghake gho ukutambikila watsakwing'ighwa iwanaghe, nawo waghapfale ahala hawotendighwa wawe watambika. <verse eid="EXO 29:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="EXO 29:30" />Imwana wa Aruni iyosola isang'ano ya aba wake, katsopfala maghwanda agho matsuwa saba mna Lihema lya Kwitinganila, ili yasang'ane Hanu Haenzeluke.<verse eid="EXO 29:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="EXO 29:31" />“Naghwe usole inyama ye ing'olo ayo yumtendele Aruni ne iwanaghe wawe watambika, uipiluse mghati mwe luwa. <verse eid="EXO 29:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="EXO 29:32" />Aruni ne iwanaghe watsoija hane ghumlango ghwa Lihema lya Kwitinganila hamwe ne pfighate pfila ipfisighale mchiseghe. <verse eid="EXO 29:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="EXO 29:33" />Nawo watsopfija ipfijo pfila ipfilapfighwe ahala hawahimikighwe Aruni ne iwanaghe na kwa kutendighwa ulamulitsi ne Imulungu, lekeni munu yungi yaleke kupfija ipfijo'pfo kwaapfila pfihenzeluka. <verse eid="EXO 29:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="EXO 29:34" />Inyama yoyose ye ing'olo'yo au pfighate'pfo pfing'akala mbaka hamitondo, upfilakatse mna ghumoto, pfileke kujighwa kwaapfila ipfijo'pfo pfihenzeluka.<verse eid="EXO 29:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="EXO 29:35" />“Apfo pfipfo pfautsowatendela Aruni na iwanaghe ka pfanikulaghitse, isang'ano yo kuwatenda wawe watambika imale mna matsuwa saba, <verse eid="EXO 29:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="EXO 29:36" />na chila tsuwa mna ghamatsuwa agho saba umsubutule ng'ombe mmale yawe nambiko ya kuwaleghusila wanu tsinzambi tsawo, na kwa kutenda apfo mtsolitenda lisanduku lyo kulakatsila tsinambiko lienzeluke, kuya kutsolibakatsa ghamafuta ili lienzeluke ghendo. <verse eid="EXO 29:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="EXO 29:37" />Kwa ghamatsuwa saba ulitende lisanduku litogholighwe ne Imulungu, nalyo litsakuwa lienzeluka ghendo, na chinu chochose ichidonza lisanduku'lyo, chitsakuwa chienzeluka.<verse eid="EXO 29:37" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nambiko tsa chila tsuwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="EXO 29:38" />“Chila tsuwa mna ghamatsuwa agho saba uwasubutule na uwalapfe nambiko mchanya mwe lisanduku wanang'olo weli wa mwaka ghumwe. <verse eid="EXO 29:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="EXO 29:39" />Mwanang'olo yumwe kutsomlapfa hamitondo na yungi kutsomlapfa hamihe. <verse eid="EXO 29:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="EXO 29:40" />Imwanang'olo wa mwanduso kutsomsubutula na kundapfila hamwe na makimbo meli gha usaghe utighinike iuhanganyighwe na kimbo limwe lya mafuta gha nzeituni itsikamighwe, na kimbo limwe lya idipfai ka nambiko yo ukunwa. <verse eid="EXO 29:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="EXO 29:41" />Pfipfila ne ing'olo wa hamihe kutsomsubutula na kundapfila nambiko hamwe ne nambiko ye chijo na ya chokunwa ka pfautendile hamitondo, kunung'ila ghoya kwa nambiko iilapfighwa kwa ghumoto kutsoninoghelesa nene IMNDEWA. <verse eid="EXO 29:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="EXO 29:42" />Inambiko ino ya kulakatsighwa itsolapfighwa ghamatsuwa ghose, lweleko mbaka lweleko, hambele ha ghumlango ghwa Lihema lya kwitinganila, hambele hangu nene IMNDEWA, aho nene hanitsetingana namwe na kulonga namwe.<verse eid="EXO 29:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="EXO 29:43" />“Aho nitsetingana na Waisiraeli, na utunitso wangu utsohatenda hanu aho haenzeluke. <verse eid="EXO 29:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="EXO 29:44" />Lihema lyo Kwitinganila na hanu ha ukulapfila tsinambiko nitsopfitenda pfihenzeluke, pfipfila Aruni na iwanaghe nitsowahimika ili wanitumikile ka watambika. <verse eid="EXO 29:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="EXO 29:45" />Nitsokala haghatighati mwe wanu Waisiraeli, na nene nitsakuwa Mulungu wao. <verse eid="EXO 29:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="EXO 29:46" />Nawo watsomanya ka nene yuyo IMNDEWA wao, yaniwalapfile kulawa isi ya Misiri, ili nikale haghatighati hao. Nene nayuyo IMNDEWA wao.<verse eid="EXO 29:46" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 29" />
  <chapter number="30" style="c" sid="EXO 30" />
  <para style="s">Lisanduku lyo kudususila upfumba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 30:1" />“Utengenetse sanduku kwa mbau ya mjoholo ili liwe hanu ha ukulakatsilila upfumba udusuke. <verse eid="EXO 30:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 30:2" />Ilisandu alyo liwe na membe nne, utali wake ulingane na ughatsi wake, chila ubali uwe na futi imwe na nusu, ne chimo chake chiwe futi ndatu. Tsimembe tse lisanduku tsilawilile kuchanya ka membe tse mnyama na tsiwe chinu chimwe na lisanduku alyo. <verse eid="EXO 30:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 30:3" />Lisanduku lyose kutsolikandika nzahabu iliyeka mchanya mwake na mlubapfu mwake na tsimembe tsake itsisomoke ka tse mnyama, kuya ulitsungulusile ukingo wa nzahabu. <verse eid="EXO 30:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 30:4" />Kuya ulitengenetsele bangili mbili tsa nzahabu na utsinanike ubali wa lweisi wa ukingo wake mna tsibanzi mbili itsilolesa, tsibangili atso tsitsakuwa tso kwingitsila imifumbati yo kulighalila. <verse eid="EXO 30:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 30:5" />Ne Imifumbati'yo iwe ya mbiki ghwa mjoholo na uikandike nzahabu. <verse eid="EXO 30:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 30:6" />Naghwe kutsolika lisanduku'lyo hanze he lipanzia lili habehi na lisanduku lya laghano, hambele ha ihanu he libatsi, hanu hala hanitsetingana naghwe. <verse eid="EXO 30:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 30:7" />Chila tsuwa nemitondo Aruni hayakwingila kupfika ghoya ipfitasa apfila, yalakatse upfumba iunung'ila ghoya mchanya mwe lisanduku. <verse eid="EXO 30:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 30:8" />Kuya katsodusula upfumba nemihe hayotuwa ipfitasa. Nambiko ino ya upfumba itsolapfighwa ghamatsuwa ghose ne pfeleko pfenu pfose hambele hangu nene IMNDEWA. <verse eid="EXO 30:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 30:9" />Mleke kupfukitsa upfumba ing'auhenzeluke mchanya mwake, wala kulapfa nambiko ya kulakatsighwa, wala nambiko ye chijo, wala kughuma nambiko ya chokunwa mchanya mwake. <verse eid="EXO 30:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 30:10" />Aruni katsolitendela lisanduku chihendo cho kulitenda litogholighwe mala lumwe chila mwaka kwa kubaka idamu ila ye mnyama iyalapfighwe yawe nambiko ya kuleghusila nzambi mchanya mwe tsimembe tse lisanduku, itsisomoke ka tse mnyama. Chihendo chino chitendighwe mala lumwe chila mwaka mna pfeleko pfenu pfose kwaapfila lisanduku'lyo lienzeluka ghendo kuna nene IMNDEWA.”<verse eid="EXO 30:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kodi ye IMNDEWA</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 30:11" />IMNDEWA kamlongela Musa, <verse eid="EXO 30:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 30:12" />“Hautsowapeta Waisiraeli, chila munu yalihe sendi, ayo iwe ya kuukombola ughima wake, ili kuleke kuwa na utamu wihile mghati mwawo ahala hawotsopetighwa. <verse eid="EXO 30:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 30:13" />Achino chicho chawatsolapfa, chila munu yobita yapetighwe yalapfe nusu shekeli ka pfaili ishekeli itogholighwe hanu ihaenzeluke (Shekeli imwe gera ishilini), nusu shekeli iyo isadaka ye IMNDEWA. <verse eid="EXO 30:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 30:14" />Chila munu iyatsopetighwa, kulawa wane miyaka ishilini na kughendelela katsoniliha isendi'yo. <verse eid="EXO 30:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 30:15" />Matajili waleke kulapfa chikulu kubita nusu shekeli, wala iwahingwa waleke kulapfa chidogho kubita nusu shekeli, ahala hawotsoliha isendi kuukombola ughima wawo. <verse eid="EXO 30:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 30:16" />Naghwe utsibokele tsisendi'tso tso ukwilamulitsa ne Imulungu kulawa kwa Waisiraeli, utsike tsikasang'ane mna tsing'onde tsa lihema lyo kwitinganila, natso tsiwatende Waisiraeli wamkumbukeghe Imulungu, ka senditso tsilapfighwa ili yeye yaukombole ughima wawo.”<verse eid="EXO 30:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Bigha kulu lya shaba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 30:17" />Kuya IMNDEWA kamlongela Musa, <verse eid="EXO 30:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 30:18" />“Utengenetse bigha lya shaba lya kuhopfughila na chikalilo chake chiwe cha shaba, ulike haghati ha lihema lya kwitinganila ne lisanduku, kuya wike matsi mghati mwake. <verse eid="EXO 30:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 30:19" />Aruni ne iwanaghe watsotumila ghamatsi'gho kuhopfugha ghamoko na ghamaghulu ghawo. <verse eid="EXO 30:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 30:20" />Watende'pfo ili waleke kukomighwa ahala hawatsakwingila mna lihema lya kwitinganila, na ahala hawatsosoghela habehi ne lisanduku ili kundapfila nambiko nene IMNDEWA, nambiko itsilapfighwa kwa ghumoto. <verse eid="EXO 30:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 30:21" />Watsohopfugha ghamoko na ghamaghulu ghawo ili waleke kufa. Alino litsakuwa laghitso kuna wawo ghamatsuwa ghose, kulawa Aruni na iwanaghe, mweleko mbaka mweleko.”<verse eid="EXO 30:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ghamafuta Gha Kubaka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 30:22" />Kuya IMNDEWA kamlongela Musa, <verse eid="EXO 30:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EXO 30:23" />“Kutsosola pfilungo pfinoghile ghendo, mafuta gha manemane mbisi kilo sita, mdalasini kilo ndatu, usaghe wa midete iunung'ila ghoya kilo ndatu, <verse eid="EXO 30:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EXO 30:24" />na mdalasini ungi ighukemighwa kida kilo sita, pfipimo apfo pfose pfighende na pfipimo pfa ihanu haenzeluke, na makimbo mane gha mafuta gha nzeituni. <verse eid="EXO 30:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EXO 30:25" />Kwa pfilungo'pfo kutsotengenetsa ghamafuta ighahenzeluke, ughahanganye ka pfayotenda mtengenetsa ipfinu ipfinung'ila, agho ghatsakuwa ghamafuta ghaenzeluke gho kubaka. <verse eid="EXO 30:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EXO 30:26" />Kwa ghamafuta agho ulibake lihema lyo kwitinganila, na lisanduku lya laghano, <verse eid="EXO 30:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EXO 30:27" />imetsa na ipfinu pfake, chighutso che pfitasa na pfinu pfake, lisanduku lyo kudusulila upfumba, <verse eid="EXO 30:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EXO 30:28" />pfipfila ulibake lisanduku lyo kulapfila nambiko tso kulakatsighwa ne pfinu pfake pfose, libigha ne chikalilo chake. <verse eid="EXO 30:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="EXO 30:29" />Apfo komwikila Imulungu ipfinu'pfo na kupfitenda pfienzeluke ghendo. Na chinu chochose ichitsodonza ipfinu'pfo chitsakuwa chienzeluka. <verse eid="EXO 30:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="EXO 30:30" />Kuya mbake ghamafuta Aruni ne iwanaghe, na kuwahimika ili wanisang'anile ka watambika. <verse eid="EXO 30:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="EXO 30:31" />Walongele Waisiraeli, ‘Aghano ghatsakuwa ghamafuta ghangu ghaenzeluke gha kubaka mna pfeleko pfenu pfose. <verse eid="EXO 30:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="EXO 30:32" />Ghamafuta aghano mleke kumghela munu yungi iyali si mtambika baye, kuya mleke kutengenetsa mafuta ghangi ghane pfilungo ka aghano, ghamafuta aghano ghaenzeluka na ghobamighwa ghawe maenzeluka kuna mwemwe matsuwa ghose. <verse eid="EXO 30:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="EXO 30:33" />Munu wowose iyatsotengenetsa mafuta ghane pfilungo ka aghano, au imunu wowose yatsomghela imunu mhenza ghamafuta aghano, imunu'yo nitsomlema yaleke kuwa munu wangu.’”<verse eid="EXO 30:33" /></para>
  <para style="s">Upfumba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="EXO 30:34" />Kuya IMNDEWA kamlongela Musa, “Usole ghamanukato ghanoghile, utomvu wa natafi, utomvu wa shekeleti, utomvu wa kelibena, na ubani unoghile, ipfinu'pfo pfose pfiwe pfa chipimo chimwe, <verse eid="EXO 30:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="EXO 30:35" />naghwe utengenetse upfumba we pfinu'pfo, ka pfautengenetsighwa ne imunu yotengenetsa ipfinu ipfinung'ila ghoya, ughelighwe munyu ili unoghe na uwe mwenzeluka. <verse eid="EXO 30:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="EXO 30:36" />Kuya usole ipfinu'pfo chidogho upfisaghe pfitighinike, na udeghe chidogho usaghe'wo uwike hambele he sanduku lya laghano mghati mwa lihema lya kwitinganila, ahala hanitsetingana naghwe. Awo utsakuwa upfumba wenzeluke ghendo kuna mwemwe. <verse eid="EXO 30:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="EXO 30:37" />Namwe mleke kwitengenetsela upfumba une pfilungo ka auno, kwaapfila upfumba uno utsakuwa wenzeluka kuna mwemwe hambele hangu nene IMNDEWA. <verse eid="EXO 30:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="EXO 30:38" />Imunu wowose iyatsotengenetsa upfumba ka auno, ili unung'ile ghoya, imunu'yo nitsomlema yaleke kuwa munu wangu.”<verse eid="EXO 30:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 30" />
  <chapter number="31" style="c" sid="EXO 31" />
  <para style="s">Besaleli na Oholiabu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 31:1" />IMNDEWA kamlongela Musa, <verse eid="EXO 31:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 31:2" />“Lola, nimsaghula Bezaleli, imwana wa Uri, ayo Uri aba wake tsa Huri, wa likabila lya Yuda, <verse eid="EXO 31:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 31:3" />nimmemesa Ghumuhe ghwe Imulungu, nimtenda yawe na tsimbutsi, yamanye na yadahe kutenda tsisang'ano tsose, <verse eid="EXO 31:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 31:4" />ili yatende tsisang'ano tsa ufundi, yawe muhunzi wa ipfinu pfa nzahabu, fetsa na shaba, <verse eid="EXO 31:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 31:5" />nimtenda yamanye kusongola ghamabwe gha kuhambila, kusongola mibani, na yamanye tsisang'ano tsose tso kuhamba. <verse eid="EXO 31:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 31:6" />Kuya nimsaghula Oholiabu mwana wa Ahisamaki, wa likabila lya Dani yasang'ane naye. Pfipfila niweng'a uwetso mkulu mafundi wa kutenda sang'ano tsingi, ili watengenetse pfinu pfose pfanikulaghitse. <verse eid="EXO 31:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 31:7" />Lihema lya Kwitinganila, lisanduku lya laghano, ichighubiko chake ichili hanu he libatsi ihali mchanya mwake, na pfinu pfose pfa lihema, <verse eid="EXO 31:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 31:8" />imetsa na pfinu pfake, chighutso che pfitasa che nzahabu iliyeka na pfinu pfake pfose, lisanduku lyo kupfukitsa upfumba. <verse eid="EXO 31:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 31:9" />Pfipfila lisanduku lyo kulapfila nambiko tso kulakatsighwa na pfinu pfake pfose, bigha lya shaba lya ghamatsi na chikalilo chake, <verse eid="EXO 31:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 31:10" />maghwanda ghadadatsighwe ghoya, maghwanda ghaenzeluke gha Aruni, na maghwanda ghe iwanaghe ili waghapfale ahala hawosang'ana ng'onde ya kulapfa nambiko, <verse eid="EXO 31:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 31:11" />ghamafuta gha kubaka na upfumba unung'ila ghoya gho ukutumika ihanu ihaenzeluke. Pfinu'pfo pfose pfitengenetsighwe ka pfanikulaghitse.”<verse eid="EXO 31:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Litsuwa lya kubwihila</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 31:12" />Kuya IMNDEWA kamlongela Musa, <verse eid="EXO 31:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 31:13" />“Walongele Waisiraeli pfino, Mwemwe mtsokindilisa ghamatsuwa ghangu gha kubwihila, kwaapfila acho chitango haghati henu na nene kwa pfeleko pfenu pfose ipfikutsa, ili mmanye ka nene na IMNDEWA yaniwatenda mwenzeluke. <verse eid="EXO 31:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 31:14" />Mkindilise litsuwa lya kubwihila, kwaapfila litsuwa alyo lihenzeluka kuna mwemwe. Imunu wowose iyatsolibetsa litsuwa alyo yakomighwe, kwaapfila imunu wowose iyosang'ana mna litsuwa alyo nitsomlema yaleke kuwa munu wangu. <verse eid="EXO 31:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 31:15" />Mtsosang'ana matsuwa sita, lekeni litsuwa lya saba alyo litsuwa lya kubwihila, lienzeluka kuna nene IMNDEWA, imunu wowose iyosang'ana ng'onde yoyose mna litsuwa alyo katsokomighwa ghendo. <verse eid="EXO 31:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 31:16" />Apfo waisiraeli watsokindilisa Litsuwa lya kubwihila mna pfeleko pfawo pfose ka laghano lya ghamatsuwa ghose. <verse eid="EXO 31:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 31:17" />Chinu chino chitsakuwa chitango cha ghamatsuwa ghose haghati he wana wa Waisiraeli na nene, kwaapfila nene IMNDEWA tsanitsiumba tsilanga ne isi kwa ghamatsuwa sita, lekeni mna litsuwa lya saba ndeka kusang'ana, nibwihila.”<verse eid="EXO 31:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 31:18" />IMNDEWA hayamalitse kulonga na Musa kuchidunda Sinai, kamwing'a Musa mabamba meli gha ghamabwe ighandikighwe ghamalaghitso, ighandikighwe kwa ukukwangula ne chidole che Imulungu.<verse eid="EXO 31:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 31" />
  <chapter number="32" style="c" sid="EXO 32" />
  <para style="s">Chinyagho che mwana mmale we ng'ombe we nzahabu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 32:1" />Iwanu hawonile Musa kokawa kuhulumka kuchidunda, wetingana hambele ha Aruni wamlongela, “Twetwe ng'atumanyile baye choni ichimlawile Musa iyatulapfile Misiri, lelo ututendele milungu itsotulongotsa”. <verse eid="EXO 32:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 32:2" />Aruni kawalongela, “Msole tsiheleni tsa nzahabu itsili mmaghutwi mwe wapinga wenu, iwanenu wamale na iwanenu iwapinga, mnighalile.” <verse eid="EXO 32:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 32:3" />Apfo iwanu wose walapfa heleni tsa nzahabu mmaghutwi mwawo, wamghalila Aruni. <verse eid="EXO 32:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 32:4" />Naye katsisola kulawa mna ghamoko ghao katsika mmoto tsilubuke, kuya kafina chinyagho cha imwana mmale wa ng'ombe we nzahabu. Baho iwanu walonga, “Ghwee Isiraeli, aino iyo milungu yako ikulapfile kulawa isi ya Misiri”. <verse eid="EXO 32:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 32:5" />Aruni hayonile'pfo, kachitsengela lisanduku lyo kutambikila ichinyagho'cho. Kuya kalonga, “Ilupfi kutsakuwa na chihungo cha kumdeng'elela IMNDEWA.” <verse eid="EXO 32:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 32:6" />Ilupfi haipfikile iwanu walamka nemitondotondo, walapfa nambiko tsawo tsa kulakatsighwa, na nambiko tsa ukukala tseghamba. Kuya wakala hasi, waja, wanwa, no ukupatika, kuya wenuka na kupfina. <verse eid="EXO 32:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 32:7" />IMNDEWA kamlongela Musa, “Hulumka kuhisi kwaapfila iwanu wako yauwaghalile kulawa isi ya Misiri, watenda ghehile. <verse eid="EXO 32:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 32:8" />Wasumka kuileka nzila yaniwalanguse, wafina chinyagho cha imwana mmale we ng'ombe we nzahabu, nawo wamwinamila na wamtambikila walonga, ‘Ghwee Isiraeli, aino iyo milungu yako ikulapfile kulawa isi ya Misiri!’ ” <verse eid="EXO 32:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 32:9" />Kuya IMNDEWA kamlongela Musa, “Nowamanya iwanu wano pfawali wasughu. <verse eid="EXO 32:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 32:10" />Lelo uleke kunighoma, nene nowonela maya sideke na noghenda kuwakoma ghendo. Kuya kubitila ghweghwe nitsotenda taifa kulu.”<verse eid="EXO 32:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 32:11" />Lekeni Musa kamdedetsa IMNDEWA, Imulungu wake, kalonga, “Ghwe Imulungu, hebali uwonela maya ng'ulu iwanu wako yauwalapfile kulawa isi ya Misiri kwa uwetso wako mkulu na kwa ghumoko ghune ngupfu? <verse eid="EXO 32:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 32:12" />Ung'atenda apfo Wamisiri watsolonga ka Imulungu wao tsakawalapfa mna isi yetu, kumbe tsakabama yakawakome kune chidunda, nawo wahupe ghendo muisi. Ghwee Imulungu, uleke kuwonela maya na uleke kuwatendelela iwanu wako chinu chino. <verse eid="EXO 32:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 32:13" />Uwakumbuke iwatumwa wako, Abrahamu, Isaka na Isiraeli, ambe tsakwilaha hambele hao ahala haulongile, Nitsowatenda watsukulu wenu wawe wengi ka tsinondo itsili kulanga na nitsoweng'a isi yose ino yanilongile iwe yawo ghamatsuwa ghose.” <verse eid="EXO 32:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 32:14" />Apfo Imulungu kaghutuka, kaleka kuwaghalila iwanu wake ghamaghayo ghayalongile katsowaghalila. <verse eid="EXO 32:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 32:15" />Kuya Musa kahunduka, kahulumka kulawa kuchidunda aku kakinda mabamba aghala meli ghe ghamabwe gha lilaghano mmwoko mwake, ghandikighwa Ghamalaghitso ghe Imulungu chila ubali. <verse eid="EXO 32:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 32:16" />Imulungu mwenyegho yuyo iyaghasongole ghamabamba agho, naye yuyo iyaghandike kwa kukwangula. <verse eid="EXO 32:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 32:17" />Yoshua hayahulike iwanu wokemelela, kamlongela Musa, “Nohulika ka kuna tsogho lye ng'ondo kune indalo.”<verse eid="EXO 32:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 32:18" />Lekeni Musa kamwidika, “Mbe, iwanu ng'awokemelelela apfo baye awohuma mng'ondo wala ng'awokemelelela apfo baye hawotowighwa, ila chanihulika nene, iwanu wakwimba.” <verse eid="EXO 32:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 32:19" />Musa hayapfikile habehi ne indalo, hayonile chinyagho che nzahabu che mwana mmale we ng'ombe na iwanu pfawopfina, baho maya yake yaka ka moto, kaghasa hasi ghamabamba ghala ighali mmwoko mwake, kaghatula ahala haisi he ichidunda. <verse eid="EXO 32:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 32:20" />Musa kasola ichinyagho chila kachilakatsa kwa moto, kachihondahonda mbaka chiwa ka timbwisi, kalitighilila litimbwisi'lyo mna ghamatsi, kuya kawalaghitsa Waisiraeli wanwe. <verse eid="EXO 32:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 32:21" />Musa kamghutsa Aruni, “Angu tsawakutendile choni iwanu wano mbaka uwengitse mna nzambi ino ng'ulu?”<verse eid="EXO 32:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 32:22" />Aruni kedika, “Uleke kumbonela maya nene, ghweghwe kowamanya iwanu wano pfawong'ang'anila kutenda ghehile. <verse eid="EXO 32:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EXO 32:23" />Tsawanongela, ‘Ng'atumanyile baye ichimlawile imunu yuno Musa iyatulongotse kulawa Misiri, lelo ututendele imulungu itulongotse.’ <verse eid="EXO 32:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EXO 32:24" />Na nene niwalongela wangalile pfinu pfawo pfa nzahabu, kuya wangalila na nene nipfika mna ghumoto pfilubuke na chinyagho'chi chilawila”. <verse eid="EXO 32:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EXO 32:25" />Musa hayonile iwanu watotsa, kwa apfila Aruni tsakawaleka watotse na wapate chinyala hambele he wanu iwowehila, <verse eid="EXO 32:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EXO 32:26" />kema hane ghumlango ighukwingila kune indalo, kalonga, “Munu wowose iyali ubali we IMNDEWA yatse kuna nene.” Iwana wose wa Lawi wamghendela Musa. <verse eid="EXO 32:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EXO 32:27" />Naye kawalongela, “IMNDEWA, Imulungu wa Isiraeli kolonga apfi, ‘Chila munu yohe limaghe lyake mchuno, yabite chila hanu kulawa lango limwe lyo kwingilila kune pfibumbulika mbaka lilango lingi, kuya chila munu yamkome ndughu yake, sale yake na munu wa habehi yake.’ ” <verse eid="EXO 32:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EXO 32:28" />Nawo iwana wa Lawi watenda ka pfayalaghitse Musa. Litsuwa alyo tsawafa iwanu ka elufu ndatu. <verse eid="EXO 32:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="EXO 32:29" />Kuya Musa kalonga, “Leloli mwemwe mwihimika iwenyegho kumsang'anila IMNDEWA, kwaapfila ng'amlekile baye kuwakoma hata iwanenu na wandughu tsenu. Imulungu yawamotetse leloli.”<verse eid="EXO 32:29" /></para>
  <para style="s">Musa kowalombela Waisiraeli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="EXO 32:30" />Ilupfi yake Musa kawalongela iwanu, “Mtenda nzambi ng'ulu! Lelo nitsomghendela IMNDEWA kuchidunda, songaa nodaha kuwatenda mwilamlitse ne Imulungu na mleghusighwe inzambi yenu.” <verse eid="EXO 32:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="EXO 32:31" />Kuya Musa koya kwa IMNDEWA, kamlongela, “Nakona usungu iwanu wano watenda nzambi ng'ulu! Wetendela iwenyegho mlungu wa nzahabu. <verse eid="EXO 32:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="EXO 32:32" />Lekeni sambi nokulomba uwaleghusile nzambi yawo, ka ng'uwaleghusila, nokulomba undafe mna chitabu chawandike che mataghwa ghe iwanu wako.” <verse eid="EXO 32:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="EXO 32:33" />Lekeni IMNDEWA kamlongela Musa, “Imunu wowose iyanendele nzambi yuyo yanitsomlapfa kulawa mna chitabu changu. <verse eid="EXO 32:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="EXO 32:34" />Lelo uke ukawalongotse iwanu mbaka hanu hanikulongele, lola, imalaika wangu wa kulanga katsokulongola. Hata apfo litsuwa lyanitsowatsila, nitsowaliha kwa nzambi yawo.” <verse eid="EXO 32:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="EXO 32:35" />Kuya IMNDEWA kawatowa iwanu kwa kuwaghalila utamu mkulu, kwa apfila tsawamlongela Aruni yawatendele imwana we ng'ombe yula wa nzahabu, naye kawatendela.<verse eid="EXO 32:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 32" />
  <chapter number="33" style="c" sid="EXO 33" />
  <para style="s">Imulungu komlaghitsa Musa wanduse ghumwanza</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 33:1" />IMNDEWA kamlongela Musa, “Haya mlawe hanu hano, ghweghwe ne iwanu wako yauwalapfile isi ya Misiri, mghende kune isi yanilahile kuweng'a Abrahamu, Isaka na Yakobu, ahala hanilongile, ‘Nitsoweng'a iwatsukulu wenu isi ino.’ <verse eid="EXO 33:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 33:2" />Nitsomtuma malaika wangu yawalongolele, nitsowawinga Wakanani, Waamori, Wahiti, Waperizi, Wahivi na Wayebusi. <verse eid="EXO 33:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 33:3" />Mghende mna isi'yo ine wanyama wengi iwolapfa ghamatsiwa, na ine uki wingi. Lekeni kwaapfila mwemwe mwawasughu ng'ani sighenda namwe baye, hela nitsowakoma mnzila.”<verse eid="EXO 33:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 33:4" />Iwanu hawahulike imbuli ayo ihile, wandusa chililo, nakuduhu munu yapfalile pfinu pfake ipfinoghile pfo ukwihamba. <verse eid="EXO 33:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 33:5" />Watenda apfo kwaapfila IMNDEWA tsakamlongela Musa, “Walongele Waisiraeli, mwemwe mwa wasughu ng'ani, ning'aghenda namwe hata kwa saa chidogho nitsowakoma. Lelo tsuleni pfinu pfenu pfinoghile pfo ukwihamba nimanye pfanitsowatenda.” <verse eid="EXO 33:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 33:6" />Apfo Waisiraeli watsula pfinu pfawo pfinoghile pfo ukwihamba kwandusila hachidunda Holebu na kwawaghendelele na ghumwanza.<verse eid="EXO 33:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lihema Lienzeluke</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 33:7" />Hohose Waisiraeli hawekile ndalo wabwihile, Musa yang'ali yosola lihema na kulitsenga kutali chidogho na indalo, naye kaling'a taghwa lihema alyo Hema lya Kwitinganila. Na munu wowose yabamile yamanye chinu kulawa kwe IMNDEWA, yang'ali yoghenda kune Lihema lya Kwitinganila likalile kunze kutali ne indalo. <verse eid="EXO 33:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 33:8" />Musa hayang'ali yoghendagha kune lihema alyo, iwanu wose wang'ali wakwima wima chila munu hane ghumlango ghwe ichibumbulika chake, womlolesa Musa pfayoghenda mbaka hayakwingila mghati mwe lihema. <verse eid="EXO 33:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 33:9" />Iwagha pfino, Musa yang'engila mghati mwa Lihema lya Kwitinganila, ngutso ya libingu ing'ali ihulumka kulawa kulanga yakwima hane ghumlango ghwa Lihema alyo, na baho IMNDEWA kolonga na Musa. <verse eid="EXO 33:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 33:10" />Na iwanu wose hawoyona ingutso ya libingu yakwima hane ghumlango ghwa Lihema, wose wang'ali wenama mbaka ipfihanga pfodonza hasi, chila munu hamlango he chibumbulika chake. <verse eid="EXO 33:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 33:11" />Apfo pfipfo Imulungu pfayang'ali yolonga na Musa ka imunu kolonga na sale yake, kuya Musa yang'ali yakuyagha keli kune indalo, Lekeni imbwanga Yoshua, imwana wa Nuni, iyang'ali yomwapfila Musa, yeye ng'alawagha baye mna lihema.<verse eid="EXO 33:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 33:12" />Musa kamlongela IMNDEWA, “Lola! Ghweghwe tsakunongela, ‘Walongotse iwanu wano,’ lekeni ng'una unongele baye yutsomtuma yanyapfile nani. Kuya tsakulonga, ‘Nikumanya kwa litaghwa lyako, naghwe kutogholighwa hambele hangu.’ <verse eid="EXO 33:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 33:13" />Lelo nokulomba, ka nitogholighwa hambele hako, unanguse nzila tsako, kuya unitende nikumanye na nighendelele kuwona uluso wako. Kuya nokulomba ukumbuke ka iwanu wano Wasiraeli wawo iwanu wako.” <verse eid="EXO 33:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 33:14" />Imulungu kalonga, “Nene imwenyegho nitsoghenda naghwe, na nitsokutenda ubwede.” <verse eid="EXO 33:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 33:15" />Musa, kamlongela Imulungu, “Ka ng'ughenda baye na twetwe, uleke kutulapfa hanu hano. <verse eid="EXO 33:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 33:16" />Angu lelo iwanu watsomanyatse ka ghweghwe konoghelwa na nene na iwanu wako, ka ng'ughenda na twetwe baye? Ung'aghenda na twetwe itsotutenda tuleke kwighala na iwanu wose iwali mwiisi yose.”<verse eid="EXO 33:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 33:17" />IMNDEWA kamlongela Musa, “Nitsotenda ghendo ka pfaulombile, kwaapfila nene nokumanya kwa litaghwa lyako naghwe kotogholighwa hambele hangu.” <verse eid="EXO 33:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 33:18" />Kuya Musa kalonga, “Lelo nokulomba unanguse utunitso wako.”<verse eid="EXO 33:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 33:19" />Naye kamwidika, “Nitsobita hambele hako kukulangusa wende wangu wose, na kulikema taghwa lyangu, ‘IMNDEWA.’ Nitsomtendela uluso ayula yanibama kumtendela uluso, na kumwonela libatsi ayula yanibama kumwonela libatsi”. <verse eid="EXO 33:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 33:20" />Kuya kalonga keli, “Lekeni ng'udaha baye kuwona uhanga wangu, kwaapfila kuduhu munu yodaha kumbona kuya yawe mghima.” <verse eid="EXO 33:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 33:21" />Kuya IMNDEWA kamlongela Musa, “Ahano hana hanu habehi na nene, naghwe kutsakwima mchanya mwe bambalawe, <verse eid="EXO 33:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 33:22" />na ung'alo wangu hautsobita, nitsokughela mna lwatu lwe libambalawe, nani nitsokughubika kwe chighanza cha ghumoko ghwangu aho hanitsobita. <verse eid="EXO 33:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EXO 33:23" />Kuya nitsochilapfa ichighanza changu, naghwe kutsoghwona ghumghongo ghwangu, lekeni uhanga wangu ng'autsakwoneka baye.”<verse eid="EXO 33:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 33" />
  <chapter number="34" style="c" sid="EXO 34" />
  <para style="s">Mabamba ghangi gha ghamabwe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 34:1" />IMNDEWA kamlongela Musa, “Usongole mabamba meli gha mabwe ka aghala gha mwanduso, na nene nitsoghandika aghala ghayakalile mna mabamba gha mwanduso ghautulile. <verse eid="EXO 34:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 34:2" />Wisafulule ilupfi nemitondo utse witingane na nene hane chidando che chidunda Sinai. <verse eid="EXO 34:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 34:3" />Imunu wowose yaleke kutsa naghwe, kuya yaleke kwoneka munu hohose mna chidunda, wala ng'olo au mene waleke ukuja habehi ne chidunda.” <verse eid="EXO 34:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 34:4" />Kuya Musa kasongola mabamba meli gha ghamabwe ka aghala gha mwanduso. Koka mitondotondo, kagheluka kuchidunda Sinai, ka IMNDEWA pfayamlaghitse, aku kana mabamba agho meli gha ghamabwe mmoko mwake.<verse eid="EXO 34:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 34:5" />IMNDEWA kahulumka mna libingu kema na Musa, kalikema taghwa lyake, “IMNDEWA.” <verse eid="EXO 34:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 34:6" />Kuya IMNDEWA kabita hambele ha Musa kalonga keli, “IMNDEWA, nene IMNDEWA, na Imulungu yane libatsi na uluso, sisumkagha baye kona maya, nina wende wingi na notogholighwa, <verse eid="EXO 34:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 34:7" />nene nowatendela wende iwanu wa pfeleko ketseketse, nowaleghusila iwanu nzambi tsawo na ghehile ghawo, lekeni sileka baye kumuhigha imunu wowose yototsa, nowahigha iwanu ne iwana wawo kwa nzambi tsa aba tsawo, na iwana wa iwana wawo, mbaka mweleko ghwa kadatu na ghwa kane.”<verse eid="EXO 34:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 34:8" />Bahala Musa kenama hasi, kamtamanila Imulungu. <verse eid="EXO 34:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 34:9" />Kuya kalonga, “Ghwe IMNDEWA kwaapfila nikunoghela, nokulomba ughende na twetwe. Iwanu wano wasughu, lekeni utuleghusile nzambi tsetu, utubokele ka iwanagho mwenyegho.”<verse eid="EXO 34:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Laghano lyakwikighwa keli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 34:10" />Kuya IMNDEWA kamlongela Musa, “Sambi nakwika laghano ne iwanu wako wose. Nitsotenda pfinu pfikulu hambele hawo ng'ana pfitendighwe mna taifa lyolyose na mna isi yose. Iwanu wose imkala mghati mwawo watsakona sanga'ano tsangu ng'ulu. Kwaapfila nitsotenda chinu chikulu kuna mwemwe.”<verse eid="EXO 34:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 34:11" />“Mkinde malaghitso ghangu ghanimwing'ani leloli. Nitsowawinga hambele henu Waamori, Wakanani, Wahiti, Waperesi, Wahivi na Wayebusi. <verse eid="EXO 34:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 34:12" />Mwalangitse mleke kutenda laghano ne iwanu wa isi yamuighendela, hela litsakuwa mtegho kuna mwemwe. <verse eid="EXO 34:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 34:13" />Ila mpfimwaghe pfibumbulika pfao pfa kutambikila, mtsibene ngutso tsawo tsa kutamanila, na pfinyagho pfao pfa Ashera.”<verse eid="EXO 34:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 34:14" />“Mleke kutamanila mulungu yungi wowose, kwaapfila nene yanikemighwa Yane Chepfu nomwonela chepfu imunu iyotamanila mulungu yungi, <verse eid="EXO 34:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 34:15" />na mleke kwilaghana ne iwanu we isi'yo, mana hawatsoitamanila milungu yawo ya ughutsu na kuitambikila, watsomkemani namwe mtsakuja nambiko tsawo. <verse eid="EXO 34:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 34:16" />Iwanenu wang'awakwela iwali wawo, iwali'wo iwotamanila milungu wodaha kuwalongotsa iwanenu kuiwinza milungu yawo.”<verse eid="EXO 34:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 34:17" />“Mleke kutenda milungu ya ughutsu ya chuma.<verse eid="EXO 34:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 34:18" />“Mtsotenda chihungo cha pfighate ipfilihela hamila. Kwa matsuwa saba mtsakuja pfighate ipfilihela hamila mna ghumwetsi ghwa Abihu ka pfanikulaghitse, mana ghumwetsi'ghwo ghwa Abihu baho hamlawile Misiri.<verse eid="EXO 34:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 34:19" />“Chila mwana mmale chaudele, ayo kakuya wangu, na iwana iwamale iwalongole kwelekighwa we iwanyama wenu, wose wa kwangu, wa ng'ombe na we wang'olo. <verse eid="EXO 34:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 34:20" />Imwana we punda iyalongole kwelekighwa kutsomkombola kwa kundapfila ng'olo. Ka ng'umkombola baye, umbene isingo. Iwana wenu wose wamale iwalongole kwelekighwa mtsowakombola.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="EXO 34:20">“Na munu wowose yaleke kutsa kuna nene na ghamoko ghaliyeka.<verse eid="EXO 34:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 34:21" />“Matsuwa sita mtsosang'ana, lekeni litsuwa lya saba mtsobwihila, hata ka matsuwa gha kulima au gha kupfuna, mtsobwihila.<verse eid="EXO 34:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 34:22" />“Mtsotenda chihungo cha majuma, mwanduso wa ghamatsuwa gha kupfuna ngano, na mtsotenda chihungo cha kukunga pfinu ghumwaka haghutsigha.<verse eid="EXO 34:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="EXO 34:23" />“Mala ndatu chila mwaka iwamale wose watsetingana hambele hangu nene IMNDEWA, Imulungu wa Isiraeli. <verse eid="EXO 34:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EXO 34:24" />Nitsotsiwinga isi tsingi hambele henu na kuyongetsa mibaka yenu. Kuduhu imunu wowose iyatsoibama isi yenu hamtingana kunitamanila nene IMNDEWA, Imulungu wenu mala ndatu chila ghumwaka.<verse eid="EXO 34:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="EXO 34:25" />“Mleke kundapfila nambiko na chighate ichighumighwe hamila, na inambiko ya Ipasaka ileke kusighala mbaka hamitondo.<verse eid="EXO 34:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="EXO 34:26" />“Pfinu pfa mwanduso pfa mighunda yenu mtsopfighala mng'anda mwangu nene IMNDEWA, Imulungu wenu.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="EXO 34:26">“Uleke kumwambika mwana wa ng'olo au mwana we mene mna litombo lya wenye wake.”<verse eid="EXO 34:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="EXO 34:27" />IMNDEWA kamlongela Musa, “Wandike mbuli aino, kwaapfila mna imbuli ino notenda laghano naghwe ne iwanu wa Isiraeli.” <verse eid="EXO 34:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EXO 34:28" />Musa tsakakala ne IMNDEWA ako kuchidunda matsuwa alubaini, chilo na misi, ng'ajile chijo wala kunwa matsi. Tsakandika mbuli tsose tsa laghano, ghamalaghitso ghala kumi.<verse eid="EXO 34:28" /></para>
  <para style="s">Musa kohulumka kuchidunda Sinai</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="EXO 34:29" />Musa hayahulumke kuchidunda Sinai aku kana mabamba meli ghane mbuli tsa laghano mmwoko mwake, ng'amanyile baye ka uhanga wake tsaung'ali wong'ala kwaapfila tsayang'ali yolonga ne IMNDEWA. <verse eid="EXO 34:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="EXO 34:30" />Aruni ne iwanu wose wa Isiraeli hawamwonile Musa wapfuka kumseghelela, kwaapfila uhanga wake tsaung'ali umweluka mweluka ng'ani. <verse eid="EXO 34:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="EXO 34:31" />Lekeni Musa tsakamkema Aruni ne iwakulu wa kaye ya Isiraeli wamghendele, kuya kalonga nawo. <verse eid="EXO 34:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="EXO 34:32" />Hambele Waisiraeli wose watsa habehi yake, naye kaweng'a ghamalaghitso ghose ghayeng'ighwe ne Imulungu akula kuchidunda Sinai. <verse eid="EXO 34:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="EXO 34:33" />Musa hayamalitse kulonga nawo, kaghubika uhanga wake na chitambala ichilangala. <verse eid="EXO 34:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="EXO 34:34" />Lekeni Musa chila hayaghendile kulonga ne IMNDEWA mna Lihema lyo Kwitinganila, yang'ali yochilapfa ichitambala achila mbaka hayolawa kunze. Hayalawile kunze tsakawalongela Waisiraeli aghala ghose ghayalaghitswe, <verse eid="EXO 34:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="EXO 34:35" />nawo Waisiraeli wawona uhanga wake womweluka mweluka. Kuya Musa kaghubika keli uhanga wake ne chitambala mbaka hayaghendile kulonga ne Imulungu.<verse eid="EXO 34:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 34" />
  <chapter number="35" style="c" sid="EXO 35" />
  <para style="s">Malaghitso gha litsuwa lya Sabato</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 35:1" />Musa tsakawakema iwanu wose wa Isiraeli, kawalongela, “Achino chicho chayalaghitse IMNDEWA mchitende. <verse eid="EXO 35:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 35:2" />Matsuwa sita mtsosang'ana ng'onde tsenu, lekeni tsuwa lya saba litsakuwa lya Sabato, litsuwa lienzeluke kwe IMNDEWA. Imunu wowose iyosang'ana mna litsuwa alyo yakomighwe. <verse eid="EXO 35:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 35:3" />Mne litsuwa lya Sabato hata ghumoto mleke kubwina mna tsikaye tsenu.”<verse eid="EXO 35:3" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pfinu ipfilapfighwe pfiwe pfa Lihema Lienzeluke</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 35:4" />Musa kawalongela Waisiraeli wose, “Achino chicho chayalaghitse IMNDEWA mchitende. <verse eid="EXO 35:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 35:5" />Mumlapfile pfinu IMNDEWA, chila munu yane ghumoyo ghunoghile yamghalile IMNDEWA pfinu'pfino, nzahabu, fetsa, shaba, <verse eid="EXO 35:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 35:6" />nyutsi tsa langi ya buluu, tsa nzambalau, ndung'u, maghwanda matselu ghanoghile ighadadatsighwe, mighala ya mene, <verse eid="EXO 35:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 35:7" />ngotsi tsa ng'olo mmale itsighelighwe udung'u, ngotsi tse iwamene, mbau tsa mjoholo, <verse eid="EXO 35:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 35:8" />ghamafuta ghe pfitasa, pfilungo pfikwikighwa mna ghamafuta gho kubaka na mna upfumba iunung'ila ghoya, <verse eid="EXO 35:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 35:9" />mabwe gha bei ng'ulu ighokemighwa sadoniki, na mabwe ghangi gha kwikila unzolingo mna chitsibau na chikoba cha mmambagha.<verse eid="EXO 35:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pfinu pfa Lihema Lienzeluke</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 35:10" />“Chila munu iyakubuhu mna sang'ano yoyose mna mwemwe, yatse yatende agho ghose ghayalaghitse IMNDEWA, <verse eid="EXO 35:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 35:11" />yatengenetse lihema, chighubiko chake na chighubiko cha kunze, pfifungo pfake, tsifito tsake, pfikalilo pfake, <verse eid="EXO 35:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 35:12" />sanduku lya laghano na mifumbati yake ya kulighalila, hanu ha libatsi, panziya ilidiwa hanu Haenzeluke ghendo, <verse eid="EXO 35:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 35:13" />metsa na mifumbati yake, pfinu pfake pfose, pfighate ipfikighwe hambele he IMNDEWA, <verse eid="EXO 35:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 35:14" />chighutso cha kwikila pfitasa na pfinu pfake pfose, pfitasa pfake na ghamafuta ghake, <verse eid="EXO 35:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 35:15" />sanduku lya kudusulila upfumba na mifumbati yake, ghamafuta gha kubaka na upfumba iunung'ila ghoya, panziya lyo kudiwa ghumlango ghwa Lihema Lienzeluke, <verse eid="EXO 35:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 35:16" />lisanduku lya kulapfila nambiko tsa kulakatsighwa hamwe ne wapfu wa shaba, mifumbati yake na pfinu pfake pfose, bigha kulu lya shaba na kalilo lyake, <verse eid="EXO 35:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 35:17" />panziya lye luwa, ngutso tsake na pfikalilo pfake, lipanziya lya ghumlango ghwe luwa, <verse eid="EXO 35:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 35:18" />pfighingi pfa Lihema Lienzeluke na pfe iluwa, hamwe na mitsabi yake, <verse eid="EXO 35:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 35:19" />maghwanda ighadadatsighwe ghoya, ighaenzeluke, ighopfalighwa na mtambika Aruni ne iwanaghe ahala hawakwingila hanu haenzeluke kunisang'anila.”<verse eid="EXO 35:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Iwanu wolapfa pfinu pfa lihema</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 35:20" />Kuya iwanu wose wa Isiraeli woka hambele ha Musa, <verse eid="EXO 35:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 35:21" />na chila imunu kamlapfila IMNDEWA pfinu pfa Lihema lyo kwitinganila ka ghumoyo ghwake pfaghubama. Tsawalapfa chila chinu ichibamighwe kwe sang'ano yose yo kutambikila na kwa kutengenetsela maghwanda ighaenzeluke. <verse eid="EXO 35:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 35:22" />Watsa wose wane ghumoyo ghwa kulapfa, iwapinga ne iwamale, tsawalapfa pfipini, tsipete, tsiheleni, tsibangili na chila chinu cha nzahabu. Chila munu tsakamghalila IMNDEWA chinu cha nzahabu. <verse eid="EXO 35:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EXO 35:23" />Chila munu yakalile kana nyutsi tsa langi ya buluu, nzambalau, ndung'u, au maghwanda matselu ghanoghile, mighala ye iwamene au ngotsi ye iwang'olo iighelighwe udung'u katsa kapfilapfa. <verse eid="EXO 35:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EXO 35:24" />Wose iwadahile kughala fetsa au shaba tsawaghala kwa IMNDEWA ka nambiko tsawo. Pfipfila imunu wowose iyakalile na mbau tsa mjoholo tsakatsighala. <verse eid="EXO 35:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EXO 35:25" />Wapinga wose iwakengele tsawafoghosa kwa ghamoko ghawo kuya wapfighala ipfinu pfila pfawafoghose, pfa nyutsi tsa langi ya buluu, nzambalau, ndung'u na maghwanda matselu ighanoghile. <verse eid="EXO 35:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EXO 35:26" />Iwapinga wose wane ghumoyo gho kusang'ana tsawafoghosa mighala ya mene. <verse eid="EXO 35:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EXO 35:27" />Na pfilongotsi tsawaghala ghamabwe gha bei ng'ulu gha sadoniki na ghamabwe ghangi gha kwikila unzolingo mna chitsibau na chikoba cha mmambagha, <verse eid="EXO 35:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EXO 35:28" />pfipfila tsawaghala pfilungo, mafuta gha pfitasa, ghamafuta gho kubaka, na upfumba iunung'ila ghoya. <verse eid="EXO 35:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="EXO 35:29" />Waisiraeli wose iwapinga ne iwamale wane mimoyo ideng'elele ukumlapfila IMNDEWA, wamlapfila pfinu kwaajili ya sang'ano iyawalaghitse kubitila Musa waitende.<verse eid="EXO 35:29" /></para>
  <para style="s">Besaleli na Oholiabu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="EXO 35:30" />Kuya Musa kawalongela Waisiraeli, “Mlole! IMNDEWA kamsaghula Besaleli, imwana wa Uri, ayo Uri aba wake tsa Huri wa kabila lya Yuda. <verse eid="EXO 35:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="EXO 35:31" />Kammemesa Ghumuhe ghwake, kamwing'a ihekima, tsimbutsi, na uwetso, kamtenda yadahe kutenda tsisang'ano tsose, <verse eid="EXO 35:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="EXO 35:32" />yatende sang'ano tsinoghile, mna pfinu pfe nzahabu, fetsa na shaba, <verse eid="EXO 35:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="EXO 35:33" />mna ukusongola ghamabwe gha kuhambila na mna kusongola tsimbau, kwaajili ya sang'ano tsose tsa ufundi. <verse eid="EXO 35:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="EXO 35:34" />Kuya kamtenda yeye na Oholiabu, mwana wa Ahisamaki, wa kabila lya Dani wadahe kuwalangulitsa iwanu wangi. <verse eid="EXO 35:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="EXO 35:35" />Kaweng'a udaha wa kutenda chila sang'ano iitendighwa ne iwanu iwoghela unzolingo, au iwanu iwohamba kwa nyutsi tsa buluu, tsa nzambalau na ndung'u na maghwanda matselu ighanoghile. Wodaha kutenda sang'ano tsose tsa ufundi.<verse eid="EXO 35:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 35" />
  <chapter number="36" style="c" sid="EXO 36" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 36:1" />“Besaleli, Oholiabu na iwatenda sang'ano iweng'ighwe ne Imulungu ujutsi na ukumanya, iwanu iwomanya kutenda chila chinu ichibamighwa kutsengela Lihema Lienzeluke, watsotenda chila chinu ka IMNDEWA pfayalaghitse.”<verse eid="EXO 36:1" /></para>
  <para style="s">Iwanu woghala nzawadi ketseketse</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 36:2" />Kuya Musa kamkema Besaleli, Oholiabu ne iwanu wose iweng'ighwe ujutsi ne IMNDEWA, na chila munu yabamile kutsa kusang'ana. <verse eid="EXO 36:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 36:3" />Nawo tsawabokela kulawa kwa Musa ipfinu pfose ipfilapfighwe na Waisiraeli kwa mimoyo yawo wenyegho kwaajili ya sang'ano ya Lihema Lienzeluke. Kuya iwanu tsawaghendelela kumghalila Musa tsinzawadi chila mitondo, tsawalapfile kwa kubama wenyegho. <verse eid="EXO 36:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 36:4" />Kuya iwanu wose wane ujutsi iwang'ali wosang'ana mna kutsenga Lihema lya kwitinganila waghenda <verse eid="EXO 36:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 36:5" />wamlongela Musa, “Iwanu woghala pfinu pfingi kubita ipfibamighwa kwa isang'ano yailaghitse IMNDEWA tuitende.”<verse eid="EXO 36:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 36:6" />Apfo Musa kalaghitsa mna indalo yose iwanu wose wamale kwe iwapinga waleke kughendelela kughala pfinu pfa kutsengela Lihema Lienzeluke, baho iwanu ng'awaghalile keli ipfinu baye, <verse eid="EXO 36:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 36:7" />kwaapfila ipfinu pfawakalile napfo tsa pfingi ng'ani kubita ipfibamighwa kutendela isang'ano yose.<verse eid="EXO 36:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lihema lienzeluke lyotsengighwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 36:8" />Iwamale wose wane ujutsi tsawatengenetsa lihema kwa mapanzia kumi gha maghwanda matselu ghanoghile, na kwa nyutsi tsa buluu, nzambalau, na ndung'u, kuya waghahamba kwa pfiumbe wane mapamanilo iwakemighwe makelubi, kwa sang'ano ya fundi iyakubuhu. <verse eid="EXO 36:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 36:9" />Chila panzia tsalina utali wa futi alubaini na mbili, na ughatsi wake futi sita. Mapanzia ghose tsaghelingana. <verse eid="EXO 36:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 36:10" />Tsakaghalumbitsa hamwe mapanzia matano ili kutenda hande limwe, na katenda pfipfo kwa ghamapanzia aghala ghangi matano. <verse eid="EXO 36:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 36:11" />Kuya katenda pfitanzi pfa buluu mna mindo ya panziya lya utsighilo lya hande lya mwanduso, na pfitanzi pfingi mna panziya lya utsighilo lya lihande lya kabili. <verse eid="EXO 36:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 36:12" />Katenda pfitanzi hamsini mna panzia limwe lya hande lya mwanduso, na pfitanzi hamsini pfingi mna mindo ya panziya lili mna lihande lya kabili, ipfitanzi'pfo tsapfilolesa. <verse eid="EXO 36:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 36:13" />Kuya katenda pfipfungo hamsini pfa nzahabu, kaghalumbitsa hamwe ghamahande 'ghala meli gha ghamapanzia, apfo lihema liwa limwe.<verse eid="EXO 36:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 36:14" />Pfipfila katenda ghubiko lya lihema kwa mapanzia kumi na limwe gha mighala ya mene. <verse eid="EXO 36:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 36:15" />Chila panziya tsalina futi alubaini na tano, na ughatsi wake futi sita. Mapanzia ghose kumi na limwe tsaghelingana. <verse eid="EXO 36:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 36:16" />Apfo kaghalumbitsa hamwe mapanzia matano, na mapanzia sita kaghalumbitsa hangi. <verse eid="EXO 36:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 36:17" />Kuya katengenetsa pfitanzi hamsini mna mindo ya panzia lya utsighilo lya hande limwe, na pfitanzi hamsini mna mindo ya lipanziya lya utsighilo lya lihande lya kabili. <verse eid="EXO 36:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 36:18" />Pfipfila tsakatengenetsa pfifungo hamsini pfa shaba ili kulumbitsa mahande 'ghala meli gha lighubiko, ili kutenda lighubiko liwe limwe. <verse eid="EXO 36:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 36:19" />Kuya katengenetsa maghubiko ghangi meli, limwe lya ngotsi ndekendeke ndung'u tsa ng'olo mmale, na mchanya mwake ghubiko lingi lya ngotsi ndekendeke tsa mene.<verse eid="EXO 36:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 36:20" />Kuya katengenetsa fulemu tsa mjoholo tso ukwimila lihema. <verse eid="EXO 36:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 36:21" />Chila fulemu tsaina utali wa futi kumi na tano na ughatsi wake futi mbili na lobo. <verse eid="EXO 36:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 36:22" />Chila fulemu tsaina membe mbili tso kulumbitsila. Fulemu tsose tsa lihema pfipfo pfayatsitengenetse. <verse eid="EXO 36:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EXO 36:23" />Fulemu'tso tsa lihema tsatsitengenetsighwa apfi, fulemu ishilini ubali wa kusini, <verse eid="EXO 36:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EXO 36:24" />na pfikalilo pfake alubaini pfa fetsa pfiwe hasi mwe tsifulemu'tso ishilini, pfikalilo pfibili hasi mwa chila fulemu ili kukindisa tsimembe 'tsila mbili. <verse eid="EXO 36:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EXO 36:25" />Kune ubali wa kabili wa lihema, ubali wa kasikazini tsakatengenetsa fulemu ishilini, <verse eid="EXO 36:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EXO 36:26" />na pfikalilo pfake alubaini pfa fetsa, pfikalilo pfibili hasi mwa chila fulemu. <verse eid="EXO 36:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EXO 36:27" />Ubali wa kuchughu wa lihema, ubali wa maghalibi, tsakatengenetsa fulemu sita. <verse eid="EXO 36:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EXO 36:28" />Naye katengenetsa fulemu mbili tso kukala mna tsimembe mbili tsa Lihema ubali wa kuchughu. <verse eid="EXO 36:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="EXO 36:29" />Natso tsatsibasa kulawa hasi, na tsibasa pfipfo hatsighendile kuchanya, tsilumbitsa hane bangili ya mwanduso. Pfipfo pfatsitengenetsighwe fulemu'tso mbili mna tsimembe'tso mbili. <verse eid="EXO 36:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="EXO 36:30" />Apfo tsahana fulemu nane na pfikalilo pfake pfa fetsa kumi na sita, pfikalilo pfibili hasi mwa chila fulemu.<verse eid="EXO 36:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="EXO 36:31" />Kuya katengenetsa mifumbati ya mjoholo, mifumbati mitano yo kukindilisa fulemu tsa ubali umwe wa Lihema, <verse eid="EXO 36:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="EXO 36:32" />na mifumbati mitano yo kukindilisa tsifulemu tsa ubali wa kabili wa Lihema na mifumbati mitano iwe ya ubali wa kuchughu wa Lihema iuli maghalibi. <verse eid="EXO 36:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="EXO 36:33" />Naye kaghutengenetsa mfumbati ghwa haghati ghulumbilile kulawa utsighilo uno mbaka utsighilo ungi wa tsifulemu. <verse eid="EXO 36:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="EXO 36:34" />Tsifulemu tsose katsindika nzahabu, kuya katengenetsa bangili tsa nzahabu tso kukindila imifumbati'yo, nayo kaikandika nzahabu.<verse eid="EXO 36:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="EXO 36:35" />Naye katengenetsa panzia lya maghwanda matselu ighanoghile lidadatsighwe kwa nyutsi tsa buluu, nzambalau, na ndung'u. Panziya alyo tsalihambighwa pfinoghile kwa pfilumbe wane mapamanilo iwokemighwa makelubi kwa tsinyutsi'tso. <verse eid="EXO 36:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="EXO 36:36" />Na kalitengenetsela ngutso nne tsa mijoholo, katsikandika nzahabu na kutsighelela pfifungo pfa nzahabu. Pfipfila kapfitengenetsela pfikalilo pfine pfa fetsa. <verse eid="EXO 36:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="EXO 36:37" />Pfipfila katengenetsa panzia lyo kudiwa ghumlango ghwa lihema lya nyutsi tsa buluu, nzambalau, ndung'u na maghwanda matselu, nalyo tsalihambighwa pfinoghile kwa sang'ano ya kudalitsi, <verse eid="EXO 36:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="EXO 36:38" />na ngutso tsake tano itsili na pfinanikilo. Kusa kwa tsingutso tsake na tsifito tsake kapfikandika nzahabu, lekeni pfikalilo pfake pfitano tsapfikala pfa shaba.<verse eid="EXO 36:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 36" />
  <chapter number="37" style="c" sid="EXO 37" />
  <para style="s">Kutengenetsa Sanduku lya Laghano</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="EXO 25:10-22">Kul 25:10-22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 37:1" />Besaleli tsakatengenetsa sanduku kwa mbau tsa mjoholo, utali wake futi ndatu na lobo ndatu, ughatsi wake futi mbili na lobo na chimo chake futi mbili na lobo. <verse eid="EXO 37:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 37:2" />Kalikandika nzahabu iliyeka mghati na kunze, kuya kalitengenetsela kingamitsi ya nzahabu chila ubali. <verse eid="EXO 37:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 37:3" />Kuya kalitengenetsela bangili nne tsa nzahabu tso kulighalila, katsighela mna tsimembe tsake, bangili mbili ubali umwe, na bangili mbili ubali ungi. <verse eid="EXO 37:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 37:4" />Kuya katengenetsa mifumbati ya mjoholo na kaikandika nzahabu. <verse eid="EXO 37:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 37:5" />Na mifumbati'yo kaighela mna tsibangili itsili mna tsibali tsila mbili tsa lisanduku, iwe yo kulighalila.<verse eid="EXO 37:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 37:6" />Kuya katengenetsa chighubiko ichikemighwa hanu ha libatsi kwa nzahabu iliyeka, utali wake futi ndatu na lobo ndatu, na ughatsi wake futi mbili na lobo. <verse eid="EXO 37:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 37:7" />Pfipfila kahonda nzahabu kafina pfiumbe wabili wane mapamanilo iwakemighwe makelubi kaweka mna utsighilo we ichighubiko'cho, <verse eid="EXO 37:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 37:8" />kerubi yumwe mna utsighilo umwe, na kerubi wa keli mna utsighilo ungi. Kawafina makerubi'wo wawa chinu chimwe na ichighubiko'cho utsighilo uno na utsighilo ungi. <verse eid="EXO 37:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 37:9" />Makerubi welolesa, mapamanilo ghawo ghapamanyala ghaghubika chighubiko cha lisanduku, ne pfihanga pfawo tsapfinamila ichighubiko cha lisanduku.<verse eid="EXO 37:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Imetsa ye pfighate yotengenetsighwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 37:10" />Kuya tsakatengenetsa metsa ya mjoholo ine utali wa futi ndatu, na ughatsi wake futi imwe na nusu, na chimo chake futi mbili na lobo. <verse eid="EXO 37:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 37:11" />Tsakaikandika nzahabu iliyeka, na kuitengenetsela kingamitsi ya nzahabu. <verse eid="EXO 37:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 37:12" />Tsakaitsungulusila lufito line ughatsi wa lobo futi, na kaitengenetsela kingamitsi ya nzahabu. <verse eid="EXO 37:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 37:13" />Kuya katengenetsa bangili nne tsa nzahabu na katsighela mna tsimembe tsake hala haghatsighile matendeghu. <verse eid="EXO 37:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 37:14" />Bangili'tso tsa kukindila mifumbati ila ya kughalila tsatsikighwa habehi na ubau ula iutsungulusighwe. <verse eid="EXO 37:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 37:15" />Tsakatenda mifumbati mibili ya mjoholo ya kuighalila, kuya kaikandika nzahabu. <verse eid="EXO 37:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 37:16" />Kuya tsakatengenetsa pfinu pfa nzahabu iliyeka pfa kwika mchanya mwe metsa, pfisahani pfake, na pfikombe pfake na mabakuli gha nambiko tsa pfokunwa.<verse eid="EXO 37:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Chighutso che pfitasa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 37:17" />Kuya watengenetsa na chighutso che pfitasa kwa nzahabu iliyeka. Kalilo lyake, na lufito lwa chinu acho che ukwikila pfitasa tsapfikala chinu chimwe na pfikombe pfake, pfikonyo pfake na maluwa ghake, <verse eid="EXO 37:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 37:18" />nacho tsachikala na maputila sita ighalawile chila mlubapfu mwake, maputila madatu ubali uno na madatu ubali ungi wa chighutso. <verse eid="EXO 37:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 37:19" />Mne chila putila tsakukala na pfikombe pfidatu ipfighalile na maluwa gha mlotsi, chila chikombe na chikonyo chake na luwa lyake. <verse eid="EXO 37:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 37:20" />Na mna chighutso tsakukala na pfikombe pfidatu ipfighalile na maluwa gha mlotsi, na pfikonyo pfake na maluwa ghake. <verse eid="EXO 37:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 37:21" />Tsakukala na pea ndatu tsa maputila, hasi mwa chila pea tsakukala na chikonyo chimwe. <verse eid="EXO 37:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 37:22" />Pfikonyo, na maputila tsapfilumbitsighwa hamwe na chighutso che pfitasa, na chose tsachitengenetsighwa kwa nzahabu iliyeka. <verse eid="EXO 37:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EXO 37:23" />Kuya katengenetsa na pfitasa pfake saba, mibato yake na tsisahani tsake kwa nzahabu iliyeka. <verse eid="EXO 37:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EXO 37:24" />Tsakachitengenetsa chighutso che pfitasa na pfinu pfake kwa kilo salasini na tano tsa nzahabu.<verse eid="EXO 37:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lisanduku lyo kupfukitsa upfumba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="EXO 37:25" />Tsawatengenetsa sanduku lyo kupfukitsila upfumba kwa mibani ya mjoholo. Sanduku'alyo tsalikala la mlaba, utali wake futi imwe na nusu kwa sentimita ishilini mane na sano, chimo chake sentimita ishilini tisa. Membe tsake tsatsikala chinu chimwe na hanu henyegho hakupfukitsila upfumba. <verse eid="EXO 37:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EXO 37:26" />Naye tsakahakandika nzahabu iliyeka, ubali we chanya na mlubapfu mwose, membe tsake, kuya tsakatenda kingamitsi ya nzahabu. <verse eid="EXO 37:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EXO 37:27" />Tsakatengenetsa bangili mbili tsa nzahabu haisi he kingamitsi, hane tsibanzi mbili itsilolesa. Bangili'tso tsitumika kukindila mifumbati ya kuhaghalila. <verse eid="EXO 37:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EXO 37:28" />Tsakatengenetsa mifumbati mibili ya mjoholo na kuikandika nzahabu. <verse eid="EXO 37:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="EXO 37:29" />Kuya tsakatengenetsa ghamafuta ghanoghile gha kubaka, na upfumba iunung'ila ghoya iuanganyighwe naipfinu pfinung'ila ghoya.<verse eid="EXO 37:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 37" />
  <chapter number="38" style="c" sid="EXO 38" />
  <para style="s">Ukutengenetsa sanduku lya nambiko tsa kulakatsighwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 38:1" />Tsakatengenetsa sanduku lya kulapfila nambiko ya kulakatsighwa. Lisanduku'lyo tsalikala lya mlaba, futi saba na nusu kwa futi saba na nusu, chimo chake futi nne nusu. <verse eid="EXO 38:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 38:2" />Tsakatengenetsa membe itsisomoke ka tse mnyama, ili membe na lisanduku'lyo pfiwe chinu chimwe, kuya lisanduku'lyo tsawalikandika shaba. <verse eid="EXO 38:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 38:3" />Tsakatengenetsa na pfinu pfose pfa lisanduku, pfiha, mibato, mabeseni, makoleo na pfihali pfa kuhalila ghumoto. Pfinu apfo pfose tsawapfitengenetsa kwa shaba. <verse eid="EXO 38:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 38:4" />Tsakatengenetsa wapfu wa shaba, kaughela hasi mwe kingamitsi ya lisanduku mbaka haghati ha lisanduku. <verse eid="EXO 38:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 38:5" />Mne membe nne tsakatengenetsa bangili nne tso kwingitsila mifumbati. <verse eid="EXO 38:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 38:6" />Tsakatengenetsa mifumbati ya mjoholo na kuikandika shaba. <verse eid="EXO 38:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 38:7" />Tsakaika mifumbati ila mna bangili tsila itsikalile mlubapfu mwe lisanduku, yo kulighalila. Lisanduku'lyo ilitengenetsighwe kwa mibani tsalikala na mpfungu mghati.<verse eid="EXO 38:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ukutengenetsa libigha lya shaba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 38:8" />Kuya tsakatengenetsa bigha lya shaba na kalilo lyake lya shaba. Libigha alyo tsalitengenetsighwa kwe pfiyoo pfa shaba pfe ukwilolela ipfilapfighwe ne iwapinga iwang'ali wosang'ana hane ghumlango ghwa Lihema lyo Kwitinganila.<verse eid="EXO 38:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Iluwa lwa Lihema lya Kwitinganila lyotsengighwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 38:9" />Kuya tsakatsenga luwa ilitsunguluka Lihema lya Kwitinganila. Ubali wa kusini we luwa tsauna mapanzia matselu ighanoghile ghane utali wa futi miya na hamsini, <verse eid="EXO 38:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 38:10" />nagho tsaghakindighwa na ngutso ishilini tsa shaba, tsine pfikalilo ishilini pfa shaba. Lekeni pfinanikilo pfa ngutso'tso na tsifito tsake tsapfikala pfa fetsa. <verse eid="EXO 38:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 38:11" />Ubali wa kasikazini nawo pfipfila tsauna mapanzia ghane utali wa futi miya na hamsini, na ngutso tsake ishilini tsa shaba, lekeni pfinanikilo pfa tsingutso'tso na tsifito tsake tsa pfa fetsa. <verse eid="EXO 38:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 38:12" />Ubali wa maghalibi tsauna mapanzia ghane utali wa futi sabini na tano, tsingutso tsake kumi na pfikalilo pfake kumi. Pfinanikilo pfa tsingutso na tsifito tsake tsa pfa fetsa. <verse eid="EXO 38:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 38:13" />Ubali wa mashaliki kune ghumlango, tsauna ughatsi wa futi sabini na tano. <verse eid="EXO 38:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 38:14" />Mapanzia gha chila ubali we ghumlango tsaghana utali wa futi ishilini na mbili na nusu, hamwe na tsingutso tsake ndatu na pfikalilo pfake pfidatu. <verse eid="EXO 38:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 38:15" />Pfipfila na ubali uyaghe, chila ubali wa ghumlango tsauna mapanzia ghane ughatsi wa futi ishilini na mbli na nusu, hamwe ne tsingutso tsake ndatu na pfikalilo pfake pfidatu. <verse eid="EXO 38:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 38:16" />Mapanzia ghose kutsunguluka iluwa tsaghatengenetsighwa kwa chitambala chitselu ichinoghile. <verse eid="EXO 38:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 38:17" />Pfikalilo pfose pfa tsingutso tsa pfa shaba, lekeni ipfinanikilo pfa tsingutso'tso na tsifito tsake tsa pfa fetsa. Kusa kwa tsingutso'tso tsa kukandikighwa fetsa na tsikindilisighwa kwa fito tsa fetsa.<verse eid="EXO 38:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 38:18" />Panzia lya ghumlango ghwa iluwa tsalitengenetsighwa chitambala chitselu chinoghile, na kughelighwa unzolingo kwa nyutsi tsa langi ya buluu, nzambalau, na ndung'u, nalyo tsalina utali wa futi salasini na chimo chake futi saba na nusu ka pfaghali mapanzia gha luwa. <verse eid="EXO 38:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 38:19" />Pfipfila tsingutso tsake tsatsikala nne na pfikalilo pfake pfinne pfose pfa shaba. Pfinanikilo pfake pfose pfa fetsa, na kusa kwa tsingutso kukandikighwa fetsa, na tsifito tsake tsatsikala tsa fetsa. <verse eid="EXO 38:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 38:20" />Na ipfighingi pfose pfa Lihema na pfe luwa kutsunguluka Lihema lyose tsa pfa shaba.<verse eid="EXO 38:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ipfipimo pfe pfinu pfa Lihema</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 38:21" />Apfino pfipfo ipfinu ipfitumike kutsengela Lihema Lienzeluke, amwo hawaghekile ghamabamba ghe ghamabwe ighandikighwe Ghamalaghitso, ka pfapfipetighwe ne Walawi kwa laghitso lya Musa, kwa ulongotsi wa Isamari mwana wa mtambika Aruni. <verse eid="EXO 38:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 38:22" />Besaleli mwana wa Uri, ayo Uri aba wake tsa Huri, wa lukolo lwa Yuda, tsakatenda chila chinu IMNDEWA chayamlaghitse Musa. <verse eid="EXO 38:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EXO 38:23" />Hamwe naye tsakakala Oholiabu mwa Ahisamaki, wa lukolo lwa Dani, imunu iyakubuhu mna ukwandika kwa ukukwangula, na iyakubuhu mna na ukwika uonzolingo kwa nyutsi tsa langi ya buluu, nzambalau na ndung'u mna chitambala chitselu chinoghile. <verse eid="EXO 38:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EXO 38:24" />Nzahabu yose iwamlapfile Imulungu kwa kutsengela ikaye ihenzeluke tsa kilo miya nane sabini na saba na glamu miya ndatu kwa kulola pfipimo ipfili mna ikaye iyenzeluke.<verse eid="EXO 38:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="EXO 38:25" />Ifetsa iwalapfile iwanu iwapetighwe, tsaikala kilo elufu ndatu miya nne na ishilini, kwa kulola pfipimo ipfili mna ikaye ienzeluke. <verse eid="EXO 38:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EXO 38:26" />Chila munu iyapetighwe kulawa iyane miyaka ishilini na kughendelela tsakalapfa fetsa glamu tano ka pfaipangighwe, na iwamale wose iwapetighwe tsawakala, laki sita elufu ndatu miya tano na hamsini. <verse eid="EXO 38:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EXO 38:27" />Kilo elufu ndatu tsa fetsa tsatsitumika kutengenetsela pfikalilo pfila miya imwe pfa ikaye ienzeluke na patsiya lila, kilo salasini kwa chila chikalilo. <verse eid="EXO 38:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EXO 38:28" />Chila kilo kumi na saba na glamu sabini na tano itsisighale, tsatsitumika kutengenetsela ipfinanikilo pfa tsingutso na kutsikandika fetsa kusa kwa tsingutso na kutengenetsela tsifito.<verse eid="EXO 38:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="EXO 38:29" />Shaba iighalighwe kwe IMNDEWA na Waisiraeli tsaikala kilo elufu mbili miya nne na sita. <verse eid="EXO 38:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="EXO 38:30" />Besaleli tsakatumila shaba ayo kutengenetsela pfikalilo pfa ghumlango ghwa Lihema lya Kwitinganila, sanduku lyo kakatsila tsinambiko, hamwe ne wapfu wake wa shaba na pfinu pfose pfa lisanduku. <verse eid="EXO 38:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="EXO 38:31" />Pfikalilo pfa luwa ilutsunguluke lihema lya kwitinganila na pfa ghumlango ghwa luwa, na pfighingi pfose pfa Lihema Lienzeluke na pfe luwa.<verse eid="EXO 38:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 38" />
  <chapter number="39" style="c" sid="EXO 39" />
  <para style="s">Maghwanda gha Iwatambika</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 39:1" />Tsawatumila nyutsi tsa langi ya buluu, nzambalau na ndung'u kutengenetsela maghwanda gha kusang'anila Ikaye Ienzeluke. Tsawamtendela Aruni maghwanda mahenzeluka ka IMNDEWA pfayamlaghitse Musa. <verse eid="EXO 39:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 39:2" />Tsawatengenetsa chitsibau kwa chitambala chitselu chinoghile, na wachihamba kwa nyutsi tsa nzahabu, buluu, nzambalau na ndung'u. <verse eid="EXO 39:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 39:3" />Tsawatengenetsa pfibamba pfisisili pfe nzahabu, watsighana nyutsi ndodondodo ili watsidadatse hamwe na nyutsi tsa buluu, nzambalau, ndung'u, na chitambala chitselu chinoghile. <verse eid="EXO 39:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 39:4" />Chitsibau'cho tsachipfalighwa kwa mitsabi mili mmahegha iidadatsighwe hane membe tsake mbili. <verse eid="EXO 39:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 39:5" />Msipi ighutendighwe pfinoghile mchanya mwake ili kuchoela tsaghukala chinu chimwe na chitsibau'cho, kuya tsapfitengenetsighwa kwa pfinu pfipfo, nzahabu, nyutsi tsa langi ya buluu, nzambalau, ndung'u, na chitambala chinoghile ka IMNDEWA pfayamlaghitse Musa. <verse eid="EXO 39:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 39:6" />Kuya watengenetsa mabwe gha bei ng'ulu gha sadoniki, wagheka mna pfikindilo pfa nzahabu, nagho ghandikighwa mataghwa kumi na meli gha wana wa Isiraeli ka imunu pfayakwandika ghumuhuli kwa ukukwangula. <verse eid="EXO 39:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 39:7" />Tsawagheka ghamabwe agho mna pfihande pfa mmahegha mwe chitsibau acho ili kuwakumbuka iwana wa Isiraeli, ka IMNDEWA pfayamlaghitse Musa.<verse eid="EXO 39:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ukutengenetsa ichikoba cha mmambagha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 39:8" />Tsawatengenetsa chikoba cha mmambagha ka pfawachitendile chitsibau chila, kwa nyutsi tsa nzahabu, buluu, nzambalau, ndung'u, mna chitambala chitselu chinoghile. <verse eid="EXO 39:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 39:9" />Chikoba acho tsachikala cha mlaba, utali wake nchi tisa na ghatsi wake nchi tisa, kuya tsachibetighwa. <verse eid="EXO 39:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 39:10" />Chikoba acho tsachihambighwa milia mine ya ghamabwe gha bei ng'ulu, mlia ghwa mwanduso tsaghukala ghwa akiki, topasi, na alimasi ndung'u, <verse eid="EXO 39:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 39:11" />Mlia ghwa kabili tsaghukala ghwa tsumalidi, yakuti samawi na alimasi, <verse eid="EXO 39:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 39:12" />mlia ghwa kadatu tsaghukala ghwa yasinto, akiki ndung'u na amesisto, <verse eid="EXO 39:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 39:13" />na mlia ghwa kane tsaghukala ghwa tsabalajadi, shohamu na yasipi, ghose tsaghaghumighwa mna pfikindilo pfa nzahabu. <verse eid="EXO 39:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 39:14" />Apfo tsahana mabwe kumi na meli ighandikighwe mataghwa gha wana wa Isiraeli. Tsaghandikighwa kwa kukwangula ka pfawakwandika ghumuhuli, chila libwe lyandikighwa taghwa kulangusa wana kumi na meli gha Isiraeli. <verse eid="EXO 39:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 39:15" />Tsawachitengenetsela chikoba cha mmambagha mikufu ya nzahabu iliyeka. <verse eid="EXO 39:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 39:16" />Tsawatengenetsa pfikindilo pfibili pfa nzahabu iliyeka na bangili mbili tsa uchanya tsa chikoba acho. <verse eid="EXO 39:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 39:17" />Mikufu ayo mili ya nzahabu tsawayoha hane bangili'tso tsa chikoba cha mmambagha. <verse eid="EXO 39:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 39:18" />Kusa kwe imikufi ayo mili ye nzahabu tsawakunanika kune pfikindilo pfibili, wapfikindilisa kune pfihande pfila pfa mmayegha pfe chitsibau, ubali wa hambele. <verse eid="EXO 39:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 39:19" />Tsawatengenetsa bangili mbili tsa nzahabu, watsika hane membe mbili tsa hasi ubali wa mghati wa chikoba acho cha mmambagha habehi na chitsibau. <verse eid="EXO 39:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 39:20" />Tsawatengenetsa bangili tsingi mbili tsa nzahabu na kutsika hambele mna ncha tsa hasi tsa pfihande pfa chitsibau, hanu hachilumba na msipi ighutendighwe pfinoghile. <verse eid="EXO 39:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 39:21" />Tsawoha chikoba cha mmambagha hane chitsibau kwa kutsoha bangili tsake na chitsibau kwa lutsabi lwa bululu, ili chikoba acho chileke kuleghela ili chikalile msipi ghula ighutengenetsighwe pfinoghile, ka IMNDEWA pfayamlaghitse Musa.<verse eid="EXO 39:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Maghwanda ghangi gha iwatambika</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 39:22" />Tsawatengenetsa joho tali lya buluu yo kupfala mghati mwe chitsibau. <verse eid="EXO 39:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EXO 39:23" />Nalyo tsalina tobo mghati lya kwingitsila litwi, litobo alyo tsalitsungulusighwa mindo iidadatsighwe ghoya ili lileke kudegheka. <verse eid="EXO 39:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EXO 39:24" />Hane mindo ya hasi ya lijoho tsawahamba kwa makomamanga gha buluu, nzambalau, madung'u, na chitambala chitselu chinoghile. <verse eid="EXO 39:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EXO 39:25" />Kuya tsawatengenetsa mbughi tsa nzahabu, na chila haghati ha komamanga tsaweka mbughi. <verse eid="EXO 39:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EXO 39:26" />Apfo, mbughi na komamanga tsapfilongotsa kutsunguluka mindo ya lijoho'alyo, ili kutumika ka IMNDEWA pfayamlaghitse Musa.<verse eid="EXO 39:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="EXO 39:27" />Kuya wawatengenetsela Aruni ne iwanaghe kanzu tsa chitambala chitselu chinoghile, <verse eid="EXO 39:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EXO 39:28" />chilemba cha chitambala chinoghile, kofia tsa chitambala chitselu chinoghile, kaputula tsa chitambala chitselu chinoghile, <verse eid="EXO 39:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="EXO 39:29" />na misipi ya chitambala chitselu chinoghile, kwa nyutsi tsa langi ya buluu, nzambalau, ndung'u na kuihamba pfinoghile, ka IMNDEWA pfayamlaghitse Musa. <verse eid="EXO 39:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="EXO 39:30" />Kuya tsawatengenetsa chibamba cha nzahabu iliyeka kwaajili ya pembelo henzeluka na kwandika mchanya mwake ka pfawakwandika muhuli, “ILAPFIGHWA KWA IMNDEWA IMULUNGU.” <verse eid="EXO 39:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="EXO 39:31" />Kuya tsawachoha hambele ha chilemba achila kwa msipi ghwa langi ya buluu, ka IMNDEWA pfayamlaghitse Musa.<verse eid="EXO 39:31" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ukumala kwa isang'ano</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="EXO 39:32" />Apfo isang'ano yose ya Lihema lya Kwitinganila imala. Waisiraeli watenda ghose ka IMNDEWA pfayamlaghitse Musa. <verse eid="EXO 39:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="EXO 39:33" />Wamghalila Musa Lihema na ipfinu pfake pfose na pfinanikilo pfake na fulemu tsake, mifumbati yake, ngutso tsake, na pfikalilo pfake, <verse eid="EXO 39:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="EXO 39:34" />na chighubiko cha ngotsi tsa ng'unzu we ng'olo tsighelighwe langi ndung'u, na chighubiko cha ngotsi tsa mene, panzia lya Ikaye Ienzeluke, <verse eid="EXO 39:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="EXO 39:35" />sanduku lya laghano, na mifumbati yake, na ichighubiko chake ichili hanu ha libatsi, <verse eid="EXO 39:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="EXO 39:36" />imetsa na pfinu pfake na ipfighate ipfilapfighwe kwe Imulungu, <verse eid="EXO 39:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="EXO 39:37" />ne chighutso che pfitasa cha nzahabu iliyeka na pfitasa pfake na pfinu pfake hamwe na ghamafuta kwaajili ya pfitasa apfo, <verse eid="EXO 39:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="EXO 39:38" />sanduku lya nzahabu, mafuta gha kubaka, upfumba iunung'ila ghoya, na panzia lya ghumlango lya Lihema, <verse eid="EXO 39:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="EXO 39:39" />lisanduku lya shaba, iwapfu wake wa shaba, na imifumbati yake na pfinu pfake pfose, libigha na kalilo lyake, <verse eid="EXO 39:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="EXO 39:40" />mapanzia gha luwa na tsingutso tsake na pfikalilo pfake, panzia lya ghumlango ghwe luwa na mitsabi yake na pfighingi pfake na pfinu pfose ipfibamighwe mna isang'ano ya Lihema Lienzeluka, <verse eid="EXO 39:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="EXO 39:41" />na maghwanda ghose ighatengenetsighwe pfinoghile kwaajili ya sang'ano ya hanu hahenzeluka, maghwanda mahenzeluka ya mtambika Aruni, na gha wanaghe kwaajili ya sang'ano ya kulapfa nambiko. <verse eid="EXO 39:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="EXO 39:42" />Waisiraeli tsawatenda chila chinu ka IMNDEWA pfayamlaghitsa Musa. <verse eid="EXO 39:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="EXO 39:43" />Musa kailola sang'ano'yo, kanoghelighwa watenda chila chinu ka IMNDEWA pfayalaghitse. Apfo Musa kawabaliki.<verse eid="EXO 39:43" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 39" />
  <chapter number="40" style="c" sid="EXO 40" />
  <para style="s">Lihema lienzeluke lyakwimisighwa na lyolapfighwa kwe IMNDEWA</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 40:1" />IMNDEWA tsakamlongela Musa, <verse eid="EXO 40:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 40:2" />“Litsuwa lya mwanduso lya mwetsi ghwa mwanduso ulimise Lihema lyo Kwitinganila. <verse eid="EXO 40:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 40:3" />Mghati mwa Lihema alyo wike Lisanduku lya Laghano, kuya wike panzia hambele hake. <verse eid="EXO 40:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 40:4" />Kuya wike metsa na wike pfinu pfake mchanya mwake. Wingitse chighutso che pfitasa na kupfika pfitasa pfake mchanya mwake. <verse eid="EXO 40:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 40:5" />Lisanduku lye nzahabu lya kupfukitsila upfumba ulike hambele ha Lisanduku lya Laghano, kuya wike lipanzia hane ghumlango ghwa Lihema lyo Kwitinganila. <verse eid="EXO 40:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 40:6" />Lisanduku lyo kulapfila nambiko ya kulakatsighwa ulike hambele ha ghumlango ghwa Lihema Lienzeluke lyo Kwitinganila. <verse eid="EXO 40:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 40:7" />Bigha lya kuhopfughila ulike haghati ha Lihema lyo Kwitinganila na lisanduku lyo kulapfila nambiko tso kulakatsighwa, kuya ulimemese matsi. <verse eid="EXO 40:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 40:8" />Utsenge luwa litsunguluke kwose, na wike lipanzia hane ghumlango ghwake.<verse eid="EXO 40:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 40:9" />“Kuya ulihimike Lihema Lienzeluke hamwe ne pfinu pfake pfose kwa kupfibakatsa ghamafuta ghala gha kubaka, nalyo litsakuwa lienzeluka. <verse eid="EXO 40:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 40:10" />Pfipfila ulihimike lisanduku lyo kulapfila nambiko tsa kulakatsighwa na pfinu pfake pfose kwa kulibakatsa ghamafuta, nalyo litsakuwa lienzeluka ghendo. <verse eid="EXO 40:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 40:11" />Bigha lya kwohopfughila na kalilo lyake pfipfila ulike wakfu pfipfo kwa kulibakatsa ghamafuta.<verse eid="EXO 40:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 40:12" />“Kuya umkeme Aruni na iwanaghe watse hane ghumlango ghwa Lihema lyo Kwitinganila, kuya uwahopfughe kwa ghamatsi. <verse eid="EXO 40:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 40:13" />Umpfatse Aruni ghamaghwanda mahenzeluka, umbake ghamafuta umwike wakfu, ili yanisang'anile ka mtambika. <verse eid="EXO 40:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 40:14" />Uwakeme ne iwanaghe, uwapfatse tsikanzu. <verse eid="EXO 40:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 40:15" />Kuya uwabake ghamafuta ka pfaumbakile aba wawo, nawo wanitumikile ka watambika. Kubakighwa ghamafuta agho kutsowatenda wawe watambika wa ghamatsuwa ghose mna pfeleko pfawo pfose.”<verse eid="EXO 40:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 40:16" />Musa tsakatenda agho ghose ka IMNDEWA pfayamlaghitse. <verse eid="EXO 40:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 40:17" />Mne litsuwa lya mwanduso lya ghumwetsi ghwa mwanduso ghumwaka wa kabili kulawa hawalawile Misiri, Lihema lyo Kwitinganila limisighwa. <verse eid="EXO 40:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 40:18" />Musa ne wanu wake walimisa Lihema, pfikalilo pfake, kemisa tsifulemu tsake, kengitsa imifumbati yake na kwimisa tsingutso tsake. <verse eid="EXO 40:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 40:19" />Tsawatandatsa panzia mchanya mwa Lihema lyo Kwitinganila na kwika chighubiko mchanya mwake, ka IMNDEWA pfayamlaghitse. <verse eid="EXO 40:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 40:20" />Kuya tsakasola pfibamba pfila pfibili pfa ghamabwe kapfika mna lisanduku lila. Kaika mifumbati ila ya kulighalila mchanya mwe lisanduku, kuya keka chighubiko cha lisanduku ichikemighwa Hanu he Libatsi mchanya mwake. <verse eid="EXO 40:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 40:21" />Kuya kalika Lisanduku lila mghati mwe Lihema lyo Kwitinganila na keka panzia, na kwa kutenda apfo kalipfisa Lisanduku lya Laghano ka IMNDEWA pfayalaghitse. <verse eid="EXO 40:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 40:22" />Tsakeka metsa mghati mwa Lihema lyo kwitinganila, ubali wa kasikazini, kunze kwe lipanzia. <verse eid="EXO 40:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EXO 40:23" />Mchanya mwake weka pfighate ipfilapfighwe kwe IMNDEWA ka IMNDEWA pfayamlaghitse Musa. <verse eid="EXO 40:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EXO 40:24" />Tsakeka chighutso che pfitasa mghati mwa Lihema lyo Kwitinganila, ubali wa kusini, chelolesa ne imetsa. <verse eid="EXO 40:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EXO 40:25" />Kuya kapfituwa pfitasa pfake hambele he IMNDEWA ka IMNDEWA pfayamlaghitse. <verse eid="EXO 40:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EXO 40:26" />Tsakalika lisanduku lye nzahabu mna Lihema, hambele ha lipanzia, <verse eid="EXO 40:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EXO 40:27" />na kufukitsa upfumba iunung'ila ghoya mchanya mwake ka IMNDEWA pfayamlaghitse. <verse eid="EXO 40:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EXO 40:28" />Kuya tsakalika lipanzia lilebele lidiwe ghumlango ghwa Lihema lyo Kwitinganila, <verse eid="EXO 40:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="EXO 40:29" />na hambele ha ghumlango ghwa Lihema keka lisanduku lyo kulapfila nambiko tsa kulakatsighwa, mchanya mwake tsakalapfa nambiko tsa kulakatsigwa na nambiko tsa usaghe ka IMNDEWA pfayamlaghitse. <verse eid="EXO 40:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="EXO 40:30" />Tsakeka bigha lya kuhopfughila haghati ha Lihema lya Kwitinganila na lisanduku lya kulapfila nambiko tsa kulakatsighwa, kuya kaghela ghamatsi gha kuhopfughila. <verse eid="EXO 40:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="EXO 40:31" />Kwa ghamatsi'gho Musa na Aruni hamwe na iwanaghe wose tsawahopfugha ghamoko na ghmaghulu ghawo, <verse eid="EXO 40:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="EXO 40:32" />chila mala hawengile mghati mwa Lihema lya Kwitinganila au hawaseghelele lisanduku lyo kutambikila tsawehopfugha ka IMNDEWA pfayalaghitse Musa. <verse eid="EXO 40:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="EXO 40:33" />Kuya Musa hamwe ne iwanu watsenga luwa kutsunguluka Lihema lya Kwitinganila na lisanduku lya kulapfila nambiko tsa kulakatsighwa na kwika lipanzia hane ghumlango ghwe luwa. Apfo Musa ne iwanu waimalitsa ing'onde yose.<verse eid="EXO 40:33" /></para>
  <para style="s">Libingu mchanya mwe Lihema lyo Kwitinganila</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="EXO 40:34" />Kuya bingu tsalighubika Lihema lyo kwitinganila, na ghumwanga ghumwelukamweluka ghwe IMNDEWA tsa ghumema mna Lihema. <verse eid="EXO 40:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="EXO 40:35" />Naye Musa ng'adahile baye kwingila mghati mwa Lihema lyo kwitinganila kwaapfila libingu'lyo tsalikala mchanya mwake, na ghumwanga ighumwelukamweluka ghwe Imulungu tsaghumema amwo. <verse eid="EXO 40:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="EXO 40:36" />Mna ghumwanza ghwao ghose iwana wa Isiraeli ng'awenuke woke baye mbaka wone libingu linuka kulawa mchanya mwa Lihema lya Kwitinganila. <verse eid="EXO 40:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="EXO 40:37" />Lekeni ka libingu ng'alinuke baye, nawo ng'awanduse ghumwanza baye, tsawabeta mbaka linuke. <verse eid="EXO 40:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="EXO 40:38" />Nemisi waisiraeli tsawang'ali wolyona libingu lila lya IMNDEWA mchanya mwa Lihema lyo Kwitinganila, na nechilo moto ghung'alighukwaka mchanya mwe Lihema mna ghumwanza ghwao ghose.<verse eid="EXO 40:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 40" />
</usx>